  '2-days-delhi-agra-private-tour-with-sunrise-taj': {
    averageRating: 4.93,
    totalReviews: 17,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Gabriela", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-06-09", text: "We loved this tour! Ashik and Pankaj were wonderful, showed us all the beautiful sites we were looking to visit, and gave the extra mile by taking amazing pictures of us and telling super interesting facts. The hotel (we went for the 5* option) was very nice too, super clean, and offered delicious Indian and international food. Highly recommended!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/2-days-delhi-agra-private-tour-with-sunrise-taj/566416/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/2-days-delhi-agra-private-tour-with-sunrise-taj/566417/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-06-25", text: "It all went well and smooth. I have good guides and Imran and Nikhil and a very dependable driver Raul. Highly recommended", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/2-days-delhi-agra-private-tour-with-sunrise-taj/631126/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/2-days-delhi-agra-private-tour-with-sunrise-taj/631129/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Kristina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-25", text: "I had a really nice tour in Taj Mahal with Varun. It was important for me to take the tour at my own pase and have enough time to take pictures which Varun was trying to accommodation to his best. He also took magnificent pictures of me at iconic places which I like a lot. He was explaining me well the history of Taj Mahal and was always making sure I am happy with the tour. My driver Pradeep was also very nice, talkative and attentive. I can recommend this tour." },
      { author: "James", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-19", text: "Aamir was a great guide. Very knowledgeable and changed our perception on the history of Taj Mahal which are myths in the country I’m from." },
      { author: "Marta", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-05-08", text: "The trip is worth to consider because of peace of mide it gives you. We were looked after from the first minutes in Delhi. Our driver Pankaj, the kindness man I have ever met, was waiting for us on big and busy airport and brought us to our hotel. He listened carrefully and created save atmospher, he joked and was everytime we needed him. I just can't immagine the better person around us during this trip. The guide in Delhi, Wesimm took us to the most important monuments and we have a lot of fun woth him. His English skills was very good and we enjoyed our time with him. In Agra we got the Merlot hotel which was, friendly Staff and excellend cooks but the best expiriences we had with our tour guide Vinny. His English was perfect and knowlage was amazing. He knew answer for every question and showed us unexpected places from where we could take photos and what more- He was taking photos like a real pro. He showed us places we coulndn't even immagine and was very friendly and patient." },
      { author: "Shiraz", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-04-14", text: "Did this tour about a week or so ago. Punkaj was an incredible driver. Super friendly and helpful throughout the entire journey. Khan was a great guide for Agra. He was super knowledgable and helpful. Would def recommend this tour." },
      { author: "Emilie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-12-21", text: "I loved this tour, my friendly driver and professional tour guides! I’d gladly recommend this to anyone. First, Pankaj, my driver (always on time, very safe driver) picked me up at my hotel in Delhi, taking me to Agra. Then Shumit met me at the hotel and we went to the Agra Fort, and it was very professional, didn’t need to stand in line, just went through. Then the “garden” behind Taj Mahal, which was a great start to ease into the experience of Taj Mahal. In the morning before sunrise we went to see the real deal, and it was amazing. Shumit was not just a knowledgeable guide, he’s also a great photographer. Going back to Delhi I met up with Vijay, a charming and personal guide, and I loved that. He went above and beyond to make me have a good experience. After several hours seeing the big important things in Delhi, Pankaj drove me to my hotel. If there’s one thing that I would comment on is that it says in the tour that it’s guaranteed a 5 star hotel, but mine was only 4." },
      { author: "Diego", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-12-09", text: "Not only was Vinny personable, kind, and funny, he was also INCREDIBLY knowledgeable in getting around, connecting us with skilled peoples, and having special access to many of the attractions. Vinny is undeniably a local icon and his connections will give you the VIP experience. He also knew a great deal about the actual history. Although his information was delivered very quickly he also took time to answer questions and go back to points of note. I couldn't recommend him enough. Truly. Beyond the attractions he did a great job arranging transport and hotel. Very pleased with the coordination and logistics." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-14", text: "I had an amazing and very safe experience visiting the Taj Mahal and Agra Fort with Winnie as a single girl traveler. From the beginning, Winnie was very professional, respectful, and caring, which made me feel completely comfortable and secure throughout the tour. He has excellent knowledge of history and explained everything about the Taj Mahal and Agra Fort in a very interesting and easy way. He also helped me get beautiful photos, showing the best spots and angles. As a solo female traveler, safety is very important to me, and Winnie made sure I was always safe, relaxed, and happy. He never rushed the tour and was very patient and polite. If you are a single girl, solo traveler, or family, I highly recommend Winnie. He is truly one of the best guides in Agra. Thank you, Winnie, for making my Taj Mahal and Agra Fort visit memorable and special!" },
      { author: "Raphael Henrique de Araujo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-14", text: "O guia Karan é excelente, nos explicou com muitos detalhes todos os monumentos. Tínhamos uma expectativa não construída até então, mas com certeza, a experiência foi surpreendente. Indico a todos o tour. Ficamos com vontade de voltar a Índia para explorar os monumentos e histórias ainda não vistas." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-23", text: "Vinny was an energetic tour guide. Sunset tour of the Taj Mahal was great, with good mix of facts and photo ops. He knew all the best spots and was able to cut the lines for us. His English was good for explaining the history. Would recommend." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2024-11-16", text: "It was fantastic, though the Delhi Air was not favourable. Both the Delhi and Agra tour was so nice and beautiful, thanks to the Driver Salin and both guides Anas and Majid.!! See you again." },
    ],
  },
