  '5-days-golden-triangle-tour-from-delhi': {
    averageRating: 4.75,
    totalReviews: 5,
    guideRating: 4.75,
    valueRating: 4.75,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Satchi", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-22", text: "We used this company for our trip to Delhi, Agra and Jaipur tour.. We were really surprised by how well they were all organized. Their local guide had great knowledge about the historical monuments and was really dedicated and motivated. Their guide in Delhi Brajesh Kumar and Kaleem in Agro and Hitesh in Jaipur did everything for us from start to finish. Big thanks to their driver who drove safely the whole way. Thanks to the whole team. We look forward to using you in the future. Once again THANK YOU!!" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-18", text: "Unvergessliche Reise durch das Goldene Dreieck Unsere fünftägige Rundreise mit Agra Voyage durch Delhi, Agra und Jaipur war rundum gelungen! Alles war hervorragend organisiert, pünktlich und wie vereinbart. Auch unser Wunsch nach Sightseeing und authentischen Erlebnissen wurde perfekt berücksichtigt. Die Betreuung durch den Veranstalter war jederzeit sehr gut – täglich wurde per WhatsApp nach unserem Befinden gefragt. Ein großes Dankeschön an unseren Fahrer Jeetendra: zuverlässig, sicher, pünktlich und immer hilfsbereit. In Delhi hat uns Tirthraj auf Deutsch wunderbar in Indien eingeführt. In Agra begeisterte uns Ramviar mit seinem großen Wissen über Geschichte, Religion, Land und Leute und nahm sich viel Zeit für unsere Fragen. Fatehpur Sikri war mit seiner authentischen Atmosphäre und den vielen Einheimischen am Sonntag ein Highlight. Besonders schön: unser Guide machte dort tolle Fotos von uns! Jaipur mit Tahir war ebenfalls besonders. Wir fühlten uns wie Gäste bei einem Einhei" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-01-05", text: "ゴールデン・トライアングル以外も追加で見積もりしてもらって、行くことが出来た。国内の宅急便も出せて助かった。全参加者に運転手gudduの評判が良かった。 (なお、他の人のレビューにあるように、どの街でも高価なお土産屋さんに立ち寄ります。また、体調により観光地やレストランをスキップしたいというとガイドにより嫌な顔をされるときがあります)" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2024-12-17", text: "We did this tour and really enjoyed meeting Guddu. He was an exceptional driver, we felt safe whenever we stepped in the car. Glad we were in the same journey. Throughout the tour, we had 4 guides, each per destination. The first guide wasn’t very detailed in his explanations, but the rest were really insightful and knowledgeable. So overall, it was fine. On the way to Jaipur they didn’t bring us to one of the sights - the stepwell, since we were tired we decided not to fight it again and we went to another stepwell the day after. One thing to watch out for is that they drive you to over-priced tourist shops in between visits. This was not mentioned in the tour description and it’s hard to skip them, and shopkeepers tend to be pushy and rude if you don’t get anything. Another thing we didn’t appreciate was being ambushed by a tour operator representative and being pushed to write a positive review or else they wouldn’t let us continue with our tour" },
    ],
  },
