  'agra-guided-street-food-local-market-tour-by-tuk': {
    averageRating: 5.0,
    totalReviews: 3,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Jana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-23", text: "We had an AMAZING experience at this guided tour. Everything was perfect and we have no complaints. Our guide was Pawan and he truely made this evening unforgettable. He was an amazing tour guide who knew everything about the town agra and showed us multiple local markets, was patient with our requests and gave us a private tour through the villages culture. He was able to communicate in multiple languages and was very well informed about the town Agra and made an effort to show us the local life. In the end of the Tour he took us to his own home and introduced us to his family, who were absolutely lovely and we were so happy to meet a local family in Agra. This tour was way more than we expected from our Booking. I highly recommend booking the Tour with our Guide Pawan and the Tuk Tuk driver Shivam, who also did an amazing job at picking us iup directly from the hotel and was with us the whole night. This tour is out of this world and I wish anyone visiting Agra a Guide like Pawan!!!" },
      { author: "Rudy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-01", text: "Our fantastic guide Aasef first took us to the bustling old town market and to the quieter southern market, where we tasted some delicious street food. Aasef is a great tour guide, born in Agra and knows the markets well. He also had some interesting background stories to tell. Highly recommended!" },
      { author: "Priscilla", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-08", text: "Zuned fue un guía excelente para mostrar con mucha paciencia todos los lugares que recorrimos. Se los recomiendo 1000%. Quedamos muy contentos." },
    ],
  },
  'agra-guided-tour-of-taj-mahal-agra-fort-and': {
    averageRating: 4.75,
    totalReviews: 83,
    guideRating: 4.64,
    valueRating: 4.77,
    reviews: [
      { author: "JOSE", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-19", text: "Salamat Kahn is a very informative guide, who takes care of his guests- pictures, history behind every corner, etc. The tour has been very nice and complete.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-guided-tour-of-taj-mahal-agra-fort-and/3470426/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Steve", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-15", text: "Overall we had an excellent day all due to the trip being planned out very well by the tour company . Our guide Iqrar was very knowledgeable, spoke good English & managed the Taj tour flawlessly. He even times our entry when the crowds was less in the monument , along with knowing the right spots to take the best photos . Anish was our tour guide at Fatehpur Sikri and he too was excellent , knowledgeable , hilarious and great at photography Can’t miss Bhagat Singh our excellent driver , was always on time and managed our travel well too. Only feedback is that option of food selection should be corrected while selection as it’s not at the Courtyard Marriott’s and we ended up at Bon Barbecue .", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-guided-tour-of-taj-mahal-agra-fort-and/1962560/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-guided-tour-of-taj-mahal-agra-fort-and/1962561/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-guided-tour-of-taj-mahal-agra-fort-and/1962562/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Bill", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-10-13", text: "It was really an amazing day trip having Abdul as our tour guide and Bhagat Singh as the driver. They were very patient and accommodating all throughout our tour. Learned a lot about Taj Mahal and Agra Fort. The car is also clean and air-conditioned. Abdul is also super pro-active in taking picture of us. Recommended.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-guided-tour-of-taj-mahal-agra-fort-and/1273447/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-guided-tour-of-taj-mahal-agra-fort-and/1273448/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-guided-tour-of-taj-mahal-agra-fort-and/1273457/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Claudia Sarahí", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-11", text: "Ha sido unq buena experiencia y buen servicio. Se cumplió con todo el literario en tiempo y forma.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-guided-tour-of-taj-mahal-agra-fort-and/7105036/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Cecilia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-16", text: "Great experience visiting Agra and Fatehpur Sikri. Everyone was very professional, friendly and helpful throughout the tour. A special mention to our driver Bhagat, who was extremely patient, spoke excellent English and went out of his way to help us find the right pick-up point for our bus after the tour. Definitely recommended!" },
      { author: "Liz", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-20", text: "Bhagat and Imitiaz were great hosts. Lots of great photos taken and information given. They do take you to a few souvenir places which are more pricey than the local markets. Overall a great experience." },
      { author: "Céline", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-29", text: "this was great! the driver was very helpful and kind, he arranged everything we needed and even recommended some good other places to go, he was happy to keep the car silent or when we asked he showed us some Indian music. he recommended a restaurant for lunch and I think I would have liked it even more if he had offered either a traditional restaurant or something European friendly as he took us to a very nice Indian restaurant buy you could tell it mainly caters to white people (like us) because the food has no spice and I would have loved to have tried something very traditional for Northern India. However this did not take away from our amazing day and I really want to thank Bhagat Singh and all the tour guides who went out of the way to make everything very special, take plenty of photos and give really investing information about the history of these monuments" },
      { author: "Martino", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-26", text: "Mohammed was a great guide for the day. Very knowledgeable and open to questions and sharing curiosities." },
      { author: "Sanat", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-14", text: "Bhagat Singh the driver for the trip was extremely punctual and patient. Salamat Khan the guide gave historical insights about the monuments in a lucid manner. Both were well mannered individuals." },
      { author: "Miguel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-22", text: "Our guide Mohamed was amazing. Not to extensive, not to short. Showed us and told us unique curiosities about Taj Mahal. For sure the best way to do it." },
      { author: "Benjamin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-27", text: "I really enjoyed the whole experience. Iqrar was an experienced and knowledgeable guide, with lots to share about the Taj Mahal! Bhagat was a comfortable and courteous driver throughout the day. Sumit Kumar had lots of great info to share at Fatehpur Sikri" },
      { author: "Mark", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-13", text: "Very good and knowledgeable. Explained everything and took lots of pictures for us. Great time" },
    ],
  },
