    reviews: [
      { author: "Enzo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-23", text: "Shiv, the driver, was punctual & communìcated very well as I couldn’t locate him initially. He is very courteous & is a professional driver. We arrived in advance of the show which allowed me to relax. The show itself was absolutely amazing!!!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-mohabbat-the-taj-show-tickets-and-agra-transf/4352139/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Iana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-24", text: "It was absolutely amazing evening with great show!The transfer came very punctual and did wait us till the end of show! Nice car with air conditions too. Highly recommended! Iana.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-mohabbat-the-taj-show-tickets-and-agra-transf/3944984/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Leonardo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-11-09", text: "Spettacolo interessante (leggero, stile Bollywood), autista puntuale, biglietti in prima fila. Unico neo selezionata audioguida in francese invece era disponibile solamente in inglese.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-mohabbat-the-taj-show-tickets-and-agra-transf/4551685/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Kamil", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-02-16", text: "Smooth transfer and organization. Would be awesome to get some confirmation an hour before or so." },
      { author: "Anke", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-02-19", text: "Nice show with beautiful costumes. Got a great seat - even booking very last minute. Baba, the driver, made sure everything went smoothly and was there on time to pick me up after the show." },
      { author: "Desiree", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-02-13", text: "The communication from the tour company was great. Driver super nice. I loved the costumes. I wish there was a little more background on the story of how they fell in love as opposed to just showing them in love." },
      { author: "François", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-25", text: "il FAUT absolument voir ce spectacle. C'est juste magnifique : les danses, les tenues, les chorégraphies, les décors : tout est magnifique. Et le must: c'est traduit en 9 langues dont le Français. Quant à l'organisation, rien à dire : tout est ponctuel même si on ne parle pas l'anglais. No stress. Ce spectacle est le complément Indispensable à la visite de AGRA." },
      { author: "EMMA", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-23", text: "Spettacolo molto molto consigliato!" },
      { author: "Faniry", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2025-08-19", text: "Si vous souhaitez que sister a ce spectacle, je vous conseille de vous rendre sur place et d’acheter le billet directement à la billetterie puis prendre un tuk tuk ou Uber pour vous y rendre. C’est 10 fois moins cher. Sinon le spectacle était majestueux. Nous qui avons fait la visite le jour même. Tout a pris son sens." },
      { author: "Dyandra", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-15", text: "Super expérience , très beau spectacle . Cela permet de bien comprendre l’histoire avec en plus l audio guide en français. Transport nickel mais un peu cher." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-15", text: "Wonderful show Smooth organisation Great and friendly driver" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-02-13", text: "Magnifique" },
    ],
