  'agra-skip-the-line-taj-mahal-agra-private-tour-tour': {
    averageRating: 4.99,
    totalReviews: 83,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 4.99,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Jennivieve", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-03", text: "Imran was an excellent guide. He was knowledgeable, kind, prompt and considerate. He made us feel at ease and helped us not only understand the history but also the daily life of modern people in the region. The driver and food were excellent as well. I do think that advertising the fact that folks with be taken to handicraft shops should be included with an option to skip these if desired. Highest praise for Imran though & his photography skills are spot on!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-skip-the-line-taj-mahal-agra-private-tour-tour/4807699/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Florian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-02", text: "**Fantastic Taj Mahal Tour with Guide Jugnu!** Our tour of the Taj Mahal in Agra with guide Jugnu was absolutely incredible! From the moment we met, Jugnu’s passion for history and deep knowledge of the monument made the experience truly special. Jugnu explained the fascinating stories behind the Taj Mahal’s architecture, the love story of Shah Jahan and Mumtaz Mahal, and even pointed out hidden details we would have missed on our own. Their storytelling brought the monument to life, making the visit so much more meaningful. What stood out was Jugnu’s patience and enthusiasm—they answered all our questions, took amazing photos for us, and ensured we were comfortable throughout the tour. Their friendly and professional demeanor made the whole experience enjoyable and stress-free. If you’re visiting the Taj Mahal, I highly recommend Jugnu as your guide. You’ll leave with not just beautiful pictures, but also a deeper appreciation of this wonder of the world.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-skip-the-line-taj-mahal-agra-private-tour-tour/2261966/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Mattia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-27", text: "Mohamed the guide is from AGRA, the best guide that I ever had in my life, knew every corner of the city and of the Taj Mahal, making it a memorable experience. Thanks to all the team.💪", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-skip-the-line-taj-mahal-agra-private-tour-tour/2227113/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Jennifer", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-25", text: "Awesome guide, he was very funny and very informative. Gave us lots of great information about the Taj Mahal and the baby Taj and he was very professional and kind. I would highly recommend Imran.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-skip-the-line-taj-mahal-agra-private-tour-tour/2211005/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-skip-the-line-taj-mahal-agra-private-tour-tour/2211006/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-skip-the-line-taj-mahal-agra-private-tour-tour/2211007/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Ceri-jane", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-20", text: "Just AWESOME!!! THE best tour ever!! Imran helped us not to queue, take photos without crowds around, gave us more info than any of the other guides did. You MUST do this tour! ⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-skip-the-line-taj-mahal-agra-private-tour-tour/2176677/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-skip-the-line-taj-mahal-agra-private-tour-tour/2176681/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-skip-the-line-taj-mahal-agra-private-tour-tour/2176682/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Janis", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-08", text: "We were picked up at 5:45 at our hotel. Our guide Imran explained a lot about the Taj Mahal itself, the Agra Fort and about the Baby Taj. He also took plenty of very nice photos of us so we can remember the day and also seeing the magic Taj Mahal. Further, the guide as well as the driver were flexible to go back the hotel to change clothes, go to a coffee shop etc. We would therefore highly recommend taking the tour with Imran! Thank you a lot :)", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-skip-the-line-taj-mahal-agra-private-tour-tour/2095303/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Lily", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-06", text: "Absolutely fantastic would highly recommend! Our tour guide Muhammad Taria was brilliant so informative and was so good taking photos of us it was unreal!! Our driver Deshraj was super welcoming came straight to our accommodation, was super friendly and a safe driver. Would recommend these two 10/10 experience.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-skip-the-line-taj-mahal-agra-private-tour-tour/2082468/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-skip-the-line-taj-mahal-agra-private-tour-tour/2082469/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-skip-the-line-taj-mahal-agra-private-tour-tour/2082470/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Colin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-02", text: "Zeeshan very knowledgeable, very good man Knows all the best photo opportunities and takes great photos on our phones Memories that will last a lifetime", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-skip-the-line-taj-mahal-agra-private-tour-tour/2057447/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-skip-the-line-taj-mahal-agra-private-tour-tour/2057448/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Molly", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-29", text: "Fitzo was an amazing tour guide he took care of everything including our entries and brought us to a great restaurant. As a group of females we felt very safe and he was very informative. Would highly recommend booking this tour great value for money and get your guide is a trusted platform." },
      { author: "Vidya", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-08", text: "Moon was our guide who was punctual , patient, very knowledgeable and we had an amazing tour , we may have known the effort that went into the detailing of the fine art and type of stones that went into building of Taj Mahal , also helped clear some of the myths my children heard about it . We would certainly choose him if we were to come back to visit Agra ." },
      { author: "Tomás", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-07", text: "Tour was great and went smoothly! Farman (our guide) was super nice and easygoing! Highly recommend!" },
      { author: "Shriyani", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-06", text: "Shakib was an excellent guide and a great human being. He was friendly, enthusiastic and knew a lot about the Taj and its associated history. Bonus points he is an amazing photographer and helped me and my friend click amazing shots of the Taj. would not look anywhere else for a guide in Agra!" },
    ],
  },
