    reviews: [
      { author: "Shay", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-25", text: "Our guide Mr. Nekram was informative and knowledgeable about history of India. We had a perfect tour with him, he came on time was very kind and nice to us.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-taj-mahal-and-mausoleum-guided-tour-with-skip/6830540/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Bruno", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-04", text: "Abdul is very nice and knows a lot about history. We had an amazing time with him and left the tour very impressed and happy", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-taj-mahal-and-mausoleum-guided-tour-with-skip/4497280/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Lucia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-27", text: "Let me just tell you: this was SUCH a beautiful experience. Our guide Immy told us EVERYTHING about the Taj Mahal. He made sure we understood all the tiny details about the architecture, history and culture. And not only that - he picked us up and showed us around, even to the Persian carpet market!! I really enjoyed (woman, 27 years old).", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-taj-mahal-and-mausoleum-guided-tour-with-skip/4402572/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Taylor", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-25", text: "Immy was really good and gave us clear information of the Taj Mahal. Totally recommended!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-taj-mahal-and-mausoleum-guided-tour-with-skip/4369587/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Andrea", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-11", text: "The guide Masood was very friendly and explain everything in details! The pick up was in time and the driver was very confortable as well! The tour last for about 2h and was very smooth!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-taj-mahal-and-mausoleum-guided-tour-with-skip/4175879/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-taj-mahal-and-mausoleum-guided-tour-with-skip/4175880/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Gracie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-22", text: "Really good tour with Immy! Pickup was easy and the tour was very in depth and we felt well looked after. We arrived just in time for gates opening which was good. Immy took lots of photos of us and he really knew the spots to go to. He also knew how to manage the crowds and made sure we were kept moving etc. he knew his history really well and clearly was very knowledgable in the area.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-taj-mahal-and-mausoleum-guided-tour-with-skip/3901987/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Yogesh", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-11", text: "I booked this tour for my parents and they took care of them so well. Everything went well right from the booking, communication, sharing of trip details well in advance, on time pickup , guided tour and end of the trip. Imran Ji was the guide who handled everything so well, i can imagine there must be a great team behind all of this. Highly Recommended!!!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-taj-mahal-and-mausoleum-guided-tour-with-skip/3732354/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-taj-mahal-and-mausoleum-guided-tour-with-skip/3732355/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-taj-mahal-and-mausoleum-guided-tour-with-skip/3732357/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Yuri", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-14", text: "It was my first time in India and I didn't even know how to get out of Agra airport, but my guide waited patiently for me at the bus stop and he made me immediately comfortable! The drive was smooth, AC worked great and my guide was not only knowledgeable but also a great photographer as well. (I shall say he was better than any photographers present on the premise of Taj Mahal.) I shall not forget the sunset I saw with the guide sitting on the old marble of Taj Mahal - it was a truly lovely experience. The stops made at carpet and jewelry shops afterwards seemed rather unnecessary, but I was not forced to buy anything and I enjoyed talking with a jewelry shop owner (Mr. Amit) as well. Overall it was a wonderful experience, with skip the line tickets proving useful at every step of the way. Thank you!!" },
      { author: "Simona", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-14", text: "Emmy was very professional and very prepared about Taj Mahal history. Also, he takes nice photos!" },
      { author: "Lindsay", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-21", text: "Shabab khan was an excellent guide! He was very knowledgeable and helpful on our tour. Our 5 year old really liked him. He was full of interesting facts and very witty. 5 stars!" },
      { author: "Nima", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-16", text: "Our tour of the Taj Mahal at sunrise was exceptional. Our tour guide Varun Gupta was professional, on time for our pick up, and super friendly and informative. We were able to navigate thru the lines at the Taj seamlessly and had ample time to view the Taj from afar and up close. He took some amazing photos of us near the Taj and was so patient with ensuring that perfect shots were captured for this once in a lifetime experience. Thank you Varun for an amazing experience. We would highly recommend him !" },
      { author: "Sharon", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-03", text: "Our guide Abdul Majid was really knowledgeable, he took great pictures and was very helpful. Our driver was also really nice but the car sent was too small, we are 3 people and the guide but a small car was sent and we found it very challenging to sit four people in the car." },
    ],
