  'agra-taj-mahal-skip-the-line-sunrise-tour': {
    averageRating: 5.0,
    totalReviews: 26,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-27", text: "Our visit to the Taj Mahal was made truly unforgettable, all thanks to our fantastic guide, Vinny! Vinny not only guided us through the rich history and architectural wonders of the monument, but he also ensured we skipped all the long lines, saving us so much time and hassle. His insider knowledge allowed us to avoid the crowds and get straight to the heart of the experience. What really stood out about Vinny was his genuine and humble nature. He wasn’t just a guide – he was a true host. He knew all the best spots for stunning, Instagram-worthy photos and videos, and took the time to capture them for us with a professional eye. We walked away with some amazing photos that will forever remind us of this once-in-a-lifetime experience. Vinny's friendly and attentive demeanor made us feel comfortable throughout, always ensuring everything was to our liking! Definitely book this guide and ask for Vinny, you will not be disappointed!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-taj-mahal-skip-the-line-sunrise-tour/1858235/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-taj-mahal-skip-the-line-sunrise-tour/1858236/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-taj-mahal-skip-the-line-sunrise-tour/1858237/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-07", text: "Vinny is the best guide I have ever had, he puts in an incredible amount of effort and you can tell in every fiber of his body that he loves the Taj Mahal and his job. He answers all your questions and takes the best photos ever. He knows the best places for photos, knows everything about the Taj Mahal and is very funny and helpful.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-taj-mahal-skip-the-line-sunrise-tour/1762248/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-taj-mahal-skip-the-line-sunrise-tour/1762249/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Juan Santiago Molina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-08-25", text: "I recently had the absolute pleasure of exploring the Taj Mahal with Vinny as my guide, and it was an experience I’ll never forget. From the moment we met, Vinny's enthusiasm and deep knowledge of the site were evident. He didn’t just take me to the Taj Mahal—he showed me the most stunning spots for photos that I would have never found on my own. Each picture he suggested was perfectly framed and captured the beauty of the monument like a postcard. But Vinny’s expertise didn’t stop there. Throughout the tour, he provided the best recommendations, whether it was the ideal time to visit certain areas to avoid the crowds or tips on what local delicacies to try. He truly went above and beyond to ensure my experience was top-notch. At the end of the day Vinny surprised me by inviting me to enjoy a lassi together. He clearly loves his job. If you’re visiting the Taj Mahal, having Vinny as your guide will make your visit unforgettable. Highly, highly recommended!" },
      { author: "Saúl", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-05-11", text: "I really enjoyed the tour!! He really helped us to skip the line several times and took amazing pictures from our mobile, best tour guide in Agra" },
      { author: "Bipin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-04-27", text: "Imran was an extremely knowledgeable guide. Very prompt and loads of information about the Taj Mahal and the Mughal rule in general. Very polite and took his time to explain all questions, doubts and myths about that era. If you do book thru GetMyGuide, ask for Imran. You won’t be disappointed." },
      { author: "Cynthia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-04-27", text: "Loved Vinny’s enthusiasm and energy that he brings. Not only is he passionate about what he does, he’s also very knowledgeable. He’s also famous in Agra so it was easy for us to understand the true Agra." },
      { author: "Erica", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-02-29", text: "We really enjoyed his presence and service…it was a nice time! He took very nice pictures of us as well!" },
      { author: "Amun", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-02-29", text: "BEST GUIDE EVER ...VERY PROFESSIONAL AND TAKES BEAUTIFUL PICTURES" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-20", text: "Vinny was very informative and explained everything nicely. He also helped out my parents!!!" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-05", text: "Very knowledgeable" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-16", text: "Vinny was above and beyond with this amazing Taj Mahal Tour. He was very efficient and contacted me before the activity so all information was cleared. since we met at the airport he was super helpful and gave me so many tips about things to do and see in the City. Services were provided on time, driver was at the meeting point before! the Taj Mahal tour was absolutely amazing, we were able to save so much time thanks to his recommendations. He is clearly knowledgeable in all the interesting facts about Taj and besides the spots he suggested for pictures were absolutely top notch. not too crowded and with the best views. I will definetely recommend his services whenever you are in Agra." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-09", text: "Immy was an excellent guide! Very knowledgeable and kind! Thank you very much for your time and your smile!" },
    ],
  },
