  'akshardham-temple-light-water-show-with-oldnew': {
    averageRating: 4.57,
    totalReviews: 5,
    guideRating: 4.57,
    valueRating: 4.57,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Wilson", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-15", text: "Visiting the Akshardham Temple was a truly memorable experience. The temple itself is breathtaking, and my guide Chetan was excellent, knowledgeable, engaging, and very helpful in explaining the history and significance in clear English, which made the visit much more meaningful. The evening light and water show was spectacular and exceeded my expectations. The storytelling, music, and visuals came together beautifully and were a highlight of the visit. Driver virpal very skillful for the Old Delhi traffic. Overall, I would highly recommend a visit for its stunning architecture,a cultural depth, and wonderful light show.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/akshardham-temple-light-water-show-with-oldnew/4909749/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/akshardham-temple-light-water-show-with-oldnew/4909750/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Katatip", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-12", text: "It is a very good tour. The driver, Mr.Pankaj, is polite. And the guide, Mr.Chetan, is knowledgable and supportive. I feel safe and impressed with the tour and two staff." },
      { author: "Sandra", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-26", text: "this tour was awesome and having 2 personal guides i was very well informed of everything we saw and went to, all the activities inc the light and water show were so good. I would highly recommend taking this tour with Pankaj and Mickey I felt safe and well looked after as a solo female traveller too." },
      { author: "Zulima", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-15", text: "Muy agradecida con el guía Mohammed pudo ajustar el tour al poco tiempo que tenía debido a que tenía ajustar para estar a tiempo en el hotel ya que tenía mi vuelo de regreso. Fuimos a la mezquita Jama Masjid , pasamos por Chandni Chowk y pudimos ir al templo Akshardham que es hermoso y uno de los mayores hinduistas en Delhi. El guía me acompañó y el chofer nos esperó y me llevó de regreso al hotel no podía quedarme al show de luces pero valió muchísimo la pena el tour, fue en español y ajustaron el tour al tiempo que tenía, fue un tour privado en el cual nos movilizamos por el viejo Delhi en rickshaw y en auto con conductor. Lo recomiendo" },
      { author: "Melissa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2025-12-09", text: "The places are good, i think that is better the old Delhi that the new one but of you have time is interesting the Akshardbam es impressive but not históric, have just 20 years, the Guide was ok. I ask for a spanish Guide but he Dont speak good spanish, He was barely understandable. I ask him for didnt make some points of the list but he just no understand me no in english and neither in spanish. Over the end I said that I shoud go back, because i need connect go to conect a meeting, and he said that he paid for the full ticket, how i should feel obligate to made everythung, by the way it was included in the tour. So, te tour is find, aceptable" },
    ],
  },
