  'all-inclusive-jodhpur-full-or-half-day': {
    averageRating: 5.0,
    totalReviews: 4,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Maria", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-16", text: "Sunny is an excellent guide who made Jodhpur a memorable experience. He has a combination of an academic background combined with local knowledge, insight and sharing of childhood experiences. The future of tourism in this city is in good hands when a young man is so passionate about it. He quickly asssed my fields of interests and personilzed the tour accordingly. He speaks English effortlessly. His approach is professional, but warm hearted. Thank you Sunny for an enjoyable day and sharing your knowledge and time so generously. Highly recommend.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/all-inclusive-jodhpur-full-or-half-day/4917016/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/all-inclusive-jodhpur-full-or-half-day/4917017/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/all-inclusive-jodhpur-full-or-half-day/4917018/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-29", text: "We had a wonderful full-day tour of Jodhpur with Sunil Kumar. He was an excellent guide who made the day very enjoyable and informative, sharing the history of the area in an engaging and easy-to-follow way. We visited Mehrangarh Fort, Jaswant Thada, and the Umaid Bhawan, all of which were fascinating and well explained. Sunil also took us to a local textile house where we saw traditional print designs, which was a really nice addition to the tour. Overall, it was a thoroughly enjoyable day and a great way to see Jodhpur. I would highly recommend this tour and Sunil as a guide." },
    ],
  },
