  'delhi-6-day-private-golden-triangle-tour-with': {
    averageRating: 4.91,
    totalReviews: 13,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Amy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-14", text: "5* Golden Triangle Tour As 2 female travellers we felt really safe having our driver Sanjay with us at all times- he was excellent and looked after us so well, staying with us even when we asked to do additional activities. We also had a different tour guide in each city to show us the monuments and they were very good but Sanjay was with us from arriving at the airport until the end of the tour- he showed us a different side of life in India, taking us via rural villages on the drives between cities. He speaks very good English and was reliable, so friendly and attentive to our needs. The 5* hotels included were all very good, especially Shahpura House in Jaipur. We had a WhatsApp group with the tour company (and Sanjay) and they checked in with us there several times a day to ensure everything was going well. The tour was incredible- the guides especially Ram (Agra) took amazing photos of us as they know all the good spots as well as sharing so much information about the history", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-6-day-private-golden-triangle-tour-with/4610498/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-6-day-private-golden-triangle-tour-with/4610499/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-6-day-private-golden-triangle-tour-with/4610500/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Emily", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-27", text: "We thoroughly enjoyed our 7-day Golden Triangle and Ranthambore tour organised by Mr Harpreet Singh and Travel India One Day. We opted for the 3 star option and all hotels were good but the highlights were the Lily Pool in Jaipur and Yash Villas in Ranthambore. Guides were included if we needed them for sightseeing. In many cases we preferred just to walk around the monuments ourselves which was also fine but were told the main points and things to be careful of by our driver Kool. Our driver Kool (Mr Kuljeet Singh) was brilliant. Friendly, helpful and good fun to be around. We had a comfortable, clean, air conditioned car and were driven safely everywhere. On the trip Kool gave us honest recommendations of where to visit, eat and shop (and more importantly, where to avoid). He was happy to stop off and take us to ATMs, pharmacy’s and liquor shop if needed. We thought the trip was great value for money and would highly recommend Travel India One Day, Harpreet Singh and Kool.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-6-day-private-golden-triangle-tour-with/2038272/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-6-day-private-golden-triangle-tour-with/2038273/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-6-day-private-golden-triangle-tour-with/2038274/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Magnus Fage", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-09", text: "The tour was a great experience, and the guides were fantastic! I would highly recommend!" },
      { author: "Alan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-17", text: "Our driver Gulshan was brilliant, driving through Delhi is no mean feat. His boss Harpreet Singh checked in throughout the trip. We saw so much during our trip, the guides in each city were very informative and the accommodations were first class. Thank you for an excellent trip." },
      { author: "Mary", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-14", text: "Sanjay was a fantastic driver for the whole of the time we were with him. He drove confidently and safely, always paying attention to everything going on around us. Sanjay ensured we got into the car and left the car every time with a new bottle of water. Sanjay continually checked if we needed a rest break and when we did he chose places that were clean and we felt safe. Sanjays time keeping was impeccable. Sanjay continuously presented clean and smart. Sanjay was happy to answer our questions about the country and culture and this helped us feel very relaxed." },
      { author: "Kannary", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-16", text: "It was a great experience with the company. Highly recommended!" },
      { author: "Fiorella", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-11", text: "Everything was amazing. Tour guide was very friendly and knowledgeable. A 100% recommended." },
      { author: "kailash", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-11", text: "“An unforgettable journey through India’s heritage and wildlife!” The Golden Triangle tour with Ranthambore was an absolutely incredible experience. From the moment we were picked up, everything was perfectly organized — professional guides, comfortable transport, and well-planned itineraries. Exploring Delhi, Agra, and Jaipur was a beautiful cultural journey, and the safari at Ranthambore National Park was the highlight of the trip! We were lucky enough to spot a tiger, along with many other animals. The team was warm, knowledgeable, and always ready to help, which made the trip completely stress-free. Highly recommend this tour to anyone who wants a perfect mix of history, culture, and wildlife in India." },
      { author: "Karen", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-09", text: "Overall a great experience. The guide tour wasvery knowledgeable and friendly! A must do when visiting India!" },
      { author: "Roman", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-12", text: "We booked the 7-day tour (including Rhantambore). It was a great experience for us, as Gulshan knows the individual places very well. He showed us the 'real' Chai and also explained a lot of the sights to us. The hotels were all very good, so we can only recommend this unforgettable trip." },
      { author: "Noah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-08", text: "Great experience, must-do when in Delhi." },
      { author: "Johanna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2025-02-16", text: "Någon guide ingår inte, utan du får en privat chaufför som kör runt dig till de olika platserna i beskrivningen och hjälper dig fixa biljett, checka in på hotellen och kör dig till bra restauranger. Innan du blir avsläppt vid monumenten/templen etc så får du lite information om platsen. Men som sagt, ingen guide som följer med dig in och berättar mer djupgående om platsen. Med det sagt var vår chaufför Gulshan en mycket trevlig person som alltid kom i tid, lyssnade på våra önskemål och försökte hjälpa oss så gott han kunde. Vi hade paketet med 3-stjärniga hotell, men de levde inte upp till våra förväntningar för det priset. Speciellt inte hotellet i New Delhi och Jaipur, men det i Agra och Ranthambore var bra. Summa summarum tyckte vi att priset var för högt mot vad vi fick." },
    ],
  },
