  'delhi-6-hours-delhi-spiritual-sites-with-famous': {
    averageRating: 4.7,
    totalReviews: 53,
    guideRating: 4.75,
    valueRating: 4.75,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Darren", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-30", text: "I had an excellent day with Karan and Santosh. It was an amazing trip visiting all the monuments to different faiths and the markets that bring people together.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-6-hours-delhi-spiritual-sites-with-famous/4778661/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-6-hours-delhi-spiritual-sites-with-famous/4778662/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Mario", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-20", text: "Our driver was amazingly punctual, arriving 10 minutes early! And a massive shout-out to our guide, Nikhil—super knowledgeable, friendly, and full of insights. He gave us the real Delhi experience and knew all the right places at the right times. Honestly, it felt like a VIP tour!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-6-hours-delhi-spiritual-sites-with-famous/4679029/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-6-hours-delhi-spiritual-sites-with-famous/4679030/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Soma", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-17", text: "I had an incredibly smooth and comfortable ride with my driver, Shyam, and a truly exceptional experience with my guide, Prakash. He went far beyond expectations by making extra stops, anticipating my needs, clicking beautiful shots and helping me with everything else. I’m genuinely grateful for how thoughtful and supportive he was throughout the day. As a solo female traveller, I felt completely safe and well cared for. I can highly recommend both Shyam and Prakash to anyone wanting to discover the real gems of Delhi.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-6-hours-delhi-spiritual-sites-with-famous/4648571/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Samuele", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-07", text: "Amazing tour! We went through different parts of Delhi, both Old and New. We visited the main temples of Delhi and we even went around with TukTuk, that left me simply speechless. The tour was perfectly organised, Azhar, my tour guide, helped me through the tour in the best way possible always been there and make the tour go as smooth as possible, totally recommended tour guide!!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-6-hours-delhi-spiritual-sites-with-famous/4532031/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-6-hours-delhi-spiritual-sites-with-famous/4532032/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-6-hours-delhi-spiritual-sites-with-famous/4532036/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Solimar", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-19", text: "I have been to Delhi before and just wanted to revisit some of the temples and places I have see before and liked. The car was comfortable and with AC and the diver, Mr. Shekar was very good in navigating the busy roads of Delhi. I felt very safe and relaxed. The Guide Mr. Mohamed, is very courteous and friendly person. He understood my request to keep things short and sweet as I didn’t need to spend a long time in the places I just wanted to renew the acquaintance with these fabulous places. Despite the intense heat we were able to see all the attractions and I’m very satisfied I went out there again. Thank you Mr Mohamed and Mr Shekar!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-6-hours-delhi-spiritual-sites-with-famous/3860428/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "James", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-25", text: "This is a great day trip around the different religious sites of Dehli. A good way to spend the day and to get a good feel for the city. Kavya was a great guide helping me understand the history and religion of Dehli. Sanju was very friendly and got us everywhere efficiently. It was a great way to spend my first day here. 👍🏻", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-6-hours-delhi-spiritual-sites-with-famous/3195653/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-6-hours-delhi-spiritual-sites-with-famous/3195654/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-6-hours-delhi-spiritual-sites-with-famous/3195656/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Stéphie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-09-27", text: "Dileep était un guide très utile, il m’as donné tous les explications sur les temples, juste j aurais aimé resté un peu plus longtemps dans les temples. Ce fut néanmoins une belle expérience et découverte. En tant que femme je le recommande", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-6-hours-delhi-spiritual-sites-with-famous/8945939/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-6-hours-delhi-spiritual-sites-with-famous/8945953/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Ludivine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-15", text: "Nous étions en tour organisé pour voir plusieurs monuments dans la ville de Delhi. Les explications du guide Surya étaient super, il parle très bien le français et est très sympathique. Le chauffeur également très serviable. je recommande cette excursion et cette agence de voyage. Merci beaucoup", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-6-hours-delhi-spiritual-sites-with-famous/4627238/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-6-hours-delhi-spiritual-sites-with-famous/4627239/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-6-hours-delhi-spiritual-sites-with-famous/4627240/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Ilaria Maria", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-27", text: "Shamin was a wonderful guide really prepared and interesting. very beautiful visit thans to Shamin and our driver Prim" },
      { author: "Jess", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-26", text: "Definitely recommend! My guide Shamin was so knowledgeable, kind and flexible. My driver kishan was also super nice and flexible. I was a bit nervous coming to Delhi as a solo female traveller and there’s no way I would’ve been able to experience Delhi the way I did without having done this tour. The only thing I would say is that you have the option for 5am start on Get your guide but they dont offer 5am as temples don’t open until 8 or 10. They were flexible and took me at 6:30. Thank you!" },
      { author: "Amy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-25", text: "I enjoyed hearing the history of each location from Nikhal. He had a lot of great information to share and brought us to some special locations that I was not expecting to see. Our driver was great as well and provided cold water throughout the day. I would recommend this tour to anyone interested in exploring Old and New Delhi." },
      { author: "Robin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-05", text: "What a great tour, very insightful, well paced and very interesting. Would definitely recommend to anyone who wants to see these spiritual sites. Raj was a great guide, put me first and went at my pace - thank you Raj!" },
    ],
  },
