  'delhi-all-inclusive-old-new-delhi-full-half-day': {
    averageRating: 4.9,
    totalReviews: 12,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-09-28", text: "The overall experience was great but it seemed that the focus was largely around the Islamic sites of cultural/historical significance. The only non-Islamic site visited was the Baha'i Lotus Temple but due to shortage of time caused by traffic jams, it was only possible to view building from the outside.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-all-inclusive-old-new-delhi-full-half-day/4007859/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-all-inclusive-old-new-delhi-full-half-day/4007863/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Mackenzie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-27", text: "Overall a great full day private tour. Manoj Ahirwar was a great guide; very informative and took his time explaining the history of all the sites. Jahoor, our driver, was punctual and navigated the city with expertise! Would recommend to anyone visiting the city, truly packed so much into a singular day!" },
      { author: "Veronika", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-28", text: "Sunny was a great guide, he showed me around all the markets in Old Delhi and told me a lot of facts about the monuments as well as Indian history in general, it was very interesting to listen to him! He made sure I feel comfortable and safe and was open to all the requests. Couldn’t recommend him enough!" },
      { author: "Veronika", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-27", text: "Azhar was a great guide! He showed me around all the beautiful places in the New Delhi and went out of his way to show me the attractions from the best viewing points. The whole experience was very smooth and he was very open to questions about the sights and gave a great and informative tour! If I wanted to make changes to the tour he was listening to my request and made everything possible, I couldn’t recommend him as your guide enough!" },
      { author: "António", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-14", text: "we did the full day tour (8 hour) in old and new Delhi. Anas was our guide and was quite helpful and knowledgeable about all the points we visited. he managed to pack a lot in a single day and not making feel like a rush, quite on the contrary, we had time to see all the monuments at our pace. also enjoyed his recommendation for lunch, it has traditional food as well as Western, making it a good choice for adventurous or picky eaters. we didn't manage to visit the red for sure to it being closed for a political event, even though he tried to adapt the route we took to be able to see it only downside was a late start due to us changing hotel and the company didn't pass along our new hotel. still a very enjoyable day to know the capital of India. recommendation, bring a mask, as smog can be a problem." },
      { author: "Nick", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-11", text: "Anas was very knowledgeable and showed all the main sights of Delhi. Very professional and on time! Excellent, authentic experience" },
      { author: "Michele", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-10-29", text: "the 8-hour tour with Adin was very multifaceted. we visited all the relevant sights and were able to take some nice photos. the tour is great if you are only in Delhi for a short time and still want to discover a lot." },
      { author: "Roxanne", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-09-21", text: "it was a wonderful experience. My guide Adin was fantastic. He was very gracious and considerate. The driver did a great job maneuvering in the traffic. We covered a lot and Adin was very informative. Highly recommended!" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-22", text: "Great guide, very interesting your and we enjoyed a fabulous lunch along the way. Thanks Wahab !!" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-20", text: "Our guide, Vivek was very good. He was funny and knowledgeable. He showed us some fantastic places and we had a great time with him. Thanks Vivek😎👍" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-01", text: "I booked a half day tour in Delhi as I was short on time, the driver picked me up from my hotel then we met the tour guide Anas, we went on Diwali so all the places were very busy but I still had a great time! Anas knew a lot about the monuments and I felt very safe as a solo female traveller, it was a great way to start my India trip! Would recommend" },
    ],
  },
