  'delhi-cooking-class-learn-authentic-recipes-in-a': {
    averageRating: 5.0,
    totalReviews: 4,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Fredy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-04", text: "Amazing class couldn’t ask for more learned so much with such dedication and detail would definitely recommend and come back so many delicious dishes with amazing techniques glad I chose this class. Malika is such an amazing teacher she even gave us recipes to take home she so talented. A definitely worth doing." },
      { author: "Piotr", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-15", text: "We love cooking. We bought a class with Malika to cook and try a wide variety of Indian dishes. And it was so. We spent a wunderful day with Malika and her family. We had a great opportunity to try rare and more complex dishes. We discussed not only the recipes but also very simple things important for an Indian family. We talked about food shopping, Indian habits and differences between spieces in South and North India. That was a great time and a great lesson. We recommed Malika to all those interested in eating and living in India. And at the end Malika showed us around Old Delhi and helped buy rare spices and tea. We also have written recipes and they are of truly professional quality with great attention to detail. Thanks Malika and all your family😊" },
      { author: "Duane", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-02-16", text: "This was the best cooking class I have ever had I all the countries I’ve been to. MALIKA and her husband ANURAG opened up their home/kitchen to me and my brother like we were family. MALIKA is an excellent cook!! She is very particular about her food and presentation. Her husband was very helpful with her preparation of the food. I would definitely recommend this class to anyone going to Delhi. I will be going back to take another lesson and I will stay in touch with these GREAT PEOPLE!!!" },
      { author: "Antoni", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-01-06", text: "We had really great time with Marica and her family. We were able to get an insight into real life of Indian family and learnt a lot not about cooking but India as well. The food we prepared with Marica was great and we also got some great receipts to cook at home. Although her place is quite far away from city centre but it easy to get there by metro Marica's husband picked us up from the station and dropped us off on our way back. And we were only 2 persons at the lesson!!" },
    ],
  },
