  'delhi-full-day-tour-with-red-fort-humayuns-tomb': {
    averageRating: 5.0,
    totalReviews: 3,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "David", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-23", text: "We were very fortunate to take this tour with Vivek and his driver Yash. Vivek took us to the sites we requested and explained the behind each place with enough detail to help you understand the history behind what you were seeing. Yash was very professional with his driving skills through Delhi 's traffic and both these people were generous hosts . whom you felt comfortable and safe as had the feeling you were with friends... if you have the opportunity to come to Delhi , we highly recommend these gentleman.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-full-day-tour-with-red-fort-humayuns-tomb/8870094/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Jenny", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-21", text: "What a great way to see the highlights of Delhi! My guide Prabhat was so knowledgeable about Delhi and Indian history and spoke with great enthusiasm throughout the tour, I learnt so much! I felt totally comfortable as a solo female traveller in his presence. My driver Yash was very attentive and made me feel safe and looked after the whole day. My rickshaw driver was great and was a great way to see the markets. Be prepared to spend money at the spice market and any shops you visit, unless you are very good at saying no! Great communication from Vivek the tour operator. I would recommend this tour :)", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-full-day-tour-with-red-fort-humayuns-tomb/5884087/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-full-day-tour-with-red-fort-humayuns-tomb/5884090/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-full-day-tour-with-red-fort-humayuns-tomb/5884095/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Elisabeth", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-07-06", text: "This day trip was truly amazing. I feel like I got to see so much about Delhi! The guide was wonderful and so nice and I felt super comfortable as a solo female traveler! Highly recommend this if you are in Delhi all entrance tickets are included to the sights we visited ." },
    ],
  },
