    valueRating: 4.74,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Dorothea", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-30", text: "A very informative tour for our introduction to Delhi. We were told about the historical origins of the city. Our guide was very knowledgable, personable and passionate about Delhi. A lovely start to our in adventure. 😊", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-mehrauli-archaeological-park-tour-with/4029185/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-mehrauli-archaeological-park-tour-with/4029186/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-mehrauli-archaeological-park-tour-with/4029187/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Emilie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-24", text: "We had a great tour of Qutub Minar and Mehrauli Park with our guide Mayank and our driver Zeeshan. Mayank was very knowledgeable about the history of the monuments we visited and told us many fascinating anecdotes." },
      { author: "Corrado", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-03", text: "The driver (Ali) picked us up on time and drove us safely to the Mehrauli Archeological Parks. Here we met Mayank (Mike) our guide for the tour. Mike has a wast knowledge about history and and buildings visited. He explained and answered all our questinons. We are very satisfied with with him and will book another tour on our return to Delhi." },
      { author: "Katherine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-22", text: "An excellent tour with Lerab at Qutub Minar & Mehrauli. Very informative & friendly & would recommend this tour & guide to anyone" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-18", text: "Excelente y el guía atento y amable. Con un buen conocimiento del lugares y temas." },
    ],
