  'delhi-monkey-safari-guided-walking-tour': {
    averageRating: 5.0,
    totalReviews: 9,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Judy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-06-01", text: "This was certainly more than we thought. We started the day getting the metro to the Buddhist temple. Then after spending time there we went to the monkey area and then for some chai. Our guide santan was excellent. Very informative and friendly. He made sure we got safely back to our accommodation. Excellent guide and an experience not to miss!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-monkey-safari-guided-walking-tour/2724710/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "james", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-28", text: "Had a great morning with Santan! We started by visiting Hanuman temple where he gave us a lot of background information about it. Then we had a peaceful walk with the monkeys. We ended our morning with traditional chai.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-monkey-safari-guided-walking-tour/2228936/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-monkey-safari-guided-walking-tour/2228937/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-monkey-safari-guided-walking-tour/2228938/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Paul", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-05", text: "Very enjoyable tour with friendly guide. Started with learning about the monkey good and visiting a very impressive monkey temple. lovely walk to see monkeys and feed bananas. then to a very fantastic chai spot- I could have drunken ten they were so nice. Then walk around CP. Perfect start to day." },
      { author: "Fiona", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-26", text: "Had a lovely time with Santan, lots of information and facts about monkeys and their place in Hinduism. Would recommend 🤩" },
      { author: "Rosselli", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-05", text: "It was a beautiful morning tour where we visited the Hanuman temple and offered complimentary sweets. The place is very characteristic, colorful and serene. Our very knowledgeable and kind guide Santan explained everything to us and made us taste the Masala tea prepared directly on the street. After that he accompanied us to the park to see the monkeys to whom we gave bananas for our and their joy. A big thank you to Santan for his company. Tour to absolutely choose." },
      { author: "Maria", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-09-13", text: "The experience was incredible! Santan, the guide, explained every detail of the two temples we visited! He knows a lot! We saw many monkeys and I was able to take photos and get a little closer, even though I was a little nervous. Honestly, I highly recommend it! It's worth it! Santan also took me to drink chai in clay cups and it was delicious. We had it with a well-known vendor called \"The Chai Politician\" who wears a very distinctive outfit. We also tried a typical Indian street dish, although it was too spicy for me haha, but it was a good experience to try it. If you want to have a good time, meet some monkeys and enjoy New Delhi, this tour is for you!!" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-26", text: "Santan was our perfect guide. Met us at the arranged pount and took us on a wonderful journey informing us all the way. You can always tell when someo ne is passionate about the journey. The Temple is extravagant but also really interesting. Walking with the Monkeys and feeding them was an absolute pleasure." },
      { author: "Laura", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-06", text: "Molto bella , la consiglio !" },
    ],
  },
  'delhi-multi-golden-triangle-tour-with-hotels': {
    averageRating: 4.25,
    totalReviews: 3,
    guideRating: 4.25,
    valueRating: 4.25,
    reviews: [
      { author: "India", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-23", text: "My experience was wonderful! We were picked up promptly from our hotel in Delhi by our driver Vikash. We met our first guide, Rahul, to tour around Delhi. Rahul was very delightful and informative as we toured both Old and New Delhi. He also showed us to a great restaurant for lunch. Our journey landed us in Agra for the first evening, where we were wonderfully accommodated by the hotel. On the ride to Agra, Vikash was great about finding us a great shop to purchase outfits for our Taj Mahal tour. Our second day began with Vikash and our second tour guide, Shahid, meeting up early for our sunrise Taj Mahal. He was great with making sure we quickly processed through the lines at all our stops. He was full of information and great with accommodating our requests throughout the day. In addition to the tourist spots, we made a stop past a local Persian rug maker to see the rug making process first hand. We wanted to do an astrology reading, which Shahid was able to arrange last minute", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-multi-golden-triangle-tour-with-hotels/4348918/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Sindu", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-01-25", text: "Wir würden von einem sehr netten und sehr gutem Fahrer pünktlich am Hotel abgeholt und sind dann zum Nationalpark gefahren. Wir hatten großes Glück und konnten in der Zone 3 sogar 4Tiger sehen. Es waren sehr viele Menschen und einiges Autos unterwegs. Ich hätte nur gerne im Vorfeld gewusst, dass es auf der Rückfahrt sehr kalt war und man sollte sich warme Kleidung einpacken.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-multi-golden-triangle-tour-with-hotels/1851224/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-multi-golden-triangle-tour-with-hotels/1851231/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-multi-golden-triangle-tour-with-hotels/1851232/1600.webp"] },
    ],
  },
