  'delhi-nightlife-tour-in-private-car-temple-bars': {
    averageRating: 5.0,
    totalReviews: 6,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Mavis", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-17", text: "Sid did extremely well, and it was a very great and marvelous experience. I was unsure of going especially being a single lady going out at night and even told him im canceling but he really encouraged me to go and experience Dehli at night and i was glad I finally agreed to go out. The visit at the Sikh temple and the food experience and we went to the bar , I felt so safe and comfortable and it felt like I was with friends and brothers instead of tour guides. I highly recommend Sid and Vishal and encourage anyone that wants to tour at night,, they are great companions and make you feel you've known them forever..", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-nightlife-tour-in-private-car-temple-bars/7633794/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-nightlife-tour-in-private-car-temple-bars/7633795/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-nightlife-tour-in-private-car-temple-bars/7633796/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Markus", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-31", text: "We can only recommend this tour. It was great to spend NYE together with Sid and Vishi! We felt safe all the time, the places we went to were clean and offered delicious food and drinks. We learned a lot about Indian culture but also had a lot of fun together. Thank you very much!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-nightlife-tour-in-private-car-temple-bars/5066973/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Venkata", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-29", text: "One of the most unforgettable nights in Delhi unfolded with an energetic driver, Vishal, and the extraordinary guide Siddhartha by our side! Their warmth, calm demeanor, and endless patience made our adventure through the vibrant streets special. Even though safety was at the forefront of our minds during this night tour, we felt completely at ease. The city's electric atmosphere was intoxicating, and we can’t recommend these two enough for anyone eager to dive into the heart of Delhi on foot! It was an experience like no other!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-nightlife-tour-in-private-car-temple-bars/3609129/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-nightlife-tour-in-private-car-temple-bars/3609130/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-nightlife-tour-in-private-car-temple-bars/3609131/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Jagbir", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-10-11", text: "From beginning to end I was well looked after and entertained. Sid understood exactly what I was after and went above and beyond my expectations. Please go with Sid if you want safety, peace of mind and a true insiders guide to Delhi. I learned a lot about the culture here and some great stories you wouldn’t find in a travel book. Thank you for an unforgettable experience and I’ll definitely be back.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-nightlife-tour-in-private-car-temple-bars/1261023/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-nightlife-tour-in-private-car-temple-bars/1261024/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-nightlife-tour-in-private-car-temple-bars/1261025/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Aruna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-16", text: "The entire thing was wonderful. Sid and vishal have been absolutely amazing.They are very attentive and genuinely nice people who went out of their way to make sure we felt safe and comfortable.We had a blast the whole time and it turned out to be more than we have hoped for . Anyone who wants to experience the beauty of delhi night life in safe hands , handsdown you should go for sid and vishal blindly." },
      { author: "Ajay", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-23", text: "This tour was fantastic! Despite my flight being delayed by over an hour, the guide patiently waited for me at the airport and went on to give me an unforgettable experience around Delhi. I highly recommend this tour to anyone looking to explore the city." },
    ],
  },
