  'delhi-old-delhi-highlighs-tuk-tuk-tour-with-guide': {
    averageRating: 4.89,
    totalReviews: 43,
    guideRating: 4.88,
    valueRating: 4.9,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Rob", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-17", text: "Shamin was a great guide and showed us everything with a lot of knowledge and jumman our driver to the activity got us there save and fast", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-delhi-highlighs-tuk-tuk-tour-with-guide/6706179/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-delhi-highlighs-tuk-tuk-tour-with-guide/6706192/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-delhi-highlighs-tuk-tuk-tour-with-guide/6706206/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Aggie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-06", text: "This was such fun afternoon, we loved it. Riding on a rickshaw through the market was the best. It was exciting and fun. Asif our guide was fab, great and easy to talk to, flexible and pointed out what to note. The only confusion was that it is not a tuk tuk tour rather a traditional rickshaw tour through Old Delhi (which is even better but initially confusing). Certainly would recommend the tour.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-delhi-highlighs-tuk-tuk-tour-with-guide/6548409/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-delhi-highlighs-tuk-tuk-tour-with-guide/6548410/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-delhi-highlighs-tuk-tuk-tour-with-guide/6548411/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Elleni", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-11", text: "Asif is a very knowledgeable guide. He was able to provide information on the sites that were visited and he was very happy to answer questions. The tuk tuk ride through Chandni chowk was a unique experience. There was no pressure to make any purchases. He was very accommodating. If we had more time in Delhi I would book him again for more tours. Highly recommend.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-delhi-highlighs-tuk-tuk-tour-with-guide/4179798/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-delhi-highlighs-tuk-tuk-tour-with-guide/4179805/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Andy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-10", text: "Great tour with Asif this morning. Much quieter on a Sunday thankfully although it was still great hustle and bustle. Transport was very clean and great aircon. The driver was very courteous. The rickshaw ride was awesome although we felt very sorry for the poor guy having to cycle us through the streets. Please remember to tip the rickshaw rider for his extreme efforts. Asif had great knowledge he shared with us and we got to see the hidden step well on way back to hotel. A great tour and thoroughly recommend the company and Asif!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-delhi-highlighs-tuk-tuk-tour-with-guide/3362355/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-delhi-highlighs-tuk-tuk-tour-with-guide/3362356/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-delhi-highlighs-tuk-tuk-tour-with-guide/3362359/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Kiki", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-08", text: "The rickshaw ride through the narrow streets was fantastic. Bumpy, noisy, hot, busy, a feast for the senses. My guide answered my questions easily and thankfully in the heat, didn’t overwhelm me with information. I would have loved to spend longer in the spice market but time was what it was and the bustling narrow pavements didn’t allow much space for a long chat. My guide looked out for my safety and well being and we talked about many other things other than the history of the city. It was a fantastic taster of where I’d like to go further. My guide was knowledgeable, spoke excellent English, is a kind friendly man and laughed at my jokes (I’m not even that funny)", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-delhi-highlighs-tuk-tuk-tour-with-guide/3038436/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-delhi-highlighs-tuk-tuk-tour-with-guide/3038437/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-delhi-highlighs-tuk-tuk-tour-with-guide/3038438/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Paulina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-14", text: "I had an amazing experience on the tour of Delhi, thanks to our fantastic guide Shamin Qureshi and driver Laxman! The guide was extremely knowledgeable, sharing fascinating insights about the city's rich history and culture, and answering all our questions with enthusiasm. His passion for Delhi made the tour even more enjoyable.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-delhi-highlighs-tuk-tuk-tour-with-guide/2135196/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Olivia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-10-22", text: "This was an amazing experience! Our guide, Gaurav Soni, was really knowledgeable and helpful. The tuktuk riders were super heroes! And the buzz and mayhem of the market was incredible. It was great to experience the busyness and colour of the old town while feeling safe as three women travelling together.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-delhi-highlighs-tuk-tuk-tour-with-guide/1333124/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Andrew", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-07-28", text: "Great knowledge guide. So much so I have another tour booked with same guide in few days? Double tip this time as I forgot last time.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-delhi-highlighs-tuk-tuk-tour-with-guide/774786/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-delhi-highlighs-tuk-tuk-tour-with-guide/774787/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-delhi-highlighs-tuk-tuk-tour-with-guide/774788/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Alexandra", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-01-14", text: "It was an awesome experience! Our guide as well as our drivers, super nice and motivated. I can highly recommend this activity.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-delhi-highlighs-tuk-tuk-tour-with-guide/153562/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Richelle", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-14", text: "de gids was erg lief en heel begrijpelijk. Hij stond open voor veel suggesties en was erg flexibel. Volgende keer als ik er ben wil ik weer graag door hem geholpen worden!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-delhi-highlighs-tuk-tuk-tour-with-guide/6667516/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Arsenio", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-19", text: "I booked this tour last minute to cover my afternoon here in Delhi. Asif and his team were prompt to pick me up from my hotel around the airport, he provided really good and useful info about the tour, and was also happy to answer any question I threw at him. I highly recommend this tour, and most especially with Asif as your guide" },
      { author: "Eduardo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-12", text: "Amazing day! Afzal was an excellent guide very knowledgeable, friendly, and always willing to answer me questions. He made the whole experience enjoyable and informative. I highly recommend this tour, especially with Afzal as your guide. Thank you for making me visit so memorable!" },
    ],
  },
