  'delhi-old-delhi-slum-tour-by-metro-or-car': {
    averageRating: 4.97,
    totalReviews: 72,
    guideRating: 4.94,
    valueRating: 4.87,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Maksims", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-28", text: "Aamir was a great tour guide, I really enjoyed this authentic tour!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-delhi-slum-tour-by-metro-or-car/5977482/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Jannine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-11", text: "I was very pleased with my tour. The taxi collected me from my hotel, was on time and clean. I met Sunny who was my guide. He was very helpful and I felt very safe as a solo female. He explained the etiquette of the tour and I was able to take some photos with my mobile but was very mindful of what was appropriate. We had lovely chai at his mum's home. I enjoyed hearing about his life and the volunteer work he does. certainly a hard working chap. The tour wasn't confronting but an opportunity to learn about how life is lived for people of Delhi who have moved to the city and struggle with employment. I enjoyed meeting all the happy kids who were on holiday from school. Special thanks to Sonny.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-delhi-slum-tour-by-metro-or-car/5178875/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-delhi-slum-tour-by-metro-or-car/5178876/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-delhi-slum-tour-by-metro-or-car/5178877/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Rosemary", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-28", text: "Aamir was the best! He's very friendly and informative, took care of us older girls. We requested Masala chayee, then He Took us to his Friend house for Masala Chaaye!! He is very knowledgeable!! He knows everyone in Slum !! Thank Ypu Aamir ! great Tour! we recommend Aamir highly!!!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-delhi-slum-tour-by-metro-or-car/4412260/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-delhi-slum-tour-by-metro-or-car/4412274/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-delhi-slum-tour-by-metro-or-car/4412275/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Sergey", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-26", text: "Overall experience was really good , our guide Aamir Khan was really nice and was able to accompany us everywhere and answer our questions It was our pleasure to meet him. Thanks", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-delhi-slum-tour-by-metro-or-car/4388367/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Edward", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-23", text: "Amir and Rehan, this was an awesome tour and really enjoyed it. Amir introduced us to everyone and it was safe. The kids were happy to see us and you learn how lucky you are. I strongly recommend everyone do this tour and ask for these guys.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-delhi-slum-tour-by-metro-or-car/2012852/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-delhi-slum-tour-by-metro-or-car/2012853/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-delhi-slum-tour-by-metro-or-car/2012854/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Wendy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-09", text: "Sunny was the most wonderful tour guide. He was incredibly kind and respectful, as well as being very informative. His role as a mentor for Creators Coaching Centre gave us insights that we otherwise would never have had. His rapport with the local children (many of whom he personally mentors) was very special to witness. He is an outstanding human being! Often when visiting places like Delhi, you stick to the traditional tourist sights, missing out on the authenticity of the city. This tour showed a very real and authentic side to the city and was an absolute highlight of our stay. I can’t recommend Sunny and this tour highly enough! ⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-delhi-slum-tour-by-metro-or-car/1926693/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-delhi-slum-tour-by-metro-or-car/1926694/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-delhi-slum-tour-by-metro-or-car/1926695/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Siti", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-25", text: "Amir and Rashida were very helpful and help to explain things really well. Very gd tour. Recommend 10/10, worth going for this!" },
      { author: "rutger", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-25", text: "Aamir and Rashida where nice tour guides. We had a good time" },
      { author: "Bastian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-16", text: "It was a really cool and interesting tour 10 out of 10!!! Amir was a great guide!!" },
      { author: "Agne", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-19", text: "It was great! Sunny was a great guide, he’s very knowledgeable, has very good in and out perspective of slums. He was very patient with our questions, and made sure we feel as good as possible. I would definitely recommend this tour, we very much enjoyed it, I’d say it was the best one we had in India!" },
      { author: "Wolfgang Matthias", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-02", text: "It was an interesting tour and the tourguide explained and described daily life in a very realistic way. The driver was driving carefully and he was very patient with this heavy traffic jum in Delhi. A very interestin tour that I recommand." },
      { author: "Lorenzo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-07", text: "Fantastic, i’ve appreciated a lot the young guide and his hospitality, the tour inside that places is very impressive, they have all of my respect. I loved when i given some snacks at the kinds there, their eyes are unforgettable for me." },
    ],
  },
