  'delhi-old-new-delhi-full-day-private-tour-with': {
    averageRating: 5.0,
    totalReviews: 6,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Ytzen", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-08", text: "It was great experience! We first went to Old Delhi where we saw te big mosque of Delhi and walked around on spice market in the narrow streets. The driver Arun (who had great Delhi driving skills) and guide Nikhilesh were very kind, helpfull and had a lot of knowledge about the rich Indian history. After visiting Old Delhi we went to the Hamayun Tomb and the Lotus temple, but of course we also saw the Parliament and the Indian Gate. It absolutely was, even dispite the monsoon rains (umbrella’s were included) a memorable day!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-new-delhi-full-day-private-tour-with/7521294/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-new-delhi-full-day-private-tour-with/7521295/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-new-delhi-full-day-private-tour-with/7521296/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Laurin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-19", text: "Die Tagestour war absolut fantastisch und definitiv eines der Highlights unserer Reise in Indien. Unser Guide Karen war unglaublich freundlich, kompetent und hat uns mit viel Leidenschaft und Wissen die Kultur, Geschichte und die schönsten Orte nähergebracht. Man hat sofort gemerkt, dass ihm das Erlebnis der Gäste wirklich am Herzen liegt. Auch unser Fahrer Baola war hervorragend – immer pünktlich, sehr professionell und wir haben uns während der gesamten Fahrt sicher und entspannt gefühlt, trotz des lebhaften Verkehrs. Das Auto war sauber und komfortabel, und beide haben perfekt zusammengearbeitet. Wir konnten an nur einem Tag unglaublich viel sehen und erleben. Von beeindruckenden Sehenswürdigkeiten bis hin zu authentischen lokalen Eindrücken war alles dabei. Besonders schön war, dass die Tour nie gehetzt wirkte und immer Zeit für Fragen, Fotos und kleine spontane Stopps blieb. Vielen Dank an Karen und Baola für diesen unvergesslichen Tag.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-new-delhi-full-day-private-tour-with/6742658/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-new-delhi-full-day-private-tour-with/6742662/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-old-new-delhi-full-day-private-tour-with/6742663/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Tereza", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-21", text: "I had an amazing full day tour of both Old Delhi and New Delhi. The experience was well organised, informative and enjoyable! A special thank you to my guide Prakash, who was absolutely fantastic. He was incredibly knowledgeable, friendly and passionate about sharing the history and culture and answering all my questions. Our driver Vishnu was also very kind, professional and courteous throughout the day. Navigating Delhi traffic is no easy task, but he made us feel safe and comfortable at all times. His warm and friendly nature added to the overall positive experience. I highly recommend this tour to anyone visiting Delhi and wanting to see both the historic charm of Old Delhi and the beautiful landmarks of New Delhi. Thanks again to Prakash and Vishnu for making it such a wonderful day! I will be back!" },
      { author: "Elisa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-16", text: "Autista molto gentile e guida in italiano Aayush mishra molto preparata. Consigliato" },
      { author: "marica", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-10", text: "esperienza ottima con Narendra, la nostra guida italiana. abbiamo visitato diverse attrazioni della città di New Delhi e ci ha spiegato tutto perfettamente. consigliato" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-08", text: "O tour foi maravilhoso, o guia Prakash foi incrível, muito conhecido e muito simpático. Tivemos um dia de muita informação e visitamos lugares realmente divinos. Super recomendo este tour." },
    ],
  },
