  'delhi-private-half-day-or-full-day-old-and': {
    averageRating: 4.92,
    totalReviews: 36,
    guideRating: 4.95,
    valueRating: 4.9,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Rachel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-03", text: "Had a really great time exploring old Delhi with a local guide. Every sense was alive - from smelling spices to seeing the beautiful central mosque, old Delhi is a sight to behold.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-half-day-or-full-day-old-and/4804891/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-half-day-or-full-day-old-and/4804892/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-half-day-or-full-day-old-and/4804893/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Erin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-09", text: "We did the tour today as soon as we came straight from the airport to our hotel. We went at 16:30 which was perfect for the 3.5/4 hours as we got to see old Delhi in the bright and then some of New Delhi as the sun was setting. The best of both worlds! The tour is for old Delhi but the guide giving us a glimpse of New Delhi was such a lovely touch! The tour was absolutely brilliant! Our guide Arham was so knowledgeable, sharing loads of fascinating history and little stories that really brought the area to life. He was also great craic, making the whole experience fun and relaxed. He went out of his way to offer to take lots of photos for us (which we really appreciated!) We had a chai stop, spices & tea stop & stop for fabrics, art, rug making & jewellery (There was no pressure to purchase) The driver Shamshuddin was also fantastic — calm, safe, and patient in the busy Delhi traffic. Were an Irish couple first time in India and this I would definitely recommend!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-half-day-or-full-day-old-and/3355528/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-half-day-or-full-day-old-and/3355529/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Mark", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-29", text: "Really great value for money. Picked up in a taxi at the start then moved around via tuktuk and taxi for the whole of the trip. Our guide Mohammed was excellent, really knowledgeable and a truly genuine guy who clearly loves Delhi. Would 100% recommend.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-half-day-or-full-day-old-and/3230656/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-half-day-or-full-day-old-and/3230657/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-half-day-or-full-day-old-and/3230658/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Louisa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-21", text: "Extremely happy I booked this online tour. The driver was amazing and his car was clean and comfortable. The guide, Kaushiki, she exceeded any expectations. She is very intelligent and confident. Worked our way through many attractions in a 6 hour period, yet it didn’t feel rushed, it was fun, colourful, and Kaushiki made the experience feel safe as we walked through the markets. Would recommend to anyone wanting to experience more of Old and New Delhi.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-half-day-or-full-day-old-and/2001549/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-half-day-or-full-day-old-and/2001550/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-half-day-or-full-day-old-and/2001552/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Laura", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-02", text: "I had a fantastic private tour with Mohammad Arsh. He was friendly, professional, provided lots of interesting information and also made for a great photographer! I really enjoyed my half day New Delhi tour with him and would highly recommend to anyone thinking about booking!!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-half-day-or-full-day-old-and/1405244/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Howard", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-03-15", text: "Junai was very passionate about his city and had a wealth of knowledge and certainly knew his history. He was polite and courteous at all times. Kamal the driver was also very polite and navigated the busy roads well.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-half-day-or-full-day-old-and/5813639/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-half-day-or-full-day-old-and/5813641/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-half-day-or-full-day-old-and/5813642/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "walter feliciano", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-08", text: "la experiencia fue genial el guía pedro sabe mucho sobre la historia el mismo domina 4 idiomas y velo que siempre estuviera seguro", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-half-day-or-full-day-old-and/6569046/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Jonas", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-26", text: "Es war eine wunderbare Tour durch Delhi mit Jaswant als Reiseleiter. Übrigens spricht er, sehr gutes Deutsch, dass macht es einem einfacher miteinander zu kommunizieren.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-half-day-or-full-day-old-and/5957480/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Luke", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-03", text: "我在德里只有一天,但這個行程安排得真的超棒。 司機很準時又親切,導遊 Tabrej 帶我走了很多地 方,途中還一起吃了幾樣小吃、喝了 Masala Chai,味道超好!他講解得很生動,讓我在短短- 天就能了解德里的歷史和文化。整趟行程節奏剛 好,既輕鬆又充滿人情味,真的感受到印度的熱情 與生活氣息。非常推薦!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-half-day-or-full-day-old-and/4807676/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Beatriz", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-23", text: "J’ai fait une visite avec Junaid & Imrul. Imrul est très sérieux. Junaid est un expert d’histoire et de culture, il prend le temps de bien expliquer les aspects culturels du pays. C’était une journée très riche, pleine de contrastes et d’histoire. Merci Junaid.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-half-day-or-full-day-old-and/4346296/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Taiki", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-11", text: "とても楽しい1日になりました。 ガイドのアンサリーさん、ドライバーのイスラムさん、二人ともとても親切で丁寧にガイドしてくれました。 紹介してもらったカレーもとても美味しく、満足な1日になりました。 ありがとうございました", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-half-day-or-full-day-old-and/3063332/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-half-day-or-full-day-old-and/3063334/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-half-day-or-full-day-old-and/3063335/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Megan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-15", text: "Absolutely fantastic tour. My tour guide Aamir was amazing. So knowledgeable and friendly. I went on the tour alone and felt very safe and taken care of the whole time. I would definitely recommend this trip to anyone visiting Delhi." },
    ],
  },
