  'delhi-private-old-new-delhi-guided-half-or-full': {
    averageRating: 4.88,
    totalReviews: 2868,
    guideRating: 4.92,
    valueRating: 4.87,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Mandy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-26", text: "My guide was incredibly friendly, attentive, and professional. I felt very comfortable and safe throughout the entire experience. (I was the only person in this tour). The Communication was excellent, quick, clear, and always with helpful instructions and great information. The driver arrived at my hotel right on time, did an incredible job driving though this traffic and the half-day tour was an exciting and memorable experience overall. Thank you so much for everything!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-old-new-delhi-guided-half-or-full/8922531/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-old-new-delhi-guided-half-or-full/8922532/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-old-new-delhi-guided-half-or-full/8922533/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Nikesh", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-19", text: "Adeeb was really great guide. good to have to conversation with. he explains about the monuments we visited in both interesting and informative way. our driver was also nice", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-old-new-delhi-guided-half-or-full/8805926/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-old-new-delhi-guided-half-or-full/8805927/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-old-new-delhi-guided-half-or-full/8805928/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Emily", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-12", text: "The tour was amazing. Aamir was very knowledgable and kind. He knew all the best sports for Chai Masala and Lassi - he gave me the real Old Delhi experience. Thank you so much Aamir.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-old-new-delhi-guided-half-or-full/8682432/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-old-new-delhi-guided-half-or-full/8682433/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-old-new-delhi-guided-half-or-full/8682434/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Cem sami", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-09", text: "We had an amazing evening tour of Old Delhi with our guide, Aamir! He was superb—friendly, knowledgeable, professional, and extremely helpful throughout the tour. Even though we arrived late, Aamir made every effort to show us everything possible and never made us feel rushed. He took us through the vibrant streets of Old Delhi and introduced us to some of the best local food spots. We tried delicious kebabs, biryani, and authentic street food, which was definitely a highlight. Aamir made the whole evening fun and memorable. Thank you, Aamir, for a wonderful experience. Highly recommended!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-old-new-delhi-guided-half-or-full/8628476/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-old-new-delhi-guided-half-or-full/8628477/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Fayrouz", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-30", text: "Highly recommend this tour. Guide Aamir and Driver Kalim were very helpful navigating the old delhi streets and buying quality spices", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-old-new-delhi-guided-half-or-full/8440911/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-old-new-delhi-guided-half-or-full/8440912/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Enrique", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-29", text: "Riyaz was very knowledgable about every building: its history, significance, and architecture. He went beyond, catering to my interests, and answering all the questions I had. It was a very engaging tour, with time to visit historic, religious, and political monuments, and even experiencing the spice market. I highly recommend this tour to understand Delhi's history, and to introduce you into the fascinating dynamics of the multicultural elements of India.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-old-new-delhi-guided-half-or-full/8422383/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-old-new-delhi-guided-half-or-full/8422384/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-old-new-delhi-guided-half-or-full/8422385/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Lee", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-26", text: "The tour was excellent. We saw so much of Delhi that we would have missed without the tour and our amazing tour guide Arham. Arham had so much knowledge about the city and looked after us really well. Mr Singh (our driver) was also excellent. He was kind and helpful and got us to all the places we wanted to see and was always ready to pick us up after each place we visited. An amazing tour that we would highly recommend to all.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-old-new-delhi-guided-half-or-full/8369534/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-old-new-delhi-guided-half-or-full/8369536/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-old-new-delhi-guided-half-or-full/8369537/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Chris", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-17", text: "Shahbaz was a fantastic guide who shared some very interesting insights about Old Delhi and really helped me to have an authentic taste of Old Delhi that I would not have had otherwise. Bilal was a very competent and friendly driver also!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-old-new-delhi-guided-half-or-full/8194232/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-old-new-delhi-guided-half-or-full/8194233/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-old-new-delhi-guided-half-or-full/8194234/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Briony", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-10", text: "Aamir has been an excellent guide on our tour! He joined us for each of the 8 stops we had and filled us in with all of the details about the history behind our stops. He even took amazing pictures of us together at the sites. I highly recommend you do this tour as it’s a super easy way to get around all the main spots in New Delhi in ultimate comfort. Thanks so much for a fantastic day Aamir!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-old-new-delhi-guided-half-or-full/8054447/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-old-new-delhi-guided-half-or-full/8054449/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Edward", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-30", text: "We had a great time on our guided tour. Our driver Kapil was right on time and was super friendly. Our guide Arham was fantastic, he had amazing historical knowledge of the city and he was eager to answer all the questions we had. Highly recommended!" },
      { author: "Sibylle", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-25", text: "It was amazing! Our tourguide ADEEB AHMED was really good, explained everything really good! Would really recommend’" },
      { author: "Pavlos", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-24", text: "Aamir did amazing Job for Old Delhi Tour . Even we started late evening still he showed us everything. Mehar Singh Our Driver also Drove us around the city very well. Thank You Aamir And Mehar for great Experience." },
    ],
  },
