  'delhi-sariska-tiger-reserve-safari-day-trip-with-l': {
    averageRating: 4.31,
    totalReviews: 3,
    guideRating: 4.31,
    valueRating: 4.31,
    reviews: [
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-04", text: "池で水浴びをしている虎を見ることができて満足です。その他には、鹿やクジャクを見ることができましたが、その他の動物は基本いません。広大な湿地帯や高いところから見るサバンナの光景には感動させられます。 ただ、サファリまでの道中は非常に道が悪く、過去に経験したことがないくらい揺れがすごいです。車酔いしやすい人は気をつけてください。", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-sariska-tiger-reserve-safari-day-trip-with-l/6504393/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Tom", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-05-27", text: "Very interesting trip, lots to see on the way, Chance to see tigers, (we did) nice lunch at the Sariska lodge. The drive to the Sariska Tiger reserve is very discovering Lot to learn about the villagers life, houses and colorful India. Safari was great! Tigers, deers, birds wildlife and nice surroundings, There is not enough information ( actually not at all) provided about tigers and all other animals from the guide or naturalists. Be aware that there is a chance that you will not see the tigers at all, we where lucky! We where not very happy with our tour guide, There was a 6 h drive both way, He did not provide the right level of information, about trip, India , At the coffee break twice we where waiting on the heat because the Van was locked and both the driver and tour guide was sitting inside the coffee shop. However we are overall Happy and we recommend this activity." },
    ],
  },
