  'delhi-street-art-walk-lodhi-art-district-urban': {
    averageRating: 4.77,
    totalReviews: 4,
    guideRating: 4.77,
    valueRating: 4.77,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Nicole", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-27", text: "Tour was excellent and very informative. I haven’t expected so many beautiful art pieces. Faizy knows a lot, he is very communicative and has good manners. I really enjoyed my trip and recommend it.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-street-art-walk-lodhi-art-district-urban/5640981/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-street-art-walk-lodhi-art-district-urban/5640982/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-street-art-walk-lodhi-art-district-urban/5640983/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Natasha", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-11-24", text: "This was a very rich experience. Faizy was an excellent guide and I learned not only about the origins of the art project, but also about the evolving social and political climate of Delhi. The art itself was thought-provoking, and I particularly enjoyed the exchange of ideas and sharing what each work evoked for us. The lunch was delicious and the conversation was free-flowing about art, literature, active and responsible citizenship and many topics in between. Thank you so much Faizy!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-street-art-walk-lodhi-art-district-urban/4725459/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Andrea", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-06", text: "Our street art tour through Lodhi Art District was like wandering through an open-air gallery with a splash of Delhi attitude. Every corner revealed another massive mural—bright colours, bold ideas, and stories hidden in the walls if you look closely. Our guide Faizy brought the artworks to life with fun facts and a bit of local gossip, turning a simple walk into a treasure hunt for creativity. If you love art, photos, or just exploring cool neighbourhoods, this tour is an absolute must. Delhi definitely knows how to paint the town!" },
      { author: "Nadine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-17", text: "great and interesting tour! Faizy gave us a lot of exciting background knowledge and responded to our questions and requests. He is a very likeable, open and friendly guide - we would love to see him again and make more tours with him!" },
    ],
  },
