  'delhi-taj-mahal-day-trip-by-express-train-with': {
    averageRating: 4.69,
    totalReviews: 23,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 4.78,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Carmen", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-07-30", text: "Goed en de gids was goed op de hoogte en heel informatief. Vond het lunch matig, was niet in overeenstemming met de beschrijving van de activiteit. Zeker geen 5star. Het ontbijt was goed, moest er zelf voor betalen. Dacht dat het in de prijs begrepen was. De begeleiding bij het ophalen van het hotel naar de trein en op het eind wegbrengen naar de trein en het ophalen was uitstekend.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-taj-mahal-day-trip-by-express-train-with/782065/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Raju", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-06-12", text: "Excellent experience, knowledgeable guide and unexpected stops makes this tour and the company worth it. Communication was seamless and helpful. I highly recommend this company and the tour." },
      { author: "Venuraam", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-04-11", text: "Ashik was a really good and patient guide. Explored the Taj Mahal and Agra Fort today and he was very informative. Answered all my questions and even took some amazing pictures. He knows all the good places as well. Shalin, my driver, was extremely well prepared - arrived on time with drinks and was very accommodating throughout the trip. Kudos to them both for making this a memorable trip" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-14", text: "Vinny the best guide sorry for car confusion but he arrange very easy and smoothly and he took us to the elephant place, and he didn’t force me for any shopping and his English is so easy to understand and I feel very comfortable with him and he asked me all the time for the cold water in offered me the beer also which so cool ." },
      { author: "Robert", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-10", text: "my guide Abdu war für mich ein sehr guter Führer" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-30", text: "Vinny went above and beyond and completely exceeded our expectations. He was incredibly attentive, made us feel safe in the crowds, and explained everything about the temple with amazing detail. His English is excellent, and he even brought us to the best local shops. We’re beyond satisfied and couldn’t have asked for a better experience." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-10-26", text: "Very nice tour guide, with a lot of knowledge. We had so much fun and got to learb about fascinating details. I would wish to come back just for this tour!" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-08-19", text: "Saleen was good vinny nice tour guide easy to Understand i m matteo" },
      { author: "Angelo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-08-13", text: "good" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-01-25", text: "The tour was very well organized, I was met at the hotel in Delhi, put on the train and in Agra I was met by Abdul my guide, he showed and explained everything in detail, he has good knowledge about the place and history, he also helped take photographs and knows all the beautiful places. palace, castle and wheelbarrow. In the evening he put me on a train and the driver met me in Delhi and took me to the hotel. It might have been better if they didn’t take me to all sorts of stores to buy something, I wasn’t interested in that at all, I still had to listen to the beauty and unusualness of this or another product, I didn’t like it, it would be better if they brought it somewhere in the city center and gave it to me time to walk around the city or normal shops, for example, a shopping center. everything else was perfect, Taj Mahal is amazingly beautiful even in the fog.." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-12-11", text: "Great guide Sunit was very informative, patient and friendly, really enjoyed the experience. My only complaint is that it would be beneficial if there was more precise communication regarding actual pickup time from the hotel. We had 6am as pick up but the train was departing at that time so a bit of miscommunication there. Also the train trip back we were seated backwards and not together, considering I paid for this trip months ago I would have liked better seating arrangements." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2023-12-06", text: "I have mixed reviews of this tour. First, the guide and driver deserve 5 stars! My guide was easy to find at the train station and had a sign with my name. He was also very friendly and informative. However, I rated this tour as 3 stars due to the company and logistics. I paid for the first class train, but was given a second class ticket. The second class train was a fine experience (and I would recommend for anyone booking) with comfortable seats and a good meal for the two hour journey, but the cost is very different. Secondly, I understand that most tours have some sort of sales aspect, but this tour had four separate sales stops (marble shop, jewelry shop, rug shop, and textiles shop) which I found to be excessive. On the positive side, the company was responsive via Whatsapp and the included lunch spot was good with a wide variety of items to order off a menu." },
    ],
  },
