    reviews: [
      { author: "Andrea", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-31", text: "We had a wonderful time exploring fabric shops and Old Delhi markets. We saw beautiful fabrics, trims, embroidered shoes and spices and tried some local foods. We also got bespoke clothes made for the next day. Shehla was very friendly, knowledgeable and accommodating, and all of her contacts were very helpful. Her colleague Sahil also shared interesting information about landmarks and Indian history. Highly recommend if you like shopping and maybe don't dare to explore Old Delhi markets on your own." },
      { author: "Bridget", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-23", text: "My guide RK was super accommodating. we went old Delhi and I have balance Ataxia desease and he hire a peddle cab for us so I could still see and shop the narrow streets. RK also showed me spice row. I came during monsoon season and he was still willing to take me to all the textile businesses. I bought a few items, don't forget to negotiate. Great experience" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-19", text: "RK was a great guide, especially in the scarily busy Delhi Old Market where he made sure to keep me close so we didn’t get separated by traffic. I really enjoyed browsing the markets." },
    ],
