  'delhi-to-agra-taj-mahal-round-trip-by-indias': {
    averageRating: 5.0,
    totalReviews: 8,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Alex", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-26", text: "Good tour, made it quick and easy to get around and visit all the attractions. The guide had lots of interesting facts and was helpful. I enjoyed the train as well, and there were people at both ends to make sure I didn’t get lost." },
      { author: "Norma I", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-02-18", text: "The driver went to pick us up at the wrong hotel, but we were only 5 minutes away, so we made it on time. The driver rushed us all through the train station so we could make it on time, just to get there 30 minutes earlier. He took us to the first class cabin (called executive class) located our seats, and took a picture of us. First class in an Indian trains: do not expect luxury. Once in Agra, our guide had our picture and met us (just two of us) as we exited the cabin. The tour was good, just enough time to visit the Taj, the Baby Taj, and the Red Fort. We had a buffet lunch at the Marriot that was very good. On the way back, the guide put us on the train, and once in Delhi, another driver greeted us at the exit of the cabin and took us to our hotel. The whole operation is well organized. The guides lack depth, so read up about the places you will see beforehand." },
      { author: "guillermo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-02-03", text: "Despite the train line not working. Suraj and Manvendre were great!" },
      { author: "Pol", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-02", text: "Muy bien! Nos acompañado todo momento y hablan muy bien español." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-08-29", text: "Vinod kumar exelent!!! Very goodd.. thanks" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-01-07", text: "Taj was beautiful, guide Suraj suggested to change plans because of the foggy wheater. That was great. We started at Baby taj, then Agra Fort and the most spectacular was the Taj!! We were VIP’s, we didn’t have to stand in lines!! Lunch was delicious in Marriott!" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-12-08", text: "The experience was amazing and Tanvir is a phenomenal guide. His knowledge is amazing and his ability to answer all your questions with precision is a great skill. If you ever get to do this trip with Tanvir you will have a great time and remember the awesome experience for life. I thoroughly recommend the trip." },
    ],
  },
