  'delhi-udaipur-guided-tour': {
    averageRating: 4.77,
    totalReviews: 19,
    guideRating: 4.75,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Federica", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-05", text: "Danish la mia guida è stata fantastica, abbiamo girato Delhi i mercati, moschee, templi. Mi ha raccontato tantissime cose interessanti della città e sull’India in generale. Una giornata assolutamente al di sopra delle aspettative. Assolutamente consigliato", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-udaipur-guided-tour/7954722/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-udaipur-guided-tour/7954723/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-udaipur-guided-tour/7954726/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-08", text: "Waren alle sehr gut !", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-udaipur-guided-tour/4850176/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-udaipur-guided-tour/4850177/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-udaipur-guided-tour/4850178/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "ioseph", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-07", text: "primo su tutti l'ottimo autista tinku singh, mi ha accompagnato durante tutto il tour con molta professionalita'. tutto il tour e' stato ben strutturato e ben organkzzato. tutto perfetto. in ogni citta' ho potuto vedere moltissime cose, grazie alle ottime guide sul posto. una bellissima esperienza. molto coinvolgente e consigliata.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-udaipur-guided-tour/4119708/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-udaipur-guided-tour/4119709/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-udaipur-guided-tour/4119710/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-29", text: "Karan es el mejor guia para visitar la ciudad. Su nivel de español es muy alto y permite entender todas las explicaciones de los diferentes sitios. Recomendable 100x100", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-udaipur-guided-tour/4010391/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Martin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-16", text: "Vipin did a very good job in explaining history, arts and peoples heritage to us. we saw a lot of interresting monuments, also the choice of restaurant was exzellent!" },
      { author: "Sera", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-01-17", text: "We had a good time on this trip. The transport was excellent. Our driver was very attentive and did a great job. Unfortunately he did not speak English but he was still very sympathetic. Our guide in Delhi (Mohammad) was nice but everything was super rushed and we got the feeling that he had somewhere else to be. This part felt like a disappointment. Our guides in Agra (Faz) and Jaipur (Rajesh) instead were really awesome and it was super interesting to explore the respective cities with them. Made the trip totally worth it. The guide in Udaipur was again a bit disappointing as he was also rushing through things and he only spent 3 hours with us until leaving us for the rest of the day. The most annoying parts were actually the organisation in the background (the org team did not communicate well with the driver so we never knew when to start the next day until late) and the selling stops that were included in every city. All in, it was still worth it and we’d recommend the trip." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-12", text: "Agra fort and Taj Mahal were fantastic. Amit was a great guide - very efficient!" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-28", text: "Karan was fantastic guide. He spoke fluent Spanish. We went to all the local markets abs monuments. He is extremely knowledgable about he history and local culture. Was punctual and polite." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-10", text: "Wir hatten eine sechstägige Tour Delhi-Agra-Jaipur-Udaipur-Delhi gebucht und diese dann noch um einen weiteren Tag in Delhi verlängert. Jeder Tag war ein großartiges und einzigartiges Erlebnis. Die Reise war perfekt organisiert und die Betreuung durch den Fahrer und die Guides in den einzelnen Städten herausragend gut. Alle Unterkünfte und die Verpflegung ließen keine Wünsche offen. Zuverlässigkeit, Pünktlichkeit und Freundlichkeit können nicht übertroffen werden. Wir fühlten uns immer sicher und gut beraten. Großartiger Service und sehr empfehlenswert. Unser besonderer Dank gilt unserem Fahrer Babban, den Guides Ashish in Dehli und Mischa in Jaipur. Dankeschön auch an unseren Guide in Agra, der wunderbare Fotos für uns gemacht hat." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-01", text: "Вот и подошли к концу 6 дней интереснейшего и незабываемого путешествия по прекрасной и интересной стране с приветливыми и улыбчивыми людьми. Страна, полная контрастов…в каждом городе к нам присоединялся другой гид. К сожалению в последним городе Удайпуре гид говорил только на Английском то что несомненно усложняло восприятие,но при помощи Гугл транслейт мы справились ,и он старался ответить на все наши вопросы снова и снова. все гиды были профессионалами.Особенно мы хотим отметить нашего водителя, Викрам.Он был не только отличным водителем, но и прежде всего замечательным человеком,чутким, заботливым и внимательным к нашим просьбам и желаниям во время тура.Мы ему очень благодарны и рады были познакомиться. Одно замечание по составлению программы-примечание компании: нас каждый день везли на разные фирменные магазины для рекламы продукции и настойчиво предлагали купить.нам это было не комфортно." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-27", text: "Our driver Arun was great he managing to navigate through the chaotic traffic with the calmness of a saint. We had at different guide for each city, Ruhul in Delhi, Anshu in Agra, Irfan in Jaipur and Hemendra in Udaipur each explain the history of the Temple, Fort, Palace or Museum we visited. Answered any questions we had, add to that they also were our personal photographer we have photos we will treasure." },
      { author: "Beatrice", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-02-17", text: "Unsere Fahrer war überpünktlich, sehr verlässlich und ein sehr sicherer Fahrer, auch bei Kühen und Geisterfahrern auf der Autobahn! Die Guides waren sehr nett, auch wenn wir manche nicht ganz so gut verstanden haben. Die Hotels würden wir uns beim nächsten Mal selbst buchen." },
    ],
  },
