  'from-delhi-2-days-jim-corbett-tiger-safari-tour': {
    averageRating: 3.88,
    totalReviews: 6,
    guideRating: 3.88,
    valueRating: 3.88,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Nasťa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2023-10-04", text: "Driver who picked us up in front of the hotel was there in time and our journey was very safe. Unfortunately he didn’t have information about our hotel in the park and it was a bit of a problem to find the hotel on the map. After arriving everything was quite hectic, quick lunch and jump into the gypsy in which we rode about 1 hour to the safari entrance (quite too long distance). We came back at about 8pm and in the morning woke up really early to be ready for a pickup time at 5am. The gypsy came late and we were waiting 20 min. Unfortunately we didn’t see the tigers, but we understand it was not really a season. The staff was kind, but we had a feeling that people who supposed to organise our accommodation and transportation weren’t informed and expected us to inform them about every step of our timetable." },
      { author: "Kevin J.", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2025-01-24", text: "Very cold and did not see any tigers" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2024-04-16", text: "Hello I will address each issue separately. 1. Our driver was amazing. Punctual, professional, funny, polite and a very good driver. 2. Whoever was trying to get in touch with me on Whatsapp was very annoying. The person kept saying hurry up you are late for the safari. I could not help that the traffic was bad. Also the ride from Delhi was 6 hrs. It would have been nice for a warning that it was so long. 3. If you think the hotel we stayed in was a five star, you need to take another look. Black mold on the shower all over. Very small AMT of toilet paper. Food was not great. However the staff tried to get me something non spicy. Not their fault really only cater to Indian people. 4. Grounds were beautiful and well kept. 5. Good hot water 6. Too far from safari. Thought we were staying in the park. 7. Pictures on the Internet were misleading of the resort. Overall just adequate. As a travel agent I would warn my clients this is nowhere near a five star. Only maybe 2.5" },
    ],
  },
