  'from-delhi-all-inclusive-taj-mahal-day-tour-with': {
    averageRating: 4.96,
    totalReviews: 38,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 4.86,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Pratyusha", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-21", text: "Hilal was an excellent tour guide, who made the experience all the more amazing. He was passionate about the history and significance and treated us with the best hospitality in the city of Agra. Loved it! Rajat drove us from Gurgaon to Agra and back and was a very good driver and took good care of us despite tricky weather conditions.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-all-inclusive-taj-mahal-day-tour-with/4955754/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-all-inclusive-taj-mahal-day-tour-with/4955757/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-all-inclusive-taj-mahal-day-tour-with/4955759/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Aida", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-03-07", text: "Hyder Ali and Kapil were excellent, our tour was very informative, and we saw everything we wanted to see! Everything also went incredibly smoothly with our airport pickup. Highly recommend!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-all-inclusive-taj-mahal-day-tour-with/240045/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "William", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-02-18", text: "Our recent tour with guide Adil Khan and driver Vijay was nothing short of extraordinary. From the moment we embarked on our adventure, it was evident that we were in for an exceptional experience. Adil Khan, our guide, was an absolute gem. His wealth of knowledge about the sites we visited was impressive. Not only did he provide insightful information about the historical and cultural significance of each location, but he also shared captivating anecdotes that brought the landmarks to life. His passion for his work was evident in every word he spoke, making our journey all the more engaging and memorable. His photography was amazing and captured such precious moments that will last for a lifetime. Our guide made so many suggestions to make this memorable trip even more special. We are very grateful for this company and our guides and driver. My wife had the best day of her life, even shedding a tear at the end.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-all-inclusive-taj-mahal-day-tour-with/199539/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Tasmania", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-01-10", text: "We had a great time in our tour specially because of our tour guide Syed that knows a lot about Taj Mahal and Agra Fort history and it’s a nice person too so it was an amazing experience.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-all-inclusive-taj-mahal-day-tour-with/147562/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Raquel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-03-23", text: "El tour ha superado las expectativas! Nuestro guia Rakesh nos ha informado todo muy bien, el desayuno buffet el hilton fue muy bueno!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-all-inclusive-taj-mahal-day-tour-with/279812/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-all-inclusive-taj-mahal-day-tour-with/279813/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Nicola", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-12", text: "GuideHemendra pratap was a perfect guide, very professional and friendly. thanks for day highly recommend!" },
      { author: "Mathilde", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-08-21", text: "We spent a very good time visiting the Taj Mahal with this tour. A driver came to take us at our hotel, in Delhi, and drive us directly to Taj Mahal. He was very sympathic, and drove very safely, which is pretty rare in Delhi. We really felt in security during the whole trip by car. We met our guide by arriving in Agra, and we had the good surprise to discover that he spoke french, which was very appreciated. He explained us everything about Taj Mahal, and took very good pictures of us. We went then to a nice and modern restaurant, which serves typical indian food. After that, the guide proposed to take us to cashemire store, but we preferred to discover a marble factory, and a jewelry that proposes jewels with indian precious stones. We recommend this tour to have an effective but complete journey to Agra and Taj Mahal." },
      { author: "Beatrix", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-04-10", text: "Both our driver Vishnu and our guide Adil was very heplful and flexible. They both told a lot of interesting facto. The tour was incredible, and really worth to attend. I recommend very much!" },
      { author: "Alberto", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-04-09", text: "Shaan and pooran did a Very good job . Taj mahal and fort is amazing and I enjoyed a lot with both Of them . 10/10" },
      { author: "Georgina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-04-06", text: "Picked up on time and a very smooth journey by Ankur straight to meet our wonderful guide Shaan who provided a very informative and enjoyable tour of the Taj Mahal and Agra Fort. Very easy, slick and felt we in good hands the entire time. Would definitely recommend!" },
      { author: "Moemen", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-02-29", text: "Amazing day visiting the majestical Taj Mahal, we were picked up on time, driven safely to the destination. Our guide was very knowledgeable and patient and polite with us. He was also amazing at knowing the best photo spots" },
      { author: "Ana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-02-03", text: "The tour was amazing. The driver was completely on time for the pickup and he came directly to my hotel. Driving felt safe and comfortable. Also we took a rest to get some te and food. My guide Kashif received me in Agra, with everything prepared. His explanations were clear and interesting, and he was able to speak Spanish pretty well. Also they offered me two different options for having lunch, and I was able to enjoy a great indian food. Overall an great experience, 100% recommended!" },
    ],
  },
