  'from-delhi-royal-india-in-5-days-india-golden': {
    averageRating: 5.0,
    totalReviews: 4,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Radoslav", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-08", text: "So far perfectly managed. Taj was a great guide and makes nice photos as well. I can recommend this tour. Well balanced and well prepared. They adjusted pace and program to our needs with small child.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-royal-india-in-5-days-india-golden/5732997/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-royal-india-in-5-days-india-golden/5733002/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-royal-india-in-5-days-india-golden/5733003/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Ella", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-17", text: "Our tour of the Golden Triangle was incredible. We had Tajuddin as our guide in Agra and he was an excellent guide. He was very knowledgeable about all of the sites we went to visit and gave us plenty of time to explore each of the sites. He took lots of photos for us, so that we have memories from each of these places forever. Tajuddin gave us recommendations of places to go for dinner and was very open to adjusting the tour to suit our preferences, which was great. The visit to the Taj Mahal at sunrise was especially brilliant and he took better photos than any photographers could have done! I would highly recommend booking this tour!" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-19", text: "長距離運転でも安全運転でありがとうございました。現地の観光は人も多くガイドがいると安心です、" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-25", text: "We had an all inclusive tour, a full time driver, Raza, during all the five days, guides at each place, accomodation, and admission ticket to all monuments. We liked the tour a lot because of several things, at each place the guides were waiting for us, they got our tickets to the monuments so we did not need to wait in queues or wonder where to buy or how to pay. the guides, Pahlavi. Adel Khan, Asad, and Krishan were all knowledgeable, friendly and easy to communicate. Our driver, Raza, who was with us during the whole tour was very forthcoming and flexible and made changes to the route if we had any wishes that differed from the scheduled tour. He was a good driver for the crazy Indian traffic too. He wa always on time waiting for us at the hotel every morning and outside each monument, very comfortable. We are very happy with the tour and recommend to anybody. who want to make a similar tour." },
    ],
  },
