    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Diego", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-04", text: "I had a great time experience, my driver was great and very polite and my tour guide in Agra Shelendra Tiwari a spoke good English and was knowledgeable!! The included lunch was phenomenal 😋", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-same-day-taj-mahal-agra-day-tour/2517609/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-same-day-taj-mahal-agra-day-tour/2517610/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Parth", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-06-27", text: "We booked a same day tour from Find my holidays . It was really awesome experience with our Guide Kadir from the company. He explained all the facts related to Taj and also clicked so many good photos of the Taj . What a unexpected beauty which explained with the proper mannered by our guide. And what a driver Sanjay provided by the company always on time, smiling face and very calm and ready to work with his excellence. I would recommend every to go with Find My Holidays such amazing service provider company which offer a great deals on tours." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-29", text: "this trip was very good. pankaj is an excellent guide - very knowledgeable, attentive and generous. i learned a lot about agra and its huge and precious cultural heritage! and about indian culture in general. and : the good thing with this tour is: you can vist the baby taj mahal. dont miss it! highly recommended! shyamsundar is a very good and secure driver." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-10-21", text: "Our incredible tour began with a seamless hotel pickup, which marked the start of our journey from Delhi to Agra. Upon our arrival, we were warmly greeted by our exceptional tour guide, Jitendra. Throughout the day, Jitendra proved to be the true highlight of our trip. He was not only immensely helpful but also incredibly informative and patient with us. His vivid descriptions of the magnificent Taj Mahal left us in awe. Jitendra's assistance in navigating the local culture and interactions with the people added to our appreciation of the experience. By the end of the day, we had forged a friendship with him, and we were immensely grateful to have had such an outstanding tour guide by our side." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-06-27", text: "Excellent trip with Santosh (driver) and Kadir (tour guide). We were picked up at 2:30am as requested and the car ride was smooth and comfortable and Santos was happy to answer any of our questions or stop if we needed the toilet. Kadir was an excellent tour guide and gave us great information as well as knowing where to get the best photos. Excellent trip and well worth the money. Great communication before and throughout the trip." },
    ],
