  'from-delhi-sunrise-private-taj-mahal-tour-with': {
    averageRating: 4.92,
    totalReviews: 14,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "arun", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-10-01", text: "I had an unforgettable tour visiting three incredible sites in Agra: the Taj Mahal, Agra Fort, and the Baby Taj, all topped off with a serene boat ride. Advik, our tour guide, truly made the experience exceptional. His knowledge, passion, and storytelling skills brought these historical landmarks to life. He answered all our questions with enthusiasm and made the tour engaging. Sarfraz, our driver, ensured a smooth and comfortable journey throughout the day. His punctuality and safe driving allowed us to enjoy each destination without any worries. The boat ride was a perfect way to end the day, offering a unique perspective of the Taj Mahal from the Yamuna River. Overall, this tour exceeded my expectations, thanks to Advik's expertise and Sarfraz's reliability. I highly recommend this experience to anyone visiting Agra – it's a perfect blend of history, culture, and relaxation." },
      { author: "Subin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-05-05", text: "I recently took a tour package from Delhi to Agra, and it was fantastic! The transportation provided was comfortable and well-maintained. In Agra, our tour guide Mr Rajan was knowledgeable and passionate, bringing the history of the Taj Mahal and other sites to life. Highly recommend this tour!" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-26", text: "I had an amazing experience on the same-day tour from Agra! The itinerary was perfectly planned, allowing us to visit the iconic Taj Mahal, Agra Fort, and the beautiful Mehtab Bagh—all in just one day. Our guide was knowledgeable, friendly, and shared fascinating historical insights at every stop. The vehicle was clean and comfortable, and the driver was punctual and courteous. What impressed me most was the smooth coordination everything was on time, and we never felt rushed despite the tight schedule. This tour is perfect for travelers short on time but wanting to explore the rich heritage of Agra. Highly recommended for anyone looking to make the most out of a day." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-22", text: "Absolutely amazing experience! The tour was perfectly organized from start to finish. Our driver was punctual and polite, and the car was very comfortable. The guide in Agra was knowledgeable and made the history of the Taj Mahal come alive. We also visited Agra Fort and had a delicious lunch at a clean local restaurant. Even though it was a same-day trip, everything was smooth and well-timed. Highly recommended for anyone who wants to see the Taj Mahal in one day." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-19", text: "Feasible but tiring day trip. Efficiently covers the Taj Mahal and potentially Agra Fort. Choose between comfortable private car (longer travel) Guided tours are highly recommended for historical context. Expect a packed itinerary and be prepared for significant travel time. Good option for those with limited time wanting to see the Taj Mahal." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-19", text: "hemos visto taj mahal fort y fatehpur sikri y fuimos agra con una guia que se llama yusuf khan su fecilidad muy Bien estamos muy muy alegro sobre Este agencia gracias por todos" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-18", text: "The boat ride provides a different vantage point of the Taj Mahal, allowing you to see the rear view and its reflection on the Yamuna River. This offers a less crowded and often more tranquil experience compared to the main entrance. Serene Experience: Drifting along the Yamuna River can be a peaceful contrast to the bustling crowds around the Taj Mahal. Photo Opportunities: You'll have the chance to capture stunning and unique photographs of the Taj Mahal from the boat. Duration: The boat ride itself typically lasts between 30 minutes to an hour. The entire tour, including travel to and from Agra (if starting from Delhi), the Taj Mahal visit, and potentially other sites like Agra Fort." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-09", text: "I really appreciate this beautiful Tour spacially Boat Ride from back side of Magnificent Taj Mahal. I also visited Agra fort and baby Taj Also Very good. My Guide Abdul and Driver Rakesh Were Excellent. I fully Recommend To this Boat Ride tour." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-09", text: "I visited Taj Mahal and boat Ride i was ret happy to booked this Tour my Guide. Mr Khan and Driver Raju were excellent overall my trip was fantastic. I Recommended this beautiful Tour." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-10", text: "Absolutely Magical Experience – A Must-Do in Agra! This tour exceeded all expectations! From start to finish, everything was smooth, professional, and perfectly timed. Our guide was incredibly knowledgeable and passionate about the history of Agra, making the Taj Mahal and Agra Fort come alive with fascinating stories and insights. The highlight for me was the boat ride on the Yamuna River – seeing the Taj Mahal from the water, away from the crowds, as the sun began to set was simply unforgettable. It gave us such a peaceful, intimate view of the monument that you don’t get from the main entrance. It honestly felt like a scene from a movie. Transportation was clean and comfortable, and the entire team made us feel safe and well-cared-for throughout. Highly recommend this tour to anyone visiting Agra – especially if you want something extra special beyond the usual sightseeing." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-12-02", text: "Pankaj our tour guys was amazing. He had a great knowledge of history and passion for his work. Very friendly and accommodating- also an amazing photographer. !!He made our trip to Agra an unforgettable experience . Thank you" },
    ],
  },
