  'from-delhi-sunrise-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5': {
    averageRating: 5.0,
    totalReviews: 31,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 4.94,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Marina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-30", text: "Great experience! From the transport with Rajesh and the tour with Aqib everything went really well. Great car, photos, stopped for coffee with no rush…I really recommend it, and also for solo female travelers as myself, you can trust it!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-sunrise-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5/5998908/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-sunrise-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5/5998909/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Irina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-02", text: "Great experience seeing Taj Mahal with Aquib. He was really resourceful, gave us all the information that we needed to understand the beauty and complexity of the palace. We had a delicious breakfast both Indian and international cuisine, really nice atmosphere. Our guide Aquib was very patient and took us some beautiful photos so we can remember this moments. Great experience.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-sunrise-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5/5669952/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-sunrise-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5/5669953/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-sunrise-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5/5669954/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Masahiro", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-22", text: "ガイドのアディルさんの詳しい説明と充実した内容のツアーで非常に満足しました", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-sunrise-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5/8289806/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-07", text: "\"\"My DREAMY TOUR with my Husband completed with full of joy and happy with the help of guide JUGNU Bhaiya...The guide,JUGNU bhai is very knowledgeable and enthusiastic to explain each and every thing with patience and definitely shown hospitality throughout the tour... That sounds like a really special tour throughout my Lifrle along with my Husband Saheb💛.\"\" *Having someone walk you through Taj Mahal pin to pin from the very start of construction makes all the difference. Most people just see the marble, but when a guide,He was not a Guide to us but we felt like our Elder BROTHER who named as JUGNU Bhaiya explains the story of MUMTAZ MAHAL, SHAH JAHAN'S vision, and even the FATEHPURI MASJID on the grounds, it turns into something you feel Special to your Heart's and very Blessed.* To be frank,Everyone's to be guided as JUGNU BHAI...He is the best explanatory person.Thankyou so much.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-sunrise-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5/7502703/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Landais", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-10", text: "Nous sommes revenus ravis de notre excursion au Taj Mahal. Notre guide Imran, dont le niveau de français est très bon, s’est montré très professionnel, sympathique et drôle. Il était aux petits soins avec nous, afin que nous passions une journée exceptionnelle. Ses explications en français étaient à la fois complètes et claires !!!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-sunrise-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5/6162287/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Maggy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-14", text: "Imran was een fantastische gids. Hij heeft ons snel naar binnen geleid waardoor wij de drukte voor waren. Hij vertelde leuke feiten over de Taj Mahal. Daarnaast maakte hij leuke en creatieve foto’s. Wij raden deze activiteit met Imran erg aan !", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-sunrise-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5/5799295/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-sunrise-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5/5799297/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Vladut", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-25", text: "Întotdeauna ghidul face turul. Iar atunci când ai un ghid ca Ishan, turul este de la excelent in sus. Ai parte de experiența completă cu informații detaliate. Bonus primești cele mai bune fotografii. Și este și un om minunat. 5 ✨ +. Felicitări!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-sunrise-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5/4728730/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-sunrise-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5/4728731/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-sunrise-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5/4728732/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Rafał", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-10", text: "Wspaniała wycieczka, świetna organizacja. Pan Imran jest profesjonalny w tym co robi, opowiada z pasją, zaangażowaniem. Jego otwartość i uprzejmość sprawiła u nas duży komfort. Pan Imran jest świetnym fotografem. Na pewno zapamiętamy tą wizytę na zawsze.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-sunrise-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5/4563300/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Rakan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-24", text: "I had an amazing day with Imran! The tour was so wonderful and he was very knowledgeable! I would highly recommend booking this tour for an easy hassle free Taj Mahal/Agra experience!" },
      { author: "Lewis", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-13", text: "Pick up was promptly on time. The taxi driver, Shyam, was safe and regularly checking if I needed any rest breaks during the long journeys to and back from Delhi to Agra. The tour guide, Jugnu, was very experienced and knew his stuff. He also gave great advice about avoiding scams and dealing with the inevitable traders that will approach you on the way in and out of the popular tourist spots. Jugnu keenly suggested many great spots for photography and took some great photos of me to help remember this unforgettable tour. The only disappointment was not getting the 5-star hotel breakfast, however, an alternative was provided and good enough. All in all I had a great day and I'm grateful for the knowledgeable and helpful tour guide that was Jugnu. Words can't describe the feeling of actually being in the presence of the great Taj Mahal, it's something everyone needs to experience for themselves. Advise going early for the sunrise when it's less crowded and less hot." },
      { author: "Ecaterina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-02", text: "The tour was very interesting, the guide was telling a lot of interesting facts and took amazing pictures for me! Great experience for reasonable price!" },
      { author: "Irene", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-14", text: "Jugnu was a very good guide. We did a great tour from Delhi. Excellent explanations and very attentive. Thanks so much for showing us the Taj Mahal" },
    ],
  },
