  'from-delhi-taj-mahal-agra-city-day-tour-all': {
    averageRating: 5.0,
    totalReviews: 2,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Korchagin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-29", text: "The guide really helped us fall in love with Agra. Everything was very interesting and well-organized; there were no lines anywhere, there was always water, and the transfer was on time. We were also pleasantly surprised that the guide spoke excellent Russian and could explain all the information in a language we could understand. гид максимально помог нам влюбиться в агру. Все было очень инетересно и хорошо организовано, нигде не стояли в очередях, всегда была вода и трансфер был вовремя. Также были приятно удивлены, что гид отлично владеет русским и всю информацию может продублировать на более понятном для нас языке.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-agra-city-day-tour-all/6457482/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Archie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-19", text: "We had an excellent experience with our tour guide, Malick, during our visit to the Taj Mahal and Agra Fort. From the start, he was friendly, professional, and spoke very clear English, which made everything easy to understand and enjoyable. Malick was incredibly knowledgeable and shared fascinating details about how the Taj Mahal was built, explaining the history and craftsmanship in a way that really brought the monument to life. It wasn’t just a tour—it felt like a story unfolding as we walked through such an iconic place. He also took us to a great spot for food, which we really appreciated, and made sure we were comfortable throughout the day. On top of that, he surprised us with a free souvenir, which was a thoughtful and memorable touch. The visit to Agra Fort was just as impressive, with Malick continuing to provide insightful explanations and making sure we didn’t miss any important details. Overall, Malick made our trip unforgettable. If you’re visiting I recommend 👍" },
    ],
  },
  'from-delhi-taj-mahal-agra-city-private-tour-by': {
    averageRating: 4.91,
    totalReviews: 8,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Pedro", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-24", text: "Hello this visit was very interesting, it’s a long travel with car but worth it to make. Our guide NEKRAM did explain very well all the details and history of the places we visited and was always there to help us with pictures too, so I hardly recommend to anyone. Thank You…", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-agra-city-private-tour-by/1844080/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-agra-city-private-tour-by/1844081/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-agra-city-private-tour-by/1844082/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Anisha", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-06", text: "We had a fantastic day at the Taj Mahal with our guide Shahid and our driver Raza. Shahid was incredibly knowledgeable about the history and details of the Taj and Agra, but explained everything in a way that was easy to understand and never boring. He knew all the best photo spots, helped us avoid the crowds, and took beautiful photos for us. He was kind, patient, and very respectful. Raza was an excellent driver. The car was clean and comfortable, he was always on time, and we felt very safe with him in the busy traffic. He waited for us without any rush and was very polite throughout the day. We would highly recommend booking Shahid as your Taj Mahal guide and Raza as your driver. They made our visit smooth, stress free, and truly memorable." },
      { author: "Jessie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-24", text: "Jelly was a brilliant guide he showed us loads around Agra, around the history and also around modern day India! He collected us on time and also gave us some recommendations for a souvenir shop and restaurants which was really helpful! Thanks again Jelly for an amazing trip we thoroughly enjoyed!" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-29", text: "If you’re going to Taj—especially on a packed, high-energy night—Vinny is the reason your experience goes from good to absolutely unforgettable. The crowd was HUGE, wall-to-wall, and somehow Vinny made it feel like every single person mattered. That takes real skill. From the moment we got there, his professionalism, confidence, and positive energy stood out. Even with nonstop orders and people everywhere, he stayed calm, organized, and genuinely friendly. Drinks were made quickly and perfectly every single time, no shortcuts, no attitude—just top-tier service. He kept things moving smoothly while still making time to interact, joke, and keep the vibe fun and welcoming. What really impressed me was how well he managed the chaos. Anyone can bartend when it’s slow, but Vinny shines when it’s slammed. He reads the room, handles pressure like a pro, and somehow remembers faces and orders in the middle of the madness. That kind of talent is rare. Because of Vinny, the night flowed effort" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-31", text: "That was great" },
      { author: "Sarah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-02-17", text: "Les visites étaient super intéressantes. nous remercions notre guide, Imran. les anecdotes racontées et les informations données étaients super intéressantes et nous ont aidé à mieux comprendre l'histoire de l'Inde et ces divers monuments. le chauffeur ainsi que Imran ont eté serviables et leur présences étaients appréciables. Petit soucis c'est que nous avons reservé un guide qui devait parler français mais cela n'a pas été fournir par le prestataire." },
    ],
  },
