  'from-delhi-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5-star': {
    averageRating: 4.78,
    totalReviews: 309,
    guideRating: 4.86,
    valueRating: 4.76,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Lulu", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-31", text: "Trip was awesome, i had a good time there in Agra. Driver (Rajesh) and tour guide (Mahipal) were very kind and very helpful to me. They took me to 3 different historical sites and i also had a good lunch at Marriott Hotel very recommended and worth the price!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5-star/7859511/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5-star/7859512/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5-star/7859513/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Isabel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-15", text: "Amazing can recommend! They offer a comfortabel experience and the guide and driver were very nice!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5-star/7582461/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5-star/7582463/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Valeriya", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-17", text: "We had an absolutely fantastic private tour with both a driver and a guide. Everything was perfectly organized from start to finish, and we felt very well taken care of throughout the entire day. The driver Shrawan Ji was safe and professional, and the car was clean and comfortable. Our guide was incredibly friendly, knowledgeable, and engaging – we learned so many interesting things that we would never have discovered on our own. We highly recommend this private tour to anyone looking for a comfortable, informative, and tailor-made experience. It was definitely one of the highlights of our trip!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5-star/7191702/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Warren", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-14", text: "absolutely amazing experience from start to finish. Both my driver and tour guide were friendly, proffessional and knowledgeable. I highly recommend Rashid as your guide. He takes very proffessional photos for you.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5-star/6661583/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5-star/6661584/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5-star/6661585/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Andrea", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-06", text: "Amazing driver, amazing guide, perfect day! I will bring home more than just the Taj Mahal: a lot of curiosities and knowledge about India and its wonderful people", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5-star/6109622/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5-star/6109623/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5-star/6109624/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Yasuhiro", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-10-01", text: "The driver picked us up in time. We had a good conversation with him on our way to Agra. We had a coffee break on the way & arrive Agra without any delay. The guide had a lot of knowledge about Indian history including the details of Taji Mahal. We really enjoyed the tour. We appreciate if the car drive more slowly especially when we go through the clouded city road.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5-star/1196696/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5-star/1196697/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Paulo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-25", text: "The driver picked me up on time and drove carefully. He was friendly and chatty and stopped on the way for breakfast. Then we met the guide who is very experienced, knowledgeable, respectful, polite and took nice pictures. We covered the itinerary without feeling rushed. Communication was easy and straightforward. Then on the way back to Delhi the driver recommended a nice restaurant for lunch. I’m very pleased with the full day tour and would definitely recommend it!" },
      { author: "Dawid", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-02", text: "The drivers arrived on time, and the car was very clean and air-conditioned. They looked after us everywhere, and we felt safe." },
      { author: "Christian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-06", text: "Everything was excellent! My driver, Ashok, and my private tour guide, Majipal, were magnificent. They provided outstanding service and were always respectful and attentive, especially as I was travelling on my own. I highly recommend them if you want to discover Agra and visit one of the Seven Wonders of the World: the Taj Mahal. Chris" },
      { author: "Bente", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-03", text: "I felt safe throughout the entire experience, especially as a woman traveling alone. Monish was very kind, professional, and always made sure I felt comfortable. I also received plenty of clear explanations during the trip. The driver took my wishes into account, and the guide was great at taking beautiful photos!" },
      { author: "Takuma", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-18", text: "The Taj Mahal became a living story! Shakeel was a knowledgeable, thoughtful, and attentive guide. He explained not only the history of the Taj Mahal, but also its culture, beliefs, craftsmanship, and connection with present-day India. Thanks to him, we noticed many fascinating details we would have missed on our own. He also knew the best places to take photographs, even in the crowds—almost as if he had a secret agreement with the Taj Mahal! By the end of the tour, it felt like much more than a beautiful monument. It had become a living story of love, art, and history. I highly recommend experiencing the Taj Mahal with Shakeel." },
      { author: "Tim", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-22", text: "What a great day trip while transiting though India. Shashi was there at the airport with a sign with my name on, who then happily put my suitcase in the book of his car and chatted away as he drove my to Agra for the day. There we collected the guide and went around the three sites (just be prepared that the Taj Mahal will be very busy and everyone wants photos in the centre). It was an enjoyable visit. the 5 star lunch that followed was amazing! Then a brief stop at a marble carvers and leaving the guide behind, we drove back to New Delhi and my hotel. the driver stood out as a friendly person who made the whole day a smooth process. All in all the trip took a little over 12 hrs - I was exhausted by the end (having come from an overnight flight), but it was well worth it. Thanks Shashi!" },
    ],
  },
