  'from-delhi-taj-mahal-day-trip-by-high-speed': {
    averageRating: 4.94,
    totalReviews: 45,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 4.9,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Charlotte", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-02", text: "Hi my guide for my trip to Agra, as a solo lady traveller, was Hemendra Pratap Singh Tomar. I can't recommend him enough, his knowledge is outstanding and manners impeccable. I felt very comfortable and that he put alot of effort in making the tour great and with a high quality buffet lunch included, he went the extra mile. If you are researching for a tour of Agra you will not be disappointed with this.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-day-trip-by-high-speed/4798513/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Bethany", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-10-05", text: "Allan was my tour guide and Raju the driver. Great day trip with everything included! Door to door service. Very polite, thoughtful and professional and made to feel safe as a female solo traveller, especially keeping the souvenir sellers away.Lovely lunch in the Hilton and was able to have a gluten free meal! Very knowledgeable about the history and culture! Kept offering to get drinks for me and made sure I always had water! Also great photographer and knows all the good spots!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-day-trip-by-high-speed/1219858/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "nor", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-29", text: "Allan Roy sangat sangar helpful. semua jadi mudah and wonderful trip.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-day-trip-by-high-speed/8421982/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Benny", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-25", text: "Kashif he is very good guard n good care", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-day-trip-by-high-speed/2026843/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-day-trip-by-high-speed/2026844/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-day-trip-by-high-speed/2026845/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Ursula", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-20", text: "Die Erklärungen von Herrn Akil waren sehr spannend. Daher habe ich den Ausflug sehr genossen. Das er wie ich auch noch ein Udo Jürgens Fan ist und ihn begleitet hat am Taj Mahal. War wirklich super - Danke!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-day-trip-by-high-speed/1826286/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-day-trip-by-high-speed/1826287/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-day-trip-by-high-speed/1826288/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Estefania", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-11", text: "Fue una experiencia muy agradable y aprovechamos muy bien el tiempo en el tour. El chofer y los guías traductores muy amables y atentos en todo momento. Sin duda alguna recomendamos sus servicios!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-day-trip-by-high-speed/1460830/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Adam", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-23", text: "Afreen was fantastic, good knowledge and communication, very welcoming and accommodating." },
      { author: "Juliet", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-14", text: "Having a very knowledgeable guide makes all the difference in visiting iconic places like the Taj Mahal. Rahul Sharma explained historical, architectural, and cultural things that I came away with a better understanding of this place and its people. I was very fortunate to have him as a guide. And order the lunch…the Indian was outstanding and safe😋" },
      { author: "Stefan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-17", text: "Transport by train was fast and efficient. Rahul Sharma was a fantastic guide and explained us everything. He was very knowledgeable so no question remained unanswered." },
      { author: "Marijke", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-07", text: "I had a very nice day visiting Agra with Rahul Sharma & Rahul Kekked The pickup in the morning was perfectly on time and the driver took me to my correct seat on the train. in Agra we virst visited the Taj Mahal which was very beautiful. Rahul is very knowledgeable and has a lot of stories to tell. He knows everything about the Indian history. The lunch at the hotel was very nice. After that, we visited the Agra Fort. Rahul took the time to explain everything and take a lot of photos. I felt very safe during this day and on the road. Can recommend this tour to everyone." },
      { author: "Jane", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-22", text: "Alan has been a wonderful guide. He gave us great information and interesting titbits about everything we saw and provided us with the best spots for photos, including the famous Diana seat. He made the trip engaging and informative. The train trip was relaxing and provided a nice meal. The lunch later in the day was delicious and a lovely break in the middle of the day in lovely surroundings. Everyone has been exactly on time in picking us up near our Delhi hotel, delivering us safely to the train and our guide having our photo to meet us in Agra for our tour of the Taj Mahal. An excellent tour and we thoroughly enjoyed it. Thank you." },
      { author: "Kelly", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-07", text: "AMAZING!! Alan Roy super nice. Beautiful garden and really kind community, recommend it for sure! Queues were very short. I don’t have any negative feedback it was the best experience of my life!!!!" },
    ],
  },
