  'from-jaipur-private-ranthambore-tour-by-car': {
    averageRating: 4.29,
    totalReviews: 29,
    guideRating: 3.93,
    valueRating: 3.75,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Thien", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-13", text: "I booked the tiger safari by canter through Maliq who i have to shout out is a great guy and excellent communicator which made the whole process hassle and more importantly stress free! He was very responsive and accommodating to my schedule which as an overseas tourist you know it can be daunting but thankfully it was a good experience with this trip, always taking care of my well-being with breaks as needed! The safari trip itself, I didn't manage to see any tigers but you have to understand you're in their territory and work to their schedule. still it is a great experience and you still get to see a variety of fauna such as croco files, deers, monkeys and birds that you kind of wander how they manage to coexist! as such you should go into the tour with experiencing the national park in all its glory, and if you get to see tigers that's a welcomed bonus! All in all I would definately recommend doing the safari tour and with maliq you can't go wrong!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-jaipur-private-ranthambore-tour-by-car/4212888/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Claire", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-07", text: "Our driver Santosh was wonderful, our transport to and from the park was very easy and we had time to stop for a good lunch. Made for a very easy experience. If you can book ahead and get in the smaller gypsy car I recommend so you have a better chance of seeing the tigers close up!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-jaipur-private-ranthambore-tour-by-car/2294411/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-jaipur-private-ranthambore-tour-by-car/2294412/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-jaipur-private-ranthambore-tour-by-car/2294413/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Anders", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-09", text: "The visit to the park is intense, at the end you see many animals in the wild which is the point of this tour, the guides lend all their energy to offer you the best view of the tigers, in my case I would have liked to see a little more other animals but I understand that the point is the tigers, if you don’t have much time in Jaipur as is my case it is the best option, Maliq, is from the area and is very clear what travellers need to see at least without leaving Jaipur. Highly recommended 😀", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-jaipur-private-ranthambore-tour-by-car/1923662/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-jaipur-private-ranthambore-tour-by-car/1923663/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-jaipur-private-ranthambore-tour-by-car/1923664/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "John", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-16", text: "the safari was amazing and along with get transportation to and from, would highly recommend" },
      { author: "Zoe", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-13", text: "We had an amazing experience seeing a variety of animals—including tigers! Everything was fantastic, and there’s nothing we would change." },
      { author: "Elena", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-08", text: "Maliq picked me up on time from the hotel and drove to Ranthambore, which was ~3.5h away. From there I hopped on a canter and we set off to the national park. We were in zone 3 of the park, which as I heard has a higher chance to see a tiger. And we were lucky to see two tigers that day! It was an amazing experience to see a tiger in its natural habitat. The safari ride itself was a bit short ~2-2.5 hours but was worth it, because we saw a tiger hunting for deers (without success though), which was incredible! On the way back to Jaipur we stopped for dinner at one of the restaurants by the road. Overall, it was a great and memorable adventure!" },
      { author: "Alexis", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-25", text: "It was a great experience. I really enjoyed seeing the animals and the landscape was amazing!!" },
      { author: "Tobias", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-03", text: "Liked the Tour. My Driver was Great. Sadly no tigers seen but still good tour." },
      { author: "simon", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-09", text: "brilliant day well organised nadeem was a great driver ensured I was comfortable throughout the drive. inside the park was able to see many different species in the wild" },
      { author: "Emilie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-04-01", text: "I got a lovely day. really appreciate that activity. it was a long day from jaipur to the safari, but it was absolutly worth it. I went to zone 5 and saw 4 tigers. thank you again for the day." },
      { author: "Eva", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-04-20", text: "First of all: Manoj was a fantastic driver, ai fehlt very safe and comfortable during the long ride. Absolutely 5 stars. One star less because only the drive from Jaipur and back is private, the safari takes place together with 20-30 others in an open bus - and some other Busses and some jeeps at the same time. So if a tiger is spotted, all busses and jeeps will come together, which can be very disturbing and annoying, depending on people's behaviour. NEVER forget to bring a hat or cap and something to cover your mouth and nose, it is a very dusty place ..." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-19", text: "I managed to see a tiger and the canter experience with our guide exceeded my expectations! My driver Bhupendra was very respectful, punctual, and knowledgeable, which added to the overall experience. would definitely reccomend!" },
    ],
  },
