    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Tony", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-12", text: "This was an amazing day, one of our all time highlights to see the Taj Mahal. The Agra Fort was a bonus worth experiencing. Both monuments tell a story of India past and highlight India today. Our driver Ravi Kumar meet us at 330am and drove all day until returning us to New Delhi Airport. Aside from caring for us, his knowledge as a local from Agra meet he knew all the best routes, particularly when you understand Indian traffic. Our tour guide Vipui was equally attentive and a wealth of knowledge of the history, the art and the buildings. Both enriched the day for us. One consideration is the long day , being in excess of 28 hours long, door to door.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-mumbai-taj-mahal-agra-fort-tour-with-same/5781995/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-mumbai-taj-mahal-agra-fort-tour-with-same/5782014/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "pierre", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-27", text: "The whole adventure was incredible except for the driver not being at the Delhi airport when we landed. The drive to Agra was rough as the car was not up to what expected The rest of the journey was perfect .Our guide Vipul was vers knowledgeable, courteous and attentive He definitely help made our trip to the Taj Mahal a day we will remember The driver was changed and the car so at the end a perfect day." },
      { author: "Rosida", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-07", text: "The day trip was very good & well organised. All instructions was accurate and booking of our flights and transportation between airport was closed excellent. I would highly recommend this day trip tour." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-27", text: "excelente mahl" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-06-03", text: "This was a really good trip. Everything was well organized and they provided an excellent service. The tour guide in Taj Mahal was very friendly and knowledgeable. And the driver in Delhi was on time and courteous. I would highly recommend this trip to others special when you have limited time and you want to visit Taj Mahal." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-11-24", text: "Todo perfecto, compañía responsable, guía en español muy simpática, esmerada en hacer bien su trabajo y muy bien informada, muy profesional la recomiendo 100%, el conductor lo maximo, un equipo súper amable y profesional" },
    ],
