  'full-day-jaipur-sightseeing-tour-by-tuk-tuk': {
    averageRating: 4.88,
    totalReviews: 43,
    guideRating: 4.88,
    valueRating: 4.9,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Nicola", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-14", text: "We had a wonderful day out visiting Jaipur and Amer Fort .It is our favourite city tour so far . We also visited the elephant sanctuary. The tour was excellent value for money. Our guide Shiob was very informative and knowledgeable and we felt very safe with Abdul’s driving .The tuk tuk made the experience more enjoyable.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-jaipur-sightseeing-tour-by-tuk-tuk/5201770/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-jaipur-sightseeing-tour-by-tuk-tuk/5201772/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-jaipur-sightseeing-tour-by-tuk-tuk/5201773/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Natalia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-23", text: "Hitesh and Abdul looked after me so well - I was solo travelling and this was such a fun way to spend a day. Managed to see all the highlights of Jaipur - Abdul is a master tuk tuk driver (almost 50 years experience and no issues, he proudly shared with me - and I believe it), and Hitesh knew everything about everything, and he has a wicked sense of humor as well. I spent the day being amused and informed! 10/10 - a great tour and really excellent value for money!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-jaipur-sightseeing-tour-by-tuk-tuk/4708506/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-jaipur-sightseeing-tour-by-tuk-tuk/4708510/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Rahul", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-06", text: "Our Jaipur trip was absolutely amazing, all thanks to our driver Ravi. He was polite, knowledgeable, and very professional throughout the journey. He knew all the best places to visit, took us to some great local spots, and made sure we were comfortable at every stop. The car was clean and well-maintained, and his driving was safe and smooth. We truly enjoyed our time and would highly recommend Ravi to anyone visiting Jaipur — he made our trip unforgettable! Don’t forget he take us to Tea spot that was amazing.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-jaipur-sightseeing-tour-by-tuk-tuk/4522287/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-jaipur-sightseeing-tour-by-tuk-tuk/4522288/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-jaipur-sightseeing-tour-by-tuk-tuk/4522290/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Giovanni", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-05", text: "We had a really great time and experience with Mosin and Shoaib. Mosin drove in a precise and safe way everywhere. Mosin is an amazing guide. He guided us through all the Jaipur’s landmarks explaining everything with passion and many details. Very friendly persons and very polite! I suggest them for this great and funny (by tuk tuk) experience around Jaipur!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-jaipur-sightseeing-tour-by-tuk-tuk/3305348/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "manuela", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-01-02", text: "Very kind guide, helped us a lot with tickets and pjotos", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-jaipur-sightseeing-tour-by-tuk-tuk/5083966/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Nathanel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-27", text: "L'activité s'est très bien passée, le chauffeur et le guide \"SHOEIB\" ont fait le maximum pour optimiser nos trajets et satisfaire nos demandes malgré les conditions de circulation très dégradée à Jaipur.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-jaipur-sightseeing-tour-by-tuk-tuk/5011684/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-jaipur-sightseeing-tour-by-tuk-tuk/5011685/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-jaipur-sightseeing-tour-by-tuk-tuk/5011686/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-22", text: "Mohsin was the best guide one could ask for in Jaipur. He knows Jaipur inside out and will give you tips to avoid scams and scammers! He also took us to hidden gems and showed us around lots of local business craft work. If you are in Jaipur I defo recommend this activity with mohsin. He also made us feel very comfortable and always checked on us.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-jaipur-sightseeing-tour-by-tuk-tuk/3510339/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-jaipur-sightseeing-tour-by-tuk-tuk/3510342/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-jaipur-sightseeing-tour-by-tuk-tuk/3510343/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Laetitia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-07", text: "Notre guide etait d'une grande gentillesse, très cultivé très à l'écoute, nous avons eu une visite de la ville rose très interessante, que de belles découvertes des monuments somptueux. La qualité de cette journée a dépassé nos espérances. Réel coup de coeur! On recommande vivement notre guide Sohaib et notre chauffeur de tuk tuk.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-jaipur-sightseeing-tour-by-tuk-tuk/3331766/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-jaipur-sightseeing-tour-by-tuk-tuk/3331767/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-jaipur-sightseeing-tour-by-tuk-tuk/3331799/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Dinesh", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-17", text: "It was excellent, i had a great time. Nawrathna was a very helpful and decent person to me." },
      { author: "Md", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-03", text: "We had a wonderful experience touring Jaipur with our driver Avinash and our guide. Avinash was punctual, drove very safely, and was extremely patient throughout the day, which made the trip comfortable and stress-free. Our guide was knowledgeable and explained the history and culture of Jaipur clearly, making each stop more meaningful. Both were friendly, professional, and always willing to help. Overall, it was a smooth and enjoyable tour, and I would highly recommend this service to anyone visiting Jaipur." },
      { author: "Rachel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-13", text: "Not being rushed at all in the places, could take the time to explore at my own pace" },
      { author: "Siobhan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-05", text: "Khalid and Adil made our trip so special they was so helpful, provided amazing information about Jaipur, took incredible photos and filled us with good laughs throughout the day!! Could not recommend enough" },
    ],
  },
