  'full-day-pushkar-tour-from-jaipur-with-guide-jeep': {
    averageRating: 4.65,
    totalReviews: 16,
    guideRating: 4.17,
    valueRating: 4.33,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Ed", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-31", text: "It was amazing and awesome, shoeb was an amazing guide and Danish was an amazing driver. I highly recommend you use these guys for any excursion you choose to book. Their English is good, they make sure you’re well taken care of, they take good photos of you, and they give it the extra effort to make sure that you are completely satisfied with your tour.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-pushkar-tour-from-jaipur-with-guide-jeep/6015721/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-pushkar-tour-from-jaipur-with-guide-jeep/6015737/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-pushkar-tour-from-jaipur-with-guide-jeep/6015738/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Tai", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-08", text: "Our driver Danish is the best - kind, gentle, and helps us with any of our requests thus making us feel very comfortable. Thanks to him, we were able to do all planned activities plus an additional night ride around the city. The camel riding itself is excellent, recommend this tour to anyone who is in Jaipur!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-pushkar-tour-from-jaipur-with-guide-jeep/5428855/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-pushkar-tour-from-jaipur-with-guide-jeep/5428858/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-pushkar-tour-from-jaipur-with-guide-jeep/5428861/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "neil", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-29", text: "our driver Danish was an excellent driver, very safe and professional, our guide was also good, very kind and knowledgeable.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-pushkar-tour-from-jaipur-with-guide-jeep/4772777/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Hannah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-04", text: "Ravi our driver was excellent! Very organized, provided great information and was very flexible with the plans for the day. Found us everything we asked for!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-pushkar-tour-from-jaipur-with-guide-jeep/4500994/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "lorna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-21", text: "Salman my driver was absolutely brilliant, professional,on time and his English was very good so he was able to talk as we drove the big journey to Pushkar. The whole day was amazing and beyond my expectations. just fabulous..thank you. 😊😊😊", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-pushkar-tour-from-jaipur-with-guide-jeep/4315934/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-pushkar-tour-from-jaipur-with-guide-jeep/4315935/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-pushkar-tour-from-jaipur-with-guide-jeep/4315936/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Corine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-05", text: "Ravi was een heel fijne gids die ons de hele dag van tips heeft voorzien. Niets was hem te veel. We hadden de all inclusive tour naar Pushkar geboekt. Nadat we Pushkar hadden bezocht hebben we nog bijna 1,5 uur op een kameel gereden. Geweldig! Ravi was er al om 07.00 uur en bracht ons om 22.00 uur terug naar het hotel. Het was een vriendelijke gids die ons veel heeft verteld. We voelden ons veilig bij hem in de auto. Mochten we ooit weer in Jaipur zijn dan willen we Ravi graag weer als gids.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-pushkar-tour-from-jaipur-with-guide-jeep/5707263/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-19", text: "Ayan picked us up from our hotel, drove us to Pushka, looked after us and our belongings in his car whilst we were taken around by a guide of who he sorted for us! Ayan also sorted our lunch at a lovely spot with amazing food before heading to ride some camels to watch the sunset. And after all of that, he drive us all the way right to the front of our hotel in Jaipur. He was brilliant, friendly and we highly recommend!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-pushkar-tour-from-jaipur-with-guide-jeep/1822423/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Rita", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-25", text: "We had an amazing experience on our Pushkar tour! The driver Navratan was absolutely incredible extremely kind, professional, knowledgeable and attentive. He explained so many interesting things about the culture and places we visited, while also giving us the freedom to enjoy everything at our own pace. We had been dealing with some stomach issues during our trip, and he was incredibly thoughtful about it, always making sure we were careful with what we ate and that we were comfortable throughout the day. His kindness and genuine care went above and beyond what we expected. He truly made the experience special and was a 5-star professional from beginning to end. We would absolutely recommend this tour! ❤️" },
      { author: "Max", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-18", text: "The driver Navratan Singh was very good! He took care of all communications and was attentive during the whole trip. Also he provided a lot of valuable information way above the trip!" },
      { author: "Gillian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-21", text: "enjoyed Pushkar lake and Lord Brama temple. thank you to driver Danish for his expert driving skills. excellent communication for the trip!" },
      { author: "Ian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-10", text: "I had a great day out with Ravi the driver, he was very good at explaining various aspects of Indian life during the journey. Also Monu the guide in Pushkar was very talkative and thoroughly answered all my questions." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-22", text: "The tour manager (and owner of the company) was very kind and warned us about the possible scams that might happen to tourists in the place. The car was completely new and very clean. The driver waited for us at the different stops and made sure we were fine. The manger provided a very good service and I would definitely recommend to discover jaipur with the services of his company" },
    ],
  },
