  'gatimaan-train-tour-delhi-agra-delhi-with-train': {
    averageRating: 4.76,
    totalReviews: 34,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 4.75,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Dylan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-20", text: "Excellent. My guide was extremely knowledgable and really went the extra mile. Would recommend to anyone.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/gatimaan-train-tour-delhi-agra-delhi-with-train/8254644/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Darien", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-13", text: "Ali is very very knowledgeable and is very in-tune with his guest. He will make sure you get what you want and look after your interest for the day. Highly recommend him and Mr Monuch as driver. The Taj is an absolute must visit #1 on the bucket list. I would like to see all park fees and the train transportation included in the online price for next time. Visiting the artisan shops be prepared ahead of time with prices for items. There is some margin for negotiations.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/gatimaan-train-tour-delhi-agra-delhi-with-train/3077800/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Marcus", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-11", text: "This was a very enjoyable day. The Gatinaan Express is a fast clean train. In Executive Class the meal was good and the air conditioning welcome. On arriving in Agra I was met directly from the train by my guide, who took me directly to a very nice air conditioned SUV, and off we went to the Taj Mahal, which was simply spectacular. My guide Mr Riyaz gave me information and insight as we wandered around the grounds and mausoleum. I then went to a superb lunch restaurant, after which I received an equally attentive and informative tour of the Red Fort. I highly recommend this day. My only complaint was that I felt uncomfortable when I visited the marble craft workshop and the rug making place. I greatly enjoyed seeing these incredible craftsmen and learning about how they make their superb products. But they are absolutely not my style and I would never have them in my house... and the hope and expectation that I would make a purchase spoiled my ability to enjoy the craftsmanship.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/gatimaan-train-tour-delhi-agra-delhi-with-train/2567969/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/gatimaan-train-tour-delhi-agra-delhi-with-train/2567970/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/gatimaan-train-tour-delhi-agra-delhi-with-train/2567971/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Hidetake", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-15", text: "常にお客の事を優先して考え、知識も豊富で100点満点のドライバーとガイドでした。今までの中で最高のツアーでした。また機会があればお願いしたいです。", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/gatimaan-train-tour-delhi-agra-delhi-with-train/7579260/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/gatimaan-train-tour-delhi-agra-delhi-with-train/7579262/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Cédric", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-11", text: "L'activité était super et nous avons passé une très bonne journée avec notre guide Ali. Il est très sympa, parle très bien anglais et nous a donné bcp d'explications sur les sites visités. La logistique était impeccable. Et évidemment le Taj Mahal est à couper le souffle ! Je recommande", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/gatimaan-train-tour-delhi-agra-delhi-with-train/4878650/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/gatimaan-train-tour-delhi-agra-delhi-with-train/4878651/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/gatimaan-train-tour-delhi-agra-delhi-with-train/4878652/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-20", text: "I spent an excellent day visiting the Taj Mahal and Agra Fort under the supervision, advises and historic review of Ali. Such a great guide, with his driver, making the journey and the visits really easy and interesting. I recommend at 100%.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/gatimaan-train-tour-delhi-agra-delhi-with-train/3876289/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-20", text: "AMAZING COMPANY! Get Your Guide has always been my go to source to book travel events, they are always very precise and ensure the clients are safe and happy with their plans. Taj Tour Guide was the PERFECT company to give us the Taj Mahal tour experience! Sadly our father died in Delhi while in India and the tour guides for this company was very sympathetic and ensured that we were able to get back to the train station quickly in order to return to Delhi to deal with the situation. ASK FOR TAJ TOUR GUIDE when you travel to see the Taj Mahal… it’s not just “business” for them, the 2 guides also cared for our emotional duress and helped us to get back to the family in Delhi THANKYOU GET YOUR GUIDE & TAJ TOUR GUIDE ! You’re AMAZING!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/gatimaan-train-tour-delhi-agra-delhi-with-train/2397419/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/gatimaan-train-tour-delhi-agra-delhi-with-train/2397420/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Robert", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-12", text: "Fajna wycieczka, pomocny, przewodnik powiedział bardzo dużo interesujących faktów o Agrze, smaczny lunch w formie bufetu w hotelu Marriott. Polecamy przewodnika Ali.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/gatimaan-train-tour-delhi-agra-delhi-with-train/2123585/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/gatimaan-train-tour-delhi-agra-delhi-with-train/2123586/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/gatimaan-train-tour-delhi-agra-delhi-with-train/2123587/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Marius", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-07", text: "Irshad our guide gave us an amazing tour, he was very knowledgeable, engaging and also an excellent photographer. We would highly recommend." },
      { author: "Aurelio", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-24", text: "irshad Ali was the best guide I have had! he explained so well all the sightseeings making the tour very interesting. I had a little inconvenience during the day and he took care of me with no stress. He's also a great photographer 😆 he made me great pics of me and places! the driver kumer was also very kind and available. I really recommend them ✌🙏" },
      { author: "Christina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-26", text: "We only had about 2 1/2 days in Delhi for sightseeing before moving on to Southern India for a business trip, I am so happy I contacted Taj Tours. They put together a whole itinerary for us to see everything we could in Delhi and a trip to Agra to see the Taj Mahal and other sights. Everything went seamlessly, all pick ups were right on time, the drivers were amazing and our tour guide, Mr. Anjum was so kind and friendly. He was very knowledgeable and you can tell he has a genuine passion for sharing his culture with us. His ability to control and move us quickly through crowds was unparalleled. We all felt very cared for and for and made a dear friend by the end. We had such an amazing experience. Thank you so much." },
      { author: "Louie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-17", text: "Great Guide Ali . Great local Knowledge and knew everything that needed to be known! Great experience especially on my own. Highly recommend.!" },
    ],
  },
