  'golden-triangle-6-day-tour-with-ranthambore': {
    averageRating: 4.59,
    totalReviews: 14,
    guideRating: 4.33,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Nicholas", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-26", text: "Thank you for an excellent tour. India is incredibly welcoming. The guides at each location were knowledgeable and friendly and our driver was exceptionally professional and courteous throughout. We opted for the 5* All Inclusive and I would recommend this to anyone. The service and hotels at each location were exceptional. Thank you again.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/golden-triangle-6-day-tour-with-ranthambore/6856706/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/golden-triangle-6-day-tour-with-ranthambore/6856707/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/golden-triangle-6-day-tour-with-ranthambore/6856708/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Mr p", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-14", text: "Muhammad our guide was amazing went above and beyond i would 100% recommend him and his tour company took some amazing photos of me and my wife he could not do enough for us please if you want a top guide and a gentleman go with him amazing day with a amazing guy" },
      { author: "Monomita", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-05", text: "Our activity was a great experience. We had good time in all the places. Our tour guides at Delhi, Agra and Jaipur was awesome. Car provided was nice and so was the driver. Everything went as per plan and was well organized. Communication was great. Can’t ask for more. Needs improvement: Was promised Jaypee Palace hotel in Agra initially but later Courtyard by Marriot was offered. We finally ended up in a better hotel in Agra by paying more ." },
      { author: "Tiziano", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-04-17", text: "Great tour, just one small catch I rate this 4 stars, but it is really close to 5! The tour was flawless. Our driver, Amar, was exceptional, always providing water, snacks, sunscreen, and sanitizer in the car. The guides, especially in Delhi and Agra, were also very good. The 4-star hotels were clean and the food was entirely safe (I even brushed my teeth with tap water without issues). The safari was amazing; we spotted both a tiger and a brown bear! The only reason for 4 stars instead of 5 is the forced commercial stops. Guides pushed visits to local shops to make us buy things. I would have preferred using that time to visit other sites or having free time to explore independently. I highly suggest asking customers if they want to do these stops beforehand. Despite this, I strongly recommend the tour. The people and places were fantastic, and India has stolen my heart!" },
      { author: "Yaiza Rodriguez", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-07", text: "La verdad que ha estado muy bien. Hemos visto muchas cosas y nos ha sorprendido mucho el Taj Majal. Estamos muy contentos de haber tenido a nuestro conductor Vikas, y a nuestros tres guías Afzal, Kashif y Amman." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-02-16", text: "Danke an das Team der Agentur und unseren Fahrer auf der Tour. Alles war gut organisiert, so dass wir viel gesehen haben auf der Rundreise." },
      { author: "Matthias", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-23", text: "Die Rundreise war sehr gut und der deutsche Reiseleiter sehr nett und spricht super deutsch! Er hat viel Rücksicht genommen und sich viel Zeit für uns genommen uns die Sehenswürdigkeiten und die indische Kultur näher zu bringen. Jederzeit gerne wieder." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-16", text: "We had 3 excellent tour guides, Amir who took us around Delhi, Ar Rhman who show us around Agar (Taj Mahal) and Soni who showed us all the wonderful sights of Jaipur (Amber Fort, Water Palace, step well) We had a brilliant driver Satish who stayed with us the whole 6 day tour" },
      { author: "Susan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-15", text: "Exzellent Tour" },
      { author: "Maria", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-19", text: "Excellent Tour" },
    ],
  },
