  'jaipur-city-night-tour-with-patrika-gate-masala': {
    averageRating: 5.0,
    totalReviews: 5,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Birgit", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-17", text: "I had a very wonderful tour with Salman. He showed the neauty of Jaipur at night. He has a great knowledge about the City, the People and the History and it was very pleasant to learn from him about all these topics. I felt safe and comfortable the whole Tour. The organozation was also done very well and everything went very smooth. I can recommend this Tour." },
      { author: "Ethan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-14", text: "I recently took the Jaipur Night Tour, and it was an unforgettable experience! The city transforms at night with beautifully lit monuments and a lively atmosphere. Our journey began at the stunning Patrika Gate, followed by Toran Gate and the glowing Birla Temple. We then stopped at the Albert Hall Museum, which looked breathtaking under the night sky. Next, we visited Masala Chowk, a food lover’s paradise, where sipping hot, flavorful chai perfectly complemented Jaipur’s cool night breeze. Our final stop was the magnificent Hawa Mahal, glowing beautifully in the dark. The entire experience was smooth, safe, and well-organized, with our driver sharing fascinating stories about Jaipur’s history. I highly recommend this night tour—a magical way to see Jaipur after sunset!" },
      { author: "olga ines", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-18", text: "bos gusto todo el tour, los lugares q recorrimos.. y excelente choferes" },
      { author: "Nicolas", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-26", text: "Virée nocturne très sympathique avec un guide (Nasir) agréable et à l’écoute dans une voiture clean. Je ne peux que recommander !" },
    ],
  },
