  'jaipur-full-day-guided-city-tour-with-monkey': {
    averageRating: 5.0,
    totalReviews: 5,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Alexandra", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-01", text: "We had an absolutely wonderful Jaipur sightseeing experience. Our guide created a truly bespoke tour, thoughtfully tailored to our interests and pace. Nothing felt rushed or generic, everything was adapted to our needs. He was extremely helpful, accommodating and attentive throughout the day, making sure we were comfortable and getting the most out of every stop. The flexibility and personal attention made this tour stand out. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a personalized and seamless Jaipur experience.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-full-day-guided-city-tour-with-monkey/5662950/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-full-day-guided-city-tour-with-monkey/5662951/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-full-day-guided-city-tour-with-monkey/5662952/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Catherine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-09", text: "We spent a full day touring Jaipur and it was truly a wonderful experience, largely thanks to our guide, Ali. He took us through all the main attractions of the city with great care and attention, and his deep knowledge of Jaipur’s history made every stop much more meaningful. Ali was incredibly kind and attentive throughout the day. He made sure we stayed hydrated in the heat, surprised us with local treats, and even took beautiful photos for us at many of the sites. He was professional, warm, and clearly passionate about what he does. If you are visiting Jaipur, I highly recommend touring the city with Ali. It made our day unforgettable." },
      { author: "Maximilian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-15", text: "What a special and memorable time, I wish I could give it more stars! The day was filled with stops at the most influential spots of Jaipur. Ali expertly navigated you in and around the city, while giving you key insights into the history of this beautiful city. He also gave plenty of suggestions around the city that only a local would. It was such a wonderful experience and I am excited to come back to Jaipur!" },
      { author: "Mareen", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-28", text: "Ali war super. Gerne wieder." },
      { author: "Steffen", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-06", text: "Ich war heute mit Ali & Bobby unterwegs. Gleich vorab: Besser geht's nicht !!! Wurde pünktlich abgeholt. Die Tour war überwältigend. Ich bekam viele interessante Informationen und Eindrücke. Wir waren insgesamt fast 10 Stunden unterwegs. Beide Guides waren absolute Klasse. Vielen, vielen Dank an Euch! Steffen aus Deutschland" },
    ],
  },
