  'jaipur-half-day-city-tour-by-e-rickshaw-with': {
    averageRating: 4.86,
    totalReviews: 10,
    guideRating: 4.86,
    valueRating: 4.86,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Antonia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-04", text: "It was a very nice tour! We had a male tour guide Ali joining the trip, while our female driver Baby drove us to the main sights in Jaipur. Both were very nice and the sights were beautiful. You notice that it is not common for women to drive Rikshaws, so we could actively support our female driver with this tour. Hopefully, Jaipur will get used to it soon. Note that the pink female Rikshaws have a speed limit of 30 km/h, so the ride is very slow but gives you a good opportunity to take pictures.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-half-day-city-tour-by-e-rickshaw-with/1419366/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-half-day-city-tour-by-e-rickshaw-with/1419367/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-half-day-city-tour-by-e-rickshaw-with/1419368/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Zoe", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-27", text: "We visited many spots around Jaipur and the guide was very informative! I enjoyed learning about everything and they were very kind" },
      { author: "Martin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-07", text: "This was really the best tour you can get in Jaipur !" },
      { author: "Miranda", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-08", text: "We had a great tour with narendra and suresh! They changed the itinerary to fit our requests and it was all very good." },
      { author: "Esther", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-04", text: "Having a female driver made all the difference—not only did it add a sense of safety and comfort, but it also felt empowering to support local women in this field. Our driver was knowledgeable, warm, and ensured we had an unforgettable experience exploring the city. She took us to all the must-see spots and some good handycrafts. This tour is highly recommended for anyone visiting Jaipur—especially those who want to support local women and gain a unique perspective on this beautiful city." },
      { author: "Katy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-10-30", text: "Our guide, Ali was very knowledgeable and able to explain all the history and traditions. Our driver, Pinky was absolutely charming and very safe. Many thanks to both for a wonderful experience." },
      { author: "Ranan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-08-08", text: "Absolutely best way to see and experience Jaipur. It was fabulous to see woman running this tour and I felt incredibly safe!! They were so skillful and attentive to one’s interest, stopping without even asking to get the greatest photos. Took me to corners I would never have found on my own. So punctual and professional with a fabulous sense of humor filling me in on all the intriguing details that the internet leaves out. Don’t miss out riding with these woman. So wonderful that Rajasthan India Tour Driver is empowering woman and making a difference. We need more like this!!" },
      { author: "Jessica", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-08-07", text: "My guide was very happy, she drove carefully and made sure I saw the sights and had a great morning. I love I can have a female guide and empowering woman in this industry" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2024-11-05", text: "The tour did not meet our expectations, and the mission seemed questionable. We were picked up from our accommodation with a female tuk-tuk driver and guide, but the itinerary felt rushed. At the City Palace, we had to buy tickets at the door, which were twice the price of online tickets; I’d advise buying these in advance. Next, we were taken to a fabric facility where they claimed to employ women, though none were present. We were encouraged to make custom shirts, which we declined. This led to a clothing warehouse and later a jewelry shop, where more items were pushed on us. After we refused, the tour ended early, skipping planned stops like Jal Mahal and Albert Hall Museum. The promised 5-hour tour only lasted 2.5 hours. Ultimately, we left feeling disappointed and somewhat scammed." },
    ],
  },
