  'jaipur-half-day-guided-tour-with-amber-fort-and': {
    averageRating: 4.63,
    totalReviews: 9,
    guideRating: 4.63,
    valueRating: 4.63,
    reviews: [
      { author: "elsa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-09", text: "Nice driver It could be better to have a bite more talk", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-half-day-guided-tour-with-amber-fort-and/2101315/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Anne-Marie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-28", text: "It was a great roundtrip with Malik. He knows Jaipur very well, is friendly and speaks good English. Definitely recommend the tour if you are new in Jaipur and want to see the main sights for a good value for money.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-half-day-guided-tour-with-amber-fort-and/1558104/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-half-day-guided-tour-with-amber-fort-and/1558106/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-half-day-guided-tour-with-amber-fort-and/1558107/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Natalia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-24", text: "I had the pleasure of joining this sunset tour in Jaipur, and it was truly a magical experience. The tour was perfectly organized, blending history, culture, and stunning views in one unforgettable evening. Our guide was knowledgeable and passionate about Jaipur’s rich heritage, sharing fascinating stories that brought the city’s landmarks to life. The highlight, of course, was the breathtaking sunset. Watching the sun dip behind the majestic Nahargarh Fort, with its golden glow lighting up the landscape, was absolutely surreal—a picture-perfect moment that I will cherish forever. The itinerary was well-paced, allowing plenty of time to soak in the views, take photos, and simply enjoy the serene ambiance. If you’re in Jaipur, I highly recommend this tour. It’s the perfect way to see the city from a new perspective and create lasting memories!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-half-day-guided-tour-with-amber-fort-and/1534458/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-half-day-guided-tour-with-amber-fort-and/1534459/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-half-day-guided-tour-with-amber-fort-and/1534460/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Hajo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-23", text: "it was very nice to get an overview by night. The Monkey Temple was my favourite" },
      { author: "Ranajit", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-31", text: "Sunny, the guide was excellent and provided informative commentary on the history and culture of the places we visited" },
      { author: "Avinash", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-01", text: "The evening sights were pretty good, Sunny our driver and guide took us around. Very patiently and didn’t mind a slight extension from the time of this tour!" },
      { author: "peter", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-29", text: "the driver was knowledgeable and considered. we are both octogenarian so it was very good of driver to take extra time for us to see all. His knowledge was good in explaining significance of items. well done" },
      { author: "Georgeta", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-10-04", text: "Our driver, Mr. Santosh, was very punctual, arriving ahead of time to pick us up at our desired location. He drove us safely to all the listed attractiions and he was understanding after we repeatedly mentioned that we weren’t interested in extra activities, like handblock printing or elephant tours. We had enough time to explore Amber Fort, the stepwell (Panna Meena ka Kund), and the “Monkey” Temple on our own, and he waited patiently throughout. Overall, it was a very nice tour and a pleasant experience!" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-08-20", text: "The driver was very flexible, and we got to see many different places. We enjoyed the tour! However, it was not always easy to follow the explanations of the guide." },
    ],
  },
