  'jaipur-haunted-bhangarh-fort-and-abhaneri': {
    averageRating: 4.63,
    totalReviews: 10,
    guideRating: 4.63,
    valueRating: 4.63,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Raymund", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-29", text: "We had a wonderful experience with both our tour guide and driver (manoj). The tour guide/driver was incredibly patient, knowledgeable, and made sure we understood and appreciated every stop along the way. The driver was equally impressive—very familiar with the routes and destinations, which made our travel smooth and efficient. He provided excellent and extra service throughout the trip, always professional, friendly, and attentive to our needs. Overall, we are very happy and satisfied with the experience and would highly recommend them to others.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-haunted-bhangarh-fort-and-abhaneri/5991493/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Celeste", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-23", text: "Il forte di Bhangarh e il pozzo di Abhaneri sono splendidi e suggestivi. Visita perfetta, Nadeem è molto gentile, paziente e un ottimo guidatore. Unica segnalazione mancava la guida italiana nonostante l'avessi richiesta, ma comunque la guida Nadim, in inglese, è stato accogliente e preparato. Consiglio :))", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-haunted-bhangarh-fort-and-abhaneri/8316529/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-haunted-bhangarh-fort-and-abhaneri/8316530/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-haunted-bhangarh-fort-and-abhaneri/8316532/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-12-18", text: "Recommended for those fascinated by historical structures and monuments. Karni is an excellent driver. He was prompt and helpful throughout the trip.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-haunted-bhangarh-fort-and-abhaneri/4945920/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-haunted-bhangarh-fort-and-abhaneri/4945921/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Eleonora", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-18", text: "Such an amazing experience! The tour was wonderful, especially visiting Chand Baori—it was definitely the highlight of the trip. A huge thanks to our driver, Nadeem, who was incredibly kind, helpful, and attentive throughout the entire journey. Highly recommended! 🌟✨" },
      { author: "Egle", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-27", text: "Nadeem was an excellent driver. Very professional, but also friendly. It was absolutely worth getting out of the city to see the Bhangarh fort and the Stepwell in Abhaneri! Very much recommend!" },
      { author: "Elli", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-15", text: "Shubham is an awesome guide! he explained to us the history of the sightseeings and provided general interesting information about life in india. he gave us e,tra recommendations and he is kind, knowledgeable and smiley!" },
      { author: "Pedro", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-02-17", text: "La puntualidad del conductor, la amabilidad del guía y el conductor, fueron los puntos fuertes. Lo que me descontento, fue que no tuve guía en el fuerte, cuando la excursión contratada, lo tenía que tener, en Castellano." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-02-11", text: "The visit to the well was a great experience. Our guide was passionate, knowledgeable, and spoke many languages. He genuinely wanted to share his culture and expertise, and he answered our questions with care. The “haunted city” tour, however, left us more mixed. The place is beautiful, but we couldn’t find an official guide, which made it harder to fully understand the site’s history. The area is very quiet, with almost no foreign visitors, and we felt like we became the attraction at times, which was a bit uncomfortable. A shame, because the potential is definitely there, the landscape is beautiful and the buildings really beautiful." },
      { author: "Pedro", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-20", text: "Hemos tenido una bonita e interesante excursión al Fort Bhangarh y al pozo de agua más antiguo en Abhaneri. Hemos estado muy bien atendidos en todo momento por nuestro conductor Harban Singh. Una experiencia muy recomendable" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-14", text: "Tour was nice. Karni was a good driver, provided us tickets and introduced us to our guide." },
    ],
  },
