  'jaipur-henna-tattoo-workshop-with-welcome-drink': {
    averageRating: 5.0,
    totalReviews: 3,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Andrea", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-09", text: "Se nota que la henna es de calidad, ya que me duró más días de lo normal, y la verdad el diseño estuvo increíble. Se adaptó perfecto en mi piel y fue lindo ver cómo hacían todo el proceso poco a poco. Definitivamente si quieres un buen trabajo, te recomiendo esta henna !", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-henna-tattoo-workshop-with-welcome-drink/1447016/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-henna-tattoo-workshop-with-welcome-drink/1447017/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-henna-tattoo-workshop-with-welcome-drink/1447018/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Rose", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-18", text: "This was a really fun and unique experience! I was very happy with the communication before hand and willingness of the organizers to adapt to my preferences. The course facilitators (3 ppl) were very welcoming and made sure I had everything I needed (drinks, snacks, toilet, etc.) They did a great job explaining the history of the henna tradition and explaining the process of it's production and use today. I liked that the class had many materials and hands-on components... it made me feel like a kid in school again :) I also enjoyed that I left with beautiful henna art and a few tubes to practice with. I can recommend this workshop to individuals, couples and groups. You will learn a lot and leave with good memories. Thanks again!" },
    ],
  },
