  'jaipur-namaste-bollywood-l-dance-like-a-star': {
    averageRating: 4.96,
    totalReviews: 55,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 4.95,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Maria", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-09", text: "The dance class was amazing and super fun! Our teachers were very welcoming, friendly and patient while teaching us the dance moves. It was definitely one of the highlights of our trip", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-namaste-bollywood-l-dance-like-a-star/7529359/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Siobhan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-09", text: "Thank you so much to the fabulous Akriti and Deepika for an incredible morning of dance! In our two hour session we learned a great routine to a modern Bollywood song. We had plenty of time for dressing in traditional clothes, taking photos and filming the routine. Akriti was very knowledgeable about how to adapt the dance to suit the dancers and helped me make the most of our time together. The studio was easy to find in an uber from my hotel. I would definitely recommend!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-namaste-bollywood-l-dance-like-a-star/6148148/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-namaste-bollywood-l-dance-like-a-star/6148149/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Nora", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-31", text: "The instructor was a super nice guy and very skilled. We had a lot of fun and got some exercise too! If we are ever in Jaipur again we will definitely take another class. It was something different than on our vacation. You will have a great time too!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-namaste-bollywood-l-dance-like-a-star/5351710/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-namaste-bollywood-l-dance-like-a-star/5351711/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Yasmin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-24", text: "I love that the teacher was very patient and accommodating. Easy to learn steps. And she was very helpful with the pace. Highly recommended experience 💕", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-namaste-bollywood-l-dance-like-a-star/4983992/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-namaste-bollywood-l-dance-like-a-star/4983996/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-namaste-bollywood-l-dance-like-a-star/4983997/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Christian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-25", text: "An excellent experience, very fun!! The instructor was very kindly and patient. Im satisfied whit that and I would like to do it again !!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-namaste-bollywood-l-dance-like-a-star/3958622/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Cassandra", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-05", text: "It was awesome! Honestly one of my favorite things I did in Jaipur. Teachers were super patient and kind so even if you have no experience at dancing they will explain every step. It was super fun and I am glad I did it!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-namaste-bollywood-l-dance-like-a-star/3007572/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Lili", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-06-12", text: "SUPER FUN ! 🇫🇷 We really wanted to do this during our trip to India and honestly this was as fun as we expected. The choreographers were great we were taught one long routine and one short, they filmed us all throughout so we had plenty of content and even did a photoshoot in the end ! The music and the costumes were great I really recommend renting them for the full experience ! Honestly one of the highlights of our entire trip ! Do it ! (Also they provide loads of water ! in case!)", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-namaste-bollywood-l-dance-like-a-star/2820978/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-namaste-bollywood-l-dance-like-a-star/2820979/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Julia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-15", text: "We’ve been a group of six and we had an amazing time - It was a great experience! We learnt a really fun choreography to great music! Highly recommend", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-namaste-bollywood-l-dance-like-a-star/2144547/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Anaïs", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-20", text: "Wow. Juste amazing. We take a course with my ten y.o daughter and we love it so much. Teachers was so nice and they explain the history of bollywood and thé mouvement. Juste wow. Thank you so much." },
      { author: "Benoit", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-05", text: "The Bollywood class was a complete blast! Both our teachers were absolutely amazing, very down to earth. We really appreciated the explanations about the moves and lyrics that made us understand better the choreography and the roots of Bollywood. Thank you so much for making us experience this!" },
      { author: "Lilly", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-06", text: "We learned a trending Bollywood dance and had the best time! Our teachers were so helpful and encouraging. They recorded us at the end so we can keep our memory forever. Highly recommend! Thank you Akriti!" },
      { author: "Franziska", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-14", text: "The Bollywood dance workshop was totally different from what I expected but in great way! At first, I was the only participant, which was surprising, but Vivek quickly invited two friends to join, so the vibe was instantly fun and relaxed. He adapted the class perfectly to my dance level, and we really danced our hearts out. So much energy, great music, amazing moves! 💃✨" },
    ],
  },
