    reviews: [
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2026-04-21", text: "No very good some information was given, but the only food that was offered was sweet things I had to ask if we were going to get anything savoury, the guide said it is normally to spicy for British people. Well all I can say is why would I come to India and do a food tour if I didn’t like Indian food. Very disappointing after doing some really good ones in other parts of the country", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-night-heritage-walking-tour-with-food/6324464/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-night-heritage-walking-tour-with-food/6324465/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Melissa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-20", text: "Najish was an excellent tour guide, i felt very safe in his hands. He was so knowledgeable and very fun. We walked around the yellow city, pink city, tried some amazing street foods. We seen crafts men at work making bangles, brass bowls and even visited a flour mill. The buildings were stunning. As a solo female traveller i would highly recommend this tour as its a safe way to see the beautiful city lit up. Najish is the best!" },
    ],
