  'jaipur-pink-city-cooking-class-indian-traditional-': {
    averageRating: 5.0,
    totalReviews: 7,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Shazz", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-01", text: "I was delayed and arrived very late, but they were very understanding and accommodating! I felt right at home straight away, the cooking was hands on and very delicious 😋", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-pink-city-cooking-class-indian-traditional-/8477022/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-pink-city-cooking-class-indian-traditional-/8477023/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Adam", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-03", text: "Dimple and Bunty were outstanding hosts for our cooking experience. They welcomed us into the studio and demonstrated how to make chai masala, which we enjoyed before the cooking class started. We made 4 dishes, plus chapati. Each dish represented a slightly different cooking style. Bunty talked through the use of the spices in Indian cooking. We spent a few minutes preparing vegetables and moved on to cooking. The class moved very quickly, working on several dishes at the same time. I feel that I may have missed some details on a few dishes because so much was happening at once. Thankfully, Bunty provided written recipes and offered to answer any questions in the future. It was great to sit down after cooking to enjoy the meal. We were in Jaipur during Holi, so we also enjoyed hearing more about the festival and how Bunty and Dimple celebrate. We truly enjoyed our time and cooking experience!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-pink-city-cooking-class-indian-traditional-/5757696/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-pink-city-cooking-class-indian-traditional-/5757697/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-pink-city-cooking-class-indian-traditional-/5757699/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Emily", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-13", text: "Best cooking class in Jaipur!!! We had an amazing time. Bunty and Dimple were so lovely, kind and informative. They taught us so many recipes, including chai, palak butter masala, dal fry and more. Everything was so delicious and now have lots of recipes to cook again at home. Could not recommend a better experience in Jaipur to learn delicious Indian recipes or just to have an amazing time!!!" },
      { author: "emma", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-18", text: "Absolutely recommend this cooking class! It was such a pleasure to cook with you guys. The food was absolutely delicious and I learnt a lot from the experience. I am excited to use the recipes you gave me when I return home. Thank you so much!! 🩷" },
      { author: "Malwina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-15", text: "The cooking class was by far our favourite activity in Jaipur. Everything was delicious, well explained and all our questions were answered. We learned a lot, ate a lot and had an amazing time. Thank you 🙏" },
      { author: "Richard", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-08", text: "Más que una clase de cocina, ha sido como cocinar en familia. Nos trataron con un cariño, una calidez y una atención increíbles, adaptándose a nosotros en todo momento. Aprendimos muchísimo gracias a lo ameno y didáctico que fue todo, ¡y la comida quedó espectacular! Preparamos butter paneer, arroz especiado, roti y un dal delicioso (que no estaba previsto en el menú, pero en cuanto les dije que me gustaba mucho, se adaptaron sin dudarlo para enseñarme a hacerlo). Si vas a Jaipur, no es solo una actividad recomendable, es una visita obligada para sentir la verdadera hospitalidad de la ciudad. Nos fuimos felices y con muchísimas ganas de repetir." },
    ],
  },
