  'jaipur-private-city-tour-with-hotel-pick-up-drop': {
    averageRating: 5.0,
    totalReviews: 68,
    guideRating: 4.98,
    valueRating: 4.98,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Ivan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-12", text: "I absolutely loved the tour—every moment was incredible! The selection of places we visited was spot-on, and my guide Sid was fantastic—so knowledgeable and patient, answering all my questions with genuine interest. I really appreciated how the tour was tailored to match the things I wanted to see and explore more deeply. It was 100% worth every penny—an unforgettable experience! And let’s not forget our amazing tuk-tuk driver—he added so much charm and fun to the journey. Truly a perfect adventure from start to finish!" },
      { author: "Atlas", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-18", text: "The day was packed with history and beautiful sights. Arbab guided us like a true local expert. Riyaz kept the ride smooth and timely. Traveling Desire did a fantastic job." },
      { author: "Atlas", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-18", text: "What a wonderful tour! Arbab provided rich context and stories at every stop. Pooran was polite and drove very well. We couldn’t have asked for a better day. Thanks, Traveling Desire." },
      { author: "Atlas", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-18", text: "Our guide Kapil was outstanding—he showed us all the must-see spots and added fascinating local stories. Pooran was courteous and drove comfortably. A great experience with Traveling Desire." },
      { author: "Susan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-27", text: "I made the reservation at the last moment and the company provided me with one of the best guide and driver, Ravi and arbab. the two started from Amer fort and ended with a beautiful lunch at one of those local restaurants in Jaipur. I couldn't have asked for a more memorable tour in a short period of time. thanks Ravi and arbab for this beautiful memory" },
      { author: "Thomas", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-03-14", text: "Our guide, Monis, and our driver, Pooran, were excellent! We were picked up on time and efficiently driven to Jaipur. We met Monis and immediately got underway with a magnificent tour of the highlights of Jaipur. The tour exceeded our expectations - Monis catered the highlights to our preferences and he was extremely informative - the exact type of learning experience we enjoy." },
      { author: "Maitland", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-02-16", text: "Arbab is very knowledgeable and helpful with explaining the history of this beautiful country and good to have a laugh with as well, definitely recommend booking with him I will when I come back with my partner and friends. 5 out ot 5" },
      { author: "Inna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-02-10", text: "It was interesting trip. we liked Jaipur. Our guide, Rajesh Singh did excellent job showing us the palace and the Pink city and explaining the history of Jaipur." },
      { author: "Damiano", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-08-21", text: "great experience in Jaipur. we visited the monuments and major attractions of jaipur including the amber fort. our guide was nice and always ready to give us information" },
      { author: "Filip", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-08-10", text: "Pick up and drive from Delhi went very smooth. Our guide Vipin in Jaipur was very knowlegdeable and gave us a good tour at the most important Jaiput monuments. He also made beatiful pictures of us, so we will have great memories. Jaiput is definitely worth seeing!" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-01", text: "This tour has been exceptionally enjoyable due to the professionalism, passion, and compassion exhibited by our guide, Mr. Raghu. His extensive knowledge and patience in elucidating the intricate details of the tour’s significant coverage have been invaluable. Furthermore, we extend our sincere gratitude to our driver, Mr. Vinod, for his unwavering commitment to safety. His empathetic nature ensures that the vehicle remains cool upon our return from strenuous walks, providing a refreshing respite. We are deeply appreciative of their exceptional contributions to our experience." },
      { author: "Sylvie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-12", text: "Récupéré à l'hôtel le matin même qu'on était loin du lieu de visite, le chauffeur était pile à l'heure. Aucun stress niveau horaire tout était adaptable. Notre guide Amar était très agréable et nous avons beaucoup échangé avec lui. Le rythme se fait en fonction de nous et le guide s'adapte toujours parfaitement. je recommande" },
    ],
  },
