    reviews: [
      { author: "Diane", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-20", text: "It was a very wonderful and great day with our guide Indra and our driver Mukesh! Had an amazing and fun with both of them. Indra is very professional and has lot of passion sharing his knowledge about Jaipur. We will definitely come back and ask for them to be our guide again. It’s been a pleasure to have met a big brother bhai ji from Jaipur ❤️ Definitely recommend!!!!!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-private-guided-half-day-full-day-tour-in/1656543/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-private-guided-half-day-full-day-tour-in/1656547/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-private-guided-half-day-full-day-tour-in/1656549/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Julie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-30", text: "Rishi was a fabulous guide - very articulate and informative and a pleasure to be around. We saw many exciting monuments and cultural experiences and we had a great time. Mukesh ji was a fabulous driver. Thank you for a great day ⭐️", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-private-guided-half-day-full-day-tour-in/1565663/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-private-guided-half-day-full-day-tour-in/1565664/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-private-guided-half-day-full-day-tour-in/1565665/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-11", text: "Jaipur truly lives up to its title as the Pink City! From exploring Amber Fort to wandering the colorful bazaars and trying delicious Rajasthani food, every moment was incredible. Our guide was knowledgeable and friendly, making the history come alive. The car was clean and comfortable, and everything was perfectly organized. Definitely one of the best tours in India!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-private-guided-half-day-full-day-tour-in/4176496/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-private-guided-half-day-full-day-tour-in/4176497/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-private-guided-half-day-full-day-tour-in/4176498/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-11", text: "My Jaipur trip was absolutely amazing! The city’s royal charm, pink architecture, and warm hospitality made the experience unforgettable. The Amber Fort and City Palace were breathtaking, and our guide shared so many interesting stories about Jaipur’s history. Highly recommend this tour to anyone visiting Rajasthan!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-private-guided-half-day-full-day-tour-in/4176491/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-private-guided-half-day-full-day-tour-in/4176492/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-10", text: "Amazing Jaipur Experience! Our Jaipur tour was absolutely wonderful! The guide was very knowledgeable and friendly, explaining the rich history behind every monument. We visited Amber Fort, City Palace, Hawa Mahal, and Jantar Mantar — each spot was breathtaking. The car was clean, comfortable, and the driver was very professional. We also got enough time for photos and shopping in the local markets. Highly recommend this tour for anyone who wants to explore the true colors of Jaipur!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-private-guided-half-day-full-day-tour-in/4161943/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-private-guided-half-day-full-day-tour-in/4161944/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Pushkar", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-29", text: "We had a wonderful experience in this tour. Our tour guide was extremely resourceful and funny. In all the process was smooth, the pickup was on time. We didn’t realize where time went. The guide kept us engaged. Would totally recommend it." },
      { author: "Amit", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-04", text: "Very knowledgeable guide about the history of Jaipur Thank you for the trip" },
      { author: "Bram", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-22", text: "We had a nice tour visiting Amber Fort, the Water Palace, and the Stepwell, all guided by Kamran. He was knowledgeable about each site and shared fascinating details that really enriched our experience. Kamran is also very friendly and easy to talk to, which made the morning even more enjoyable. One of the highlights was entering Amber Fort through the back route, which gave us a unique perspective. Kamran also helped us arrange tuk-tuks and taxis at very reasonable prices, which made everything smooth and stress-free. Communication via WhatsApp was quick and easy from the start. All in all, it was a well-organized, personal, and memorable experience. Highly recommended!" },
      { author: "Armen", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-27", text: "Indra was very nice and we spend a very nice morning with him during a morning. His explanations of history were very clear. Kamel was the driver and he drove perfectly." },
      { author: "Imtiyaoz Abdul", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-25", text: "The guide Rajvinder was very knowledgeable about the locations, pick up instructions were communicated clearly, the driver also drove well, the car was clean and had a/c. Rajvinder also took great pictures and could hold great conversations in both hindi and English." },
      { author: "Lina.", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-10-21", text: "The tour was great. Very comfortable car, good driver and knowledgeable guide" },
      { author: "Nicole", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-12-30", text: "Javed and Mukesh were both extremely friendly from the beginning onwards!!! We really enjoyed the tour and Javed shared a lot of his interesting knowledge which we appreciate! Thank you for having us!:)" },
    ],
