  'jaipur-private-khimsar-desert-safari-day-trip-with': {
    averageRating: 2.0,
    totalReviews: 1,
    guideRating: 2.0,
    valueRating: 2.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Liz", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 2, date: "2025-09-18", text: "Unfortunately the experience did not meet expectations. The drive from Jaipur to the location took about 6 hours each way, which was far longer than the activity itself. The main activity was only tea at the Khimsar Sand Dune Village and a short hotel tour, which felt underwhelming given the time commitment. The organization also needs improvement — the guide kept asking if we drank alcohol, and the driver repeatedly asked for tips and was a bit touchy, which made us uncomfortable as two Southeast Asian women travelers. One highlight, however, was the lunch stop at a local family’s home. The hostess was incredibly sweet, warm, and excited to cook for us, which felt genuine and memorable. Overall, the experience needs much stronger organization, a more meaningful itinerary, and professional conduct from staff to make it worthwhile." },
    ],
  },
