  'jaipur-private-sightseeing-tour-half-full-day': {
    averageRating: 5.0,
    totalReviews: 13,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 4.67,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Ricardo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-09", text: "Asif made us feel like at home! We always felt safe. His superior knowledge about how to get around in Jaipur made our trip enjoyable and efficient! His recommendations were on point always maximizing quality, reliability, and efficiency. I recommend Asif to anyone without hesitation!!! My wife and I were very lucky to have met Asif and our experience with him have made us want to come again to Jaipur in the near future! Thank you for everything!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-private-sightseeing-tour-half-full-day/5432262/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-private-sightseeing-tour-half-full-day/5432263/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-private-sightseeing-tour-half-full-day/5432264/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "David", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-18", text: "Raul was an incredible guide and this is our fifth time connecting with him and touring all over Jaipur. He is respectful and professional, and such a fun person to be with. We toured the city Palace, the pink city, the Amer, and entered the day at a view of the city that was breathtaking and so fun. I can’t imagine coming to Jaipur and not seeing Raul and recommend him highly.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-private-sightseeing-tour-half-full-day/5231547/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Sarah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-05", text: "Asif was a great guide. He’s very knowledgeable about Jaipur and gives good advice about where to go, how to not get scammed, etc. Highly recommended!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-private-sightseeing-tour-half-full-day/4097568/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-private-sightseeing-tour-half-full-day/4097570/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-private-sightseeing-tour-half-full-day/4097571/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "jessicarosedsouza", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-28", text: "Asif was very knowledgeble and friendly and made the trip enjoyable. I 3ould definitely recommend to a friend. Enjoyed my trip around Jaipur very much", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-private-sightseeing-tour-half-full-day/4000772/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-private-sightseeing-tour-half-full-day/4000781/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "David", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-19", text: "Rahul was an outstanding guide and we had an excellent time once again. His sense of humor and his calm approach makes coming to Jaipur an absolute joy. You communicate communicated throughout our entire stay and was always there in the morning to pick us up and take us to various locations, including the Jaipur literature festival. I can’t imagine coming to Jaipur and not connecting with Rahul." },
      { author: "Pedro", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-18", text: "Rahul was an outstanding guide for the four of us. He was considerate professional on time safe and fun. He made the trip absolutely incredible and shared stories about what it's like to live in Jaipur shared stories about the places that we visited and gave us many new ideas for how we could continue to explore Rajasthan. That our favorite part about our time with Rahul was his personality, which is adventurous, funny and very laid back and during stressful moments, which put us all at ease. We have been traveling with Rahul for multiple years when we come to Jaipur and we highly recommend him as we are seasoned travelers and he is one of the best companions you could want during your visit to Jaipur visit. This is why we enthusiastically rate him as five stars." },
      { author: "Kiruth", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-11", text: "Exceedingly friendly and knowledgeable guide. Happy to be flexible with the tour- will allow you to autonomously decide how you spend your time. No pressure to buy anything from any shops/market we went to. Always upfront about prices of ticket entry before we got to the ticket gate. Easy to converse with (cracks a few good jokes), trustworthy and professional. Would highly recommend." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-22", text: "punctual and courteous driver who took us round jaipur half day city tour and we enjoyed every bit of it ! The co ordination for bookings and confirmations and communication was seamless! much appreciated!" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-04", text: "Rahul claims to be a driver only, but gives a lot of hints and stories about Jaipur. His car is quite big and comfortable for 3-4 passengers. I totally recommend to take a tour with Rahul!" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-29", text: "We had the most amazing three days in Jaipur, all thanks to how lucky we were to meet Asif! Asif picked us up from Jaipur Airport at 3 a.m. and drove us safely to our hotel. From the very beginning, he was kind, friendly, calm, and easy to talk to, which immediately made us feel comfortable. During all our days in Jaipur, Asif drove us around and showed us the very best of the city. He is a safe and relaxed driver, always had cold water in the car for us, and knew excellent, tourist-friendly lunch spots. He also took us to local places where we could see how textiles are made, get tailor-made clothes, watch carpet making, gemstone cutting, and jewelry production — experiences we would never have found on our own. On top of that, we visited all the beautiful palaces and highlights of Jaipur, and on our last evening, we even went out for dinner together, which was such a lovely way to end the trip. We will truly miss Asif and cannot recommend him enough to anyone visiting Jaipur." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-23", text: "Asif é una guida e autista competente, ti porta ovunque e guida con sicurezza e determinazione. Conosce Jaipur come le sue tasche. Gentile e amichevole, ha soddisfatto tutte le nostre richieste. Ci ha portato anche a bere il chai in un posto genuino! Lo consigliamo!👏🏻👏🏻👏🏻" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-26", text: "This tour was amazing. Asif is an amazing guide, very friendly and welcoming. He might be the best driver I’ve seen in India, James Bond as he would say 😂. If you’re looking for anyone to show you around Jaipur in a more casual setting he is 100% you man." },
    ],
  },
