  'jaipur-private-temple-tour-spiritual-hindu-experie': {
    averageRating: 5.0,
    totalReviews: 5,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "William", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-14", text: "We got a guide our first day in Jaipur to explore some of the religious Temple sites and learn a little bit more about the city prior to the rest of our visit and by the end of the day it felt like we had lived a lifetime in this beautiful city due to the knowledge, professionalism, friendliness, and genuine kindness of our guide Krishna. He will show you everything from the daily life of Hindus devotees to the hustle and bustle of city life. We wish we could have spent more time. We visited several temple sites given our interest in learning more about the complex and rich expressions of Hinduism. Hinduism, and specifically Shiva devotees, are fascinating and have a nuanced and deeply spiritual history. Our guide Krishna was able to bring the traditions, customs, practices and spiritual depth alive. His own spiritual background gave his stories and descriptions even more flavor and authenticity. We learned about Brahma, Vishnu, Shiva, Hanuman and Ganesh. We can’t wait to visit again", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-private-temple-tour-spiritual-hindu-experie/2591158/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-private-temple-tour-spiritual-hindu-experie/2591159/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-private-temple-tour-spiritual-hindu-experie/2591160/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Mercedeh Sabbagh", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-12", text: "I had Mr. Krishna as the guide for the Temples tour in Jaipur. I think it was my favorite part of my stay. Me. Krishna was so helpful and explained much information about each and every temple we visited. We finished the day with a nice cup of Chai and samosa at a friendly small place in the heart of Jaipur. I would highly recommend taking a tour with Mr. Krishna, it makes the visit very calm, peaceful and enjoyable." },
      { author: "Raffaella Mallaci", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-13", text: "Krishna è stato molto gentile e disponibile, ci siamo immersi nei templi di Jaipur e nei riti. Abbiamo visto il tempio dello scimmie, un luogo molto suggestivo. Krishna è stato sempre disponibile a fermarsi per scattare qualche foto e gentile. Ci sono state delle fermate per lo shopping. Ci ha dato anche consigli su cosa fare dopo e ci ha suggerito un buon centro per i massaggi. È stata una bella giornata." },
      { author: "Francesco", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-01", text: "Esperienza autentica per i principali templi di Jaipur, dove la nostra guida Krishna (che parla bene l'italiano, cosa molto rara) ci ha spiegato i fondamenti della religione Indù e dei principali rituali. L'attività inizia alle 9 e termina per le 13.00. Al termine ci ha accompagnato in due fabbriche locali dove é stato possibile acquistare stoffe e anelli in argento e pietre locali, a prezzi più bassi dei posti turistici. Consigliato a chi vuole fare un'esperienza autentica e non turistica." },
    ],
  },
