  'jaipur-same-day-bhangarh-fort-chand-baori': {
    averageRating: 5.0,
    totalReviews: 10,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Eduardo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-17", text: "Hartshit was simply the perfect Guide for the day. He made the whole experience unique. It was like spending time with an old friend you haven’t met for a long time. I couldn't have asked for more. Special thanks to the driver Madau.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-same-day-bhangarh-fort-chand-baori/5841206/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-same-day-bhangarh-fort-chand-baori/5841207/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-same-day-bhangarh-fort-chand-baori/5841208/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Austin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-10", text: "The tours were amazing. We spent two weeks in India (Delhi, Jaipur, Udaipur, Agra) but this tour was singularly the highlight of the entire trip. Our guide, Monty, was extremely knowledgeable and professional— so much so, in fact, that we asked him to arrange two more tours for us afterwards. So glad to have met him; now we know who to call when we return!!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-same-day-bhangarh-fort-chand-baori/1780541/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-same-day-bhangarh-fort-chand-baori/1780542/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-same-day-bhangarh-fort-chand-baori/1780544/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-14", text: "The tour was safe and secure. I also thought the communication before and after the tour was accurate. I would like to use this service again if I have the opportunity.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-same-day-bhangarh-fort-chand-baori/5490871/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-same-day-bhangarh-fort-chand-baori/5490872/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-same-day-bhangarh-fort-chand-baori/5490873/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-24", text: "Abbiamo concluso le nostre vacanze nel Rajasthan con il tour al Forte di Bhangarah e al pozzo di Abhaneri. Sono imperdibili sia per la loro bellezza che, nel caso del Forte, per il contesto naturale in cui si trova. È la seconda esperienza con la guida Monty che anche in questo caso ha dimostrato grande professionalità e attenzione nella scelta dei luoghi di sosta (bellissimo il ristorante dove ci siamo fermati e ottimo il cibo). Peccato che sia finita la vacanza perchè avremmo fatto altri tour con lui e con l'autista Madhu che anche questa volta ha dimostrato una guida prudente e attenta.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-same-day-bhangarh-fort-chand-baori/4721716/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-same-day-bhangarh-fort-chand-baori/4721717/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-same-day-bhangarh-fort-chand-baori/4721718/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Eduardo Salvador Orozco Sánchez", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-28", text: "Perfecto todo, el guía y el chofer, nos regalaron una experiencia muy inolvidable! Muchas gracias.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-same-day-bhangarh-fort-chand-baori/4002257/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-same-day-bhangarh-fort-chand-baori/4002258/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-same-day-bhangarh-fort-chand-baori/4002259/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Kazumasa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-06", text: "I spend Amazing time with lovely guide and driver. Bhangarh Fort has a history of Mughal Empire. Also Chand Baori is a Impressive site. Anyways, if you have a first trip of India, you can feel real India culture beyond window of the car. The curry as lunch was great. I really recommend for every traveler. And Special thanks for Mr Monty." },
      { author: "Wesley", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-06-15", text: "Very good great driver and car . Guide was very good and beautiful sights to see top marks for this tour" },
      { author: "Gaëlle", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-30", text: "Nous avons vécu une excursion hors du temps, absolument mémorable. Rien que le trajet vers le fort fut une expérience en soi : traverser la campagne indienne, avec ses mille couleurs et sa diversité, était déjà une véritable découverte. Notre guide Harshit s’est montré particulièrement attentionné, et le fort de Bhangarh nous a émerveillés. Niché au cœur d’une jungle luxuriante, peuplée d’arbres centenaires, de vaches sacrées et de singes, il dégage une atmosphère impressionnante et unique. Cette escapade, loin de l’agitation urbaine, nous a offert un moment à la fois dépaysant et apaisant. La visite des puits à degrés nous a également fascinés. Le fait que ces deux sites soient si peu fréquentés rend la découverte encore plus précieuse : nous avons eu le sentiment privilégié d’accéder à des trésors cachés. Enfin, un immense merci à notre chauffeur Ratiram, véritable perle de gentillesse et de prudence. Toujours souriant et d’une grande attention, il a rendu le trajet aussi sûr qu’agré" },
      { author: "Luca", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-20", text: "Monty è una Guida professionale e competente. Ottimo autista. Bellissimi i posti visitati ed ottime soste gastronomiche per il pranzo e per un lassi. Consigliato!" },
    ],
  },
