  'magical-mathura-vrindavan-tour-krishnas-homeland': {
    averageRating: 4.4,
    totalReviews: 18,
    guideRating: 4.2,
    valueRating: 4.2,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Jennifer", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-17", text: "GRD Holidays did a great job and we learned a lot from our tour guide - our driver was amazing - especially when it comes to navigating the traffic on these roads in Delhi!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/magical-mathura-vrindavan-tour-krishnas-homeland/1812294/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/magical-mathura-vrindavan-tour-krishnas-homeland/1812295/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/magical-mathura-vrindavan-tour-krishnas-homeland/1812296/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Sanjeev", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-19", text: "Our driver, Vikash Nagar was very courteous and professional. He took care of us during the entire day and navigated thru the traffic with ease. Our guide, Mr.Jai was extremely professional. He is very knowledgeable and mindful of the time constraints. He helped us navigate a very busy day with ease." },
      { author: "Aaron", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-12", text: "Our trip from Delhi to Mathura and Vrindavan was perfectly planned! The GRD Holidays team provided complete support from start to finish, ensuring everything went smoothly.Our guide, Deepak, was amazing—his knowledge about the sites and culture truly enhanced our experience. We had a wonderful mix of fun and spirituality throughout the trip.Highly recommended for anyone looking for a seamless and memorable tour!" },
      { author: "Peyton", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-12", text: "We had a great trip from Delhi to Mathura and Vrindavan! The Indian architecture of the temples is absolutely stunning. Our guide, Deepak, was incredibly knowledgeable and inspired us with fascinating insights about Hindu culture. The memories of this temple trip will stay with us forever. Our pickup time was scheduled for 6:00 AM, and the driver arrived 15 minutes early at our hotel, which was very impressive. Throughout the journey, the GRD Holidays team stayed connected with us to ensure everything went smoothly. Highly recommended for anyone planning a temple tour!" },
      { author: "Lavrie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-12", text: "The day was filled with fun, joy, and a spiritual experience. It was an all-around amazing trip! Thank you, GRD Holidays. Highly recommended!" },
      { author: "Roman", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-12", text: "our driver was a cheerful turbaned gentleman, making the journey from delhi to mathura-vrindavan so much fun. deepak, our driver, had vast experience and deep knowledge about the temples and hindu religion, and we learned a lot from him. the grd holidays team kept following up to ensure our tour was going smoothly and that the pickup happened on time. i will definitely book my next trip with grd holidays again. thank you for such a great experience!" },
      { author: "Sylvia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-30", text: "mr. deepak was our guide, and he took us to visit the temples in mathura and vrindavan. he explained how hindus perform their prayers and the significance of hinduism in our lives. it was a wonderful experience, and our trip to mathura and vrindavan was truly memorable. we are already planning to book our next trip with grd holidays when we visit again with our family next year. i highly recommend everyone to book their trip with grd holidays" },
      { author: "Merle", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-30", text: "my wife and i checked the reviews of grd holidays and booked a tour. our trip from delhi to mathura and vrindavan was amazing. the car was waiting for us even before the pickup time, and we were picked up on time. the driver was very good, and deepak was our guide, who took us around mathura and vrindavan and gave us complete information about the hindu religion, especially about rudraksh and tilak. i don't have enough words to explain how wonderful it was. i highly recommend booking your mathura vrindavan tour with grd holidays. once again, thank you to the grd holidays team!" },
      { author: "Sandra", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-05", text: "We had a wonderful spiritual experience with GRD Holidays! The pickup was right on time, and the entire tour was managed exceptionally well. Both our driver and guide were friendly and professional, making the experience even better. Highly recommend booking with GRD Holidays – they truly take care of everything. Thank you so much for an amazing trip!" },
      { author: "Pellerin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-10-21", text: "We had an amazing experience on our Mathura and Vrindavan tour with Mr. Deepak from GRD Holidays. His knowledge of the history and spiritual significance of the sites made the trip truly special. He was patient, friendly, and ensured our comfort throughout the day. Mr. Deepak’s passion for these holy cities really shines through, making the tour unforgettable. Highly recommend!" },
      { author: "Garcia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-10-19", text: "I had an incredible experience on my trip with GRD Holidays, and I want to give a special mention to Mr. Deepak, our guide. His vast knowledge of Hinduism was remarkable, and he shared so much valuable insight about the religion and its rich history, particularly during our visit to the temples in Mathura and Vrindavan. Not only was he an excellent guide, but the driver was also extremely kind and considerate. He even took the time to explain the significance of the Rudraksha Mala, enriching our journey with fascinating details. Our pickup was perfectly on time, and Mr. Deepak ensured we were safe and well taken care of amidst the crowd, which made the day even more enjoyable. I truly appreciated the level of care and attention throughout the trip, and I’m grateful to Mr. Deepak and the team at GRD Holidays for making it such a memorable experience. It was an awesome trip, and I highly recommend booking with them!" },
      { author: "Manuel Gamez", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-09-12", text: "We had a fantastic experience! Mr. Deepak, our guide, picked us up on time from the hotel and took us on a tour of several temples in Vrindavan. He was incredibly kind and attentive, making sure we were well taken care of throughout the day. We had a lot of fun and learned so much about Hindu culture. I highly recommend this experience!" },
    ],
  },
