  'old-delhi-spices-heritage-and-bazaars-walking-tour': {
    averageRating: 4.97,
    totalReviews: 259,
    guideRating: 4.97,
    valueRating: 4.96,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Mel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-20", text: "We loved our walking tour with Jai. We saw a lot, tried some local masala chai which was lovely, he helped me buy some delicacies. We enjoyed the mosque, some temples and were able to have an experience of walking the old lanes and markets without feeling overwhelmed. He always took good care of us and shared a lot of interesting information. I will definitely get in touch with Jai again - he’s great!!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/old-delhi-spices-heritage-and-bazaars-walking-tour/8821531/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/old-delhi-spices-heritage-and-bazaars-walking-tour/8821532/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/old-delhi-spices-heritage-and-bazaars-walking-tour/8821533/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Harry", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-03", text: "Jai Singh was a perfect guide. Tells a lot and give explations by questions. Jai also flexibel. Try it by yourselve !", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/old-delhi-spices-heritage-and-bazaars-walking-tour/7921490/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/old-delhi-spices-heritage-and-bazaars-walking-tour/7921492/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/old-delhi-spices-heritage-and-bazaars-walking-tour/7921493/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Bennett", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-13", text: "Jai is a fantastic guide! He is local, knowledgeable, and extremely kind. I would highly recommend this as a way to learn about this area of the city!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/old-delhi-spices-heritage-and-bazaars-walking-tour/6206793/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Francesca", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-07", text: "Everything about this tour was fantastic, Jai was the greatest local host, so knowledgeable, kind and really looked after everyone in the group. I got lost to start with and so he came to collect me from my location which I really appreciated. The walk was really varied and I learnt lots of interesting facts and insights and feel I got a very good perspective of life in Delhi. Jai really made the trip memorable and was a very good photographer and happy to take photos and videos for our group, he delivered the tour in such a warm, friendly way, I felt like I was walking around the city with friends, a true gentleman and local advocate. I was also happy that I didn't feel pressured to buy whilst shopping which I have felt on other excursions and this was much more about the enjoyment and experiencing the city for all of its wonder. Thank you Jai ☺️", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/old-delhi-spices-heritage-and-bazaars-walking-tour/6118829/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/old-delhi-spices-heritage-and-bazaars-walking-tour/6118830/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/old-delhi-spices-heritage-and-bazaars-walking-tour/6118831/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Magdalena", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-06", text: "Superb guiding through the small alleys in Old Delhi. Loved the spice market and the visit to the chili ”floor”. 🌶️ Our guide was really knowledgeable and made sure that we also got the opportunity to taste different teas in different occasions.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/old-delhi-spices-heritage-and-bazaars-walking-tour/6106558/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Katianna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-22", text: "This tour is AMAZING!!! I highly recommend it. The guide is local and owns the tour company himself. He is kind, insightful, and knows all the back alley ways to get an off the beaten path experience. I have been traveling for 3 months and this was one of my favorite tours. Also, if you are interested in trying any street foods, mention it to him and you’ll stop at clean hygienic places along the way! :) perfect mix of food, history, and authentic sightseeing", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/old-delhi-spices-heritage-and-bazaars-walking-tour/5908178/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/old-delhi-spices-heritage-and-bazaars-walking-tour/5908179/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/old-delhi-spices-heritage-and-bazaars-walking-tour/5908180/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Reyna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-24", text: "Jai was great! Had a bit of a struggle to find each other at the start, but the tour was excellent! We did a comprehensive tour of Jama Masjid, Chandri Chowk and the tiny streets of old Delhi and then popped into the spice market, finishing with a rickshaw ride. I am really happy I did this “extra” tour - the larger multi-day tour I am officially part of didn’t cover nearly as much." },
      { author: "Kari", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-24", text: "This was the 2nd tour I took with Jai, This was a private tour to a heritage house in the area. Great tour again, and I enjoyed seeing the restored buildings we visited. I highly recommend Jai as a tour guide. His English is good, and he is a flexible tour guide who does what he can to accommodate his guests." },
      { author: "Milan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-23", text: "Jai was super helpful and very knowledgeable. Delhi can be a bit chaotic so Jai's calm touring was well met." },
      { author: "Arielle", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-16", text: "Really insightful tour. Our guide took great care to understand what spots we were most interested in and helped customize the tour to us. He was very attentive of our group in the heat and chaos. He knows exactly where to take you in Old Delhi to help you get a mix of quiet streets while also seeing the bustle of the district. 100% recommend this if you’re visiting!" },
      { author: "Julian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-30", text: "Very knowledgeable guide. We really enjoyed our tour." },
      { author: "Olivia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-29", text: "Great way to explore Old Delhi! Jai was wonderful and whisked us from spot to spot while providing interesting context. The spice market was a real highlight and boy was I sneezing. Really enjoyed this tour and especially appreciated the fact that he came to find us in the metro station when we got lost." },
    ],
  },
