  'private-taj-mahal-agra-fort-fatehpur-day-trip': {
    averageRating: 4.97,
    totalReviews: 31,
    guideRating: 4.94,
    valueRating: 4.86,
    reviews: [
      { author: "guillaume", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-11", text: "We had a really great tour with Nekram. He gave us very good information. It was truly wonderful and he was also helping a lot to find the best spot for beautiful pictures will keep as memory for life. I highly recommend this tour and guide 🤩", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/private-taj-mahal-agra-fort-fatehpur-day-trip/6179890/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Mihika", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-22", text: "We really enjoyed this tour. It was a convenient way to travel to Agra from Delhi and see three major monuments all in one day! Our driver Bablu was very good. The guides were also well informed. We recommend this tour for people who would like to see more things in a short amount of time.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/private-taj-mahal-agra-fort-fatehpur-day-trip/5270110/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/private-taj-mahal-agra-fort-fatehpur-day-trip/5270111/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/private-taj-mahal-agra-fort-fatehpur-day-trip/5270112/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Liliana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-03", text: "Taj Mahal was an amazing experience! Gulbahaar was an amazing guide and so patient with us, and he took beautiful photos too, like a professional, would definitely recommend it!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/private-taj-mahal-agra-fort-fatehpur-day-trip/5093824/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Natalia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-20", text: "Our guide Imran ali Khan in Taj Mahal and Agra Fort was great and his story was so inspiration! And our driver Jahoor khan was secured driving like an angel! Was so comfortable car and careful driving!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/private-taj-mahal-agra-fort-fatehpur-day-trip/3487926/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Diganta", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-04-30", text: "Visiting Agra 2nd time this time it was with friends. There was no other provider who can be as reliable as them. Again a very smooth trip, the guides were highly knowledgeable and made sure we understood each and everything. Once again I highly recommend this package, they are super friendly and accommodating. Thank you once again for helping us create amazing memories.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/private-taj-mahal-agra-fort-fatehpur-day-trip/410252/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/private-taj-mahal-agra-fort-fatehpur-day-trip/410253/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/private-taj-mahal-agra-fort-fatehpur-day-trip/410254/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Llúcia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-02", text: "Mehfooz – Your Guide of Agra We had an absolutely wonderful experience exploring Agra with Mehfooz as our guide. From the very beginning, he was professional, knowledgeable, and incredibly friendly. His deep understanding of the history and architecture of the magnificent Taj Mahal made our visit truly unforgettable. He explained every detail with passion and clarity, bringing the monument’s story to life. Not only did he guide us beautifully through the Taj Mahal, but his insights about Agra Fort and the rich heritage of Agra added so much value to our trip. He answered all our questions patiently and even helped us find the best photo spots! Mehfooz is honest, punctual, and genuinely cares about his guests having the best possible experience. If you are visiting Agra and want a guide who is knowledgeable, trustworthy, and passionate about his city, we highly recommend Mehfooz – Your Guide of Agra. Thank you, Mehfooz, for making our trip so memorable! 🌟" },
      { author: "Aneesa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-15", text: "Imran Ali Khan was my tour guide today, I was really happy that I booked this tour and would definitely recommend this tour to everyone. I'm a solo female traveller and Imran put me on ease, his english was impeccable and his knowledge was second to none. It was a really good experience that I thoroughly enjoyed." },
      { author: "Rishabh", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-10", text: "We had a fantastic experience exploring Agra with our guide, Gulshan. His knowledge brought each site to life — at the Taj Mahal, he shared captivating stories about Shah Jahan and his life, making the monument even more meaningful. At Fatehpur Sikri, we enjoyed fascinating tales about Emperor Akbar and his legendary court. We also visited the Baby Taj (Itmad-ud-Daula) and saw Agra Fort from the outside, all at a relaxed and comfortable pace. The car was clean and well-maintained, and cold bottled water was provided throughout — a thoughtful touch on a warm day. A well-organized, enriching tour — highly recommended!" },
      { author: "Dudu", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-10", text: "we first visited fatehpur sikri . My guide Mr Akhtar and my driver mr Shakeel both were very considerate . My driver even got for me a light breakfast on my way to fatehpur sikri as we started our tour from agra cantt railwaystation very early . Guide explained things in English . As I was the only person who booked that day for the tour it was more or less like a private tour . It was good having these two people guide me through agra . After fatehpur sikri we proceeded to Taj Mahal . Further more I was a solo female traveller and both my guide and driver kept me comfortable throughout my journey ." },
      { author: "A", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-30", text: "Incredible experience during my trip! It’s wonderful to hear how the guides, Varun Gupta made such an impact on your understanding of the Taj Mahal and Agra Fort with Great Photography with great explanations there history and Fatehpur Sikri With Waseem . Their passion for the history and culture of these sites really shines through in your words. It’s also great to know that everything was well-organized, and you were able to see and learn so much in just one day. The personalized experience with knowledgeable guides can really make a difference and it sounds trip was filled with rich insights and unforgettable moments. Thank you very much for given your best" },
      { author: "Ayeesha", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-03", text: "Was very interested in the history of both places which the guide managed to convey well" },
      { author: "Aris", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-23", text: "We had a very smooth pickup and driving experience with Masood. He was very friendly and skilled and did not try to redirect us to any unexpected locations. Mohammad, our guide, was excellent. Very knowledgeable and friendly and took lots of great photos of us - good angles and made us laugh so we looked less awkward. You will have to pay the cost of the tickets for Taj Mahal, Agra Fort, and Fatehpur Sikri separately and in cash to the guide, but do not worry - there is no markup. They will also take your passport for a few moments to fill out the form online. Getting into all the locations was extremely fast using their process for purchasing tickets and getting in the guide entrance, well worth the extra cost of the guide. We were also taken to some artisan shops where they show you how they make their craft and give you a sales pitch. Surprisingly this was a great part of the tour. The quality is infinitely better than the junk we saw in Delhi and the salespeople are respectful." },
    ],
  },
