  'ranthambore-tiger-safari-day-trip-from-jaipur-all': {
    averageRating: 2.15,
    totalReviews: 5,
    guideRating: 2.15,
    valueRating: 2.15,
    reviews: [
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2026-04-21", text: "So this tour was a total waste of money. I had booked it six months previously and was assured due to my early booking that I would be in zone 1 in a jeep as requested. The full description of the tour says that a visit to Rathambore fort is included however we were never taken to the fort and instead dumped in a canter, not a jeep, in zone 9. It was a certainty that in this zone there would not be a chance of seeing the tigers since it's desert like and the tigers usually go to the zones where there is water like in zones 1 or 2. Also the government approved guide could not speak English and was busy on his phone for most of the safari. This is a total rip off since you are charged the same amount yet put in a zone where there is no chance of seeing the tigers. Also the description is false and misleading. Save yourself the disappointment and waste of time and money and do not book with this company. It's a total rip off." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-12", text: "We saw a lot of animals in the national park. Unfortunately we had no luck with the tigers this time, but maybe next time. Pack warm clothes for the morning safaris :)" },
      { author: "Marie-France", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 2, date: "2023-12-30", text: "On nous vend un safari tigres et nous avons appris qu'il est extrêmement rare de voir les tigres.....nous avons payé extrêmement cher, pour voir des biches et des paons. Je déconseille." },
    ],
  },
