  'taj-mahal-sunrisesunset-and-city-sightseeings': {
    averageRating: 4.86,
    totalReviews: 9,
    guideRating: 4.86,
    valueRating: 4.86,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Anna Paola", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-13", text: "The tour has been really nice and it is worth the price. The Taj Mahal is just astonishing and with this tour you don't need to queue as the guide willl buy the ticket for you if you choose this option. The guide will also protect you from scammers and people trying to sell you every kind of things. The guide Khan was really nice, knowledgeable and even took really nice pictures of me. Munazir drive was safe and his car is clean and comfortable. He is a very nice guy and I highly recommend his services. Thank you very much Munazir!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-sunrisesunset-and-city-sightseeings/7135857/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-sunrisesunset-and-city-sightseeings/7135863/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-sunrisesunset-and-city-sightseeings/7135864/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Gabriel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-03", text: "My trip started with a very pleasant owner/driver named Munazir. He was equipped with a really new and super clean brand new car. Something I don’t usually experience in India. He then picked up my guide named Ali. Ali was also pleasant and knowledgable at the Mughal history. He looked after me throughout the trip and took my photos. They both are also very flexible and respect my time and work with my schedule. I opted to go to Taj View Hotel for lunch and they went their way and later waited for me. Overall, I was satisfied with the tour.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-sunrisesunset-and-city-sightseeings/2502715/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Anqi", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-04", text: "Excellent experience! Munazir welcomed me at Agra Cantt Railway Station with flowers at 10 am. Ali and Munazir showed me all the highlights of the city and dropped me off at the hotel. Clean and neat car. Ali was patiently explaining everything for me. Highly recommend this tour for anyone who only stays Agra for one night.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-sunrisesunset-and-city-sightseeings/2071951/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-sunrisesunset-and-city-sightseeings/2071952/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-sunrisesunset-and-city-sightseeings/2071953/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Noelle", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-19", text: "We werden vroeg opgehaald door chauffeur Munazir en naar de Taj Mahal gebracht. Daar ging alles vlot en konden we snel naar binnen om de zonsopgang te zien. Gids Khan ging gelijk foto’s maken nu de zonsopgang nog gaande was en vertelde daarna alles over de Taj Mahal. We hebben genoten en prachtige foto’s gemaakt. Daarna nog langs het Agra Fort gegaan en nog wat souvenirs gekocht. Het was een top excursie! Bedankt Munazir en Khan!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-sunrisesunset-and-city-sightseeings/6738698/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-sunrisesunset-and-city-sightseeings/6738707/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Cat", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-23", text: "I had the best tour from all of my many tours in 7days in India! The agency owner and driver, Munazir, is the sweetest guy, super friendly, and gave me a 5 star experience. His car is the best I had in India, spacious, sparkly clean, and he drives very carefully in the hectic traffic. He was always checking on me, making sure I was happy with everything, was flexible to adapt the tour to my wishes, and even got me lots of traditional indian sweets/snacks! I truly felt safe and welcomed like a friend :) My guide Shahjad Khan was also very friendly and took good care of me in all spots we visited, very knowledgeable and great photographer. I liked this tour so much that I booked Munazir for another tour in Agra + city transfer! I specially recommend Munazir for solo female travellers, he will make you feel relaxed & safe the whole way! I will not use any other guide in my future trips to India, only Munazir's agency Choice to India! Thanks again for everything 🙏🏻🪷" },
      { author: "Marina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-14", text: "Great tour with guide Ali and driver Munazir. Both of them were very nice ane helpful. Taj Mahal is a great experience, however we went in the afternoon, when is was very hot and busy. The best hours to visit Taj are early mornings or at the sunset." },
      { author: "Bernhard", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-03-14", text: "Netter Guide. Leider etwas schwieriges Englisch, hat aber gut geklappt. Ließ und sehr viel Luft zum selber entdecken. Taj Mahal hat uns mit ihm sehr gefallen. Leider auch mit Verkaufstour geknüpft." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-02", text: "Everything is good and easy. Tour guide explained everything very clear and detail. Highly recommend this tour." },
    ],
  },
