  'taj-mahal-tour-by-gatimaan-superfast-express-train': {
    averageRating: 5.0,
    totalReviews: 3,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "david", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-14", text: "The tour was conducted by Splendid Taj Holiday. It started from pick up from my hotel to express train. Guide, Parvez was very helpful and answers my questions, make sure I get to see the most during trip. Driver also drove around the city smoothly despite traffics and chaos on the street. I give a good recommendation on this agency and guide as well. Thank you", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-tour-by-gatimaan-superfast-express-train/8727866/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "John", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-27", text: "Splendid Taj Holidays looked after us incredibly well. We always thought it might be difficult for our daughter with the crowds and hustle, however, Parvez assured us he would be with us and take the tour at a pace that suited us and our daughter. Incredibly grateful for his presence. Tour-wise, they have an extensive knowledge of the area and gave us lots of information as we meandered through the Taj Mahal and Agra Fort. The Gatiman Express was excellent too. All booked, no problems. Their drivers picked us up on time and with plenty of time to take into account the extra traffic. Overall, I would recommend." },
      { author: "Brigitte", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-28", text: "Une journée parfaite en compagnie de notre guide Parvez Khan, tout était très bien organisé , depuis le matin avec prise en charge et retour le soir à l’hôtel . La visite du Taj Mahal et du fort d’Agra était très bien organisé par notre guide, qui était à nos petits soins , histoire du Taj Mahal et du fort d’Agra était très intéressante . Le déjeuner inclus , dans un bel endroit avec de très bons plats délicieux . J’ai vraiment apprécié cette visite avec notre guide qui était vraiment sympathique et qui faisait tout pour que l’on passe de très bons moments pour avoir de beaux souvenirs . Visite que je recommande" },
    ],
  },
