  'taj-mahal-tour-skip-the-line-all-inclusive-with': {
    averageRating: 4.92,
    totalReviews: 69,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 4.89,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Hannah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-23", text: "We had an amazing day with Saif and driver Amit. We booked the sunrise tour for the Taj Mahal and also visited Agra Fort and Baby Taj. The car and driver were amazing with A/C and cold water provided. Saif is extremely knowledgeable about the history of the monuments and provided amazing facts and information which really brought the tour to life. He also knew all the great spots for photos and helped and encouraged myself and my partner to take as many photos as we wanted to and took lots of photos for us too! We went to a local place for breakfast too which was delicious, authentic and really affordable. Would 100% recommend the tour with Saif.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-tour-skip-the-line-all-inclusive-with/3918004/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-tour-skip-the-line-all-inclusive-with/3918005/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-tour-skip-the-line-all-inclusive-with/3918007/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Florian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-23", text: "Great tour and our guide was perfect. Very informative and overall all perfect", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-tour-skip-the-line-all-inclusive-with/2015058/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-tour-skip-the-line-all-inclusive-with/2015059/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-tour-skip-the-line-all-inclusive-with/2015066/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Vladimir", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-01", text: "I had an amazing experience with Ali Akbar! We skipped all the lines and he kindly showed me around the majestic Taj Mahal and the Red Fort of Agra. He also provided very interesting details about the history and architecture of the monuments. Everything was very well organized, punctual and friendly. Thank you very much for an amazing experience!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-tour-skip-the-line-all-inclusive-with/1570185/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Robbyn", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-04", text: "Driver and Ali were on time and prompt. He was very knowledgable and knew all the good spots for photos. Excellent customer service and very friendly. Highly recommend for your trip to Agra, go at sunrise for the most peaceful experience. Thank you, Ali :)", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-tour-skip-the-line-all-inclusive-with/1419160/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Dennis", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-10-16", text: "Saif Very good daytrip with lots of knowledge from the guide. He was very friendly, took all the time we needed, and we really enjoyed it as a family. Highly recommrned Skip-the-line Taj Mahal Tour", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-tour-skip-the-line-all-inclusive-with/1295122/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-tour-skip-the-line-all-inclusive-with/1295123/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-tour-skip-the-line-all-inclusive-with/1295124/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Timo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-10-03", text: "We had a great experience with our guide (Raghu) and driver (Manmohan) visiting the Agra Fort and Taj Mahal. Especially the Taj Mahal is a breathtaking monument, for which it is worth to get a guide. We recommend this private tour to everyone!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-tour-skip-the-line-all-inclusive-with/1206504/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-tour-skip-the-line-all-inclusive-with/1206505/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-tour-skip-the-line-all-inclusive-with/1206506/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Sheam", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-08-25", text: "MS was very knowledgeable about Taj Mahal, Agra Fort and everything in general. He took his time to answering all our questions. He even gave us few tips regarding travelling around Agra and took many pictures of us. I would book any activity with MS again. A must do!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-tour-skip-the-line-all-inclusive-with/935938/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-tour-skip-the-line-all-inclusive-with/935939/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-tour-skip-the-line-all-inclusive-with/935940/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Ruddy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-02-15", text: "Smith is an excellent guide and story teller . He helped me also with pictures (who don’t like a good picture right?). Smith is also very flexible with the itinerary which is extra points for me . Mossin is also excellent driver. Overall experience is outstanding. Do book this trip if you only have a day to explore Agra. Free of hassle.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-tour-skip-the-line-all-inclusive-with/193107/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Tatiana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-01-23", text: "Saif did a wonderful job. He is knowledgeable, polite and friendly. We specially appreciated how chill he was, never rushed us, we felt like we had all the time in the world. He took great photos of our group and was ready with tips and additional information like what not to bring (lots of items are not allowed in, like food and certain electronics) Getting in and out of Agra Fort and Taj Mahal was seamless. We highly recommend Saif (Mohammad Saif). Last but not least the monuments are awe inspiring, definitely worth seeing at least once in your life. Beautiful, intricate works, jewels of world architecture.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-tour-skip-the-line-all-inclusive-with/167189/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-tour-skip-the-line-all-inclusive-with/167190/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-tour-skip-the-line-all-inclusive-with/167191/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "John", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-28", text: "Saif was an amazing guide and knew English really well and we appreciated him eating with us. Great tour of Agra Fort and Taj Mahal." },
      { author: "Mohammad", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-23", text: "If you are in Delhi, this day trip to the Taj Mahal and Agra Fort is an absolute must-do. It offers plenty of time to explore both iconic monuments at your own pace, allowing you to truly appreciate their beauty and historical significance. Our tour guide, Mohd, was incredibly knowledgeable, providing fascinating insights while also being flexible and accommodating to our needs. The driver was friendly, engaging in pleasant conversations throughout the journey, and despite the sometimes chaotic traffic in India, we always felt completely safe in his hands. Overall, it was a well-organized and enjoyable experience that we would highly recommend!" },
      { author: "Amanda", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-05", text: "We had our own private guide which was an unexpected bonus. Our guide was extremely knowledgeable and friendly. Also great to have tickets purchased for you and avoid the queues and chaos! While the Taj Mahal is beautiful, it's 100% having a guide as you will learn so much more about it's history and how it was built." },
    ],
  },
