  'taj-mahal-tour-with-optional-wildlife-rescue': {
    averageRating: 4.85,
    totalReviews: 12,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Orlando", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-20", text: "Visiting India for the 1st time, I absolutely had a great experience with Faisal, great service and very reliable! I would definitely recommend him" },
      { author: "Awahan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-20", text: "Shah Rukh Khan was very detailed on explaining stuff. Made sure I see the important places! The whole process was smooth!" },
      { author: "Kaspars Blums", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-02-17", text: "This experience was unforgettable! Our driver picked us up at our hotel in New Delhi and brought us to Elephant SOS center! This experience was life changing! We totally changed our perspective about elephants in entertainment business! There were lot of tears too! Then our driver Jeevam brought us to Taj Mahal! Our guide Faisal was super! Learned so much about this amazing place! Faisal answered to all of our questions and this was really nice experience! Totally worth it! Thank you!" },
      { author: "Kira", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-02-06", text: "Loved it. Great tour with Faisal. He was very informative, professional, and made us feel welcome and safe. Definitely would recommend this tour with him! We were on the fence about doing this tour or not and are so happy we did. If you only have a day in Delhi this is a great way to spend it." },
      { author: "Danilo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-01-22", text: "The pickup and trip by the driver Amit was easy-going, punctual, and enjoyable. After, the smile and knowledge of Vinod Kumar guiding the tour in Agra was also pleasant. So I recommend anyone willing to have an excellent experience in Agra to give it a try to this tour" },
      { author: "Michał", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-01-14", text: "Perfect trip with a perfect driver and guide! Tour was organized very professionally. Faisal is very nice guy showed us everything and told us some good stories about Taj Mahal. I highly recommend this guide for every Agra visit!" },
      { author: "Tanveer", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-11-26", text: "Wonder full day and appreciable for all Things he guide very well all Things ." },
      { author: "Pierluigi", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-11-18", text: "The trip was really amazing, both Taj Mahal and rescue center were fantastic. Faisel was a great guide in Taj Mahal, he explained everything in details, answering also all my questions." },
      { author: "M", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-25", text: "Faisal è una guida veramente bravissima, una persona disponibile,educata e gentile sotto ogni punto. Consiglio davvero il tour con lui. Mi sono trovata benissimo anche con il driver, una persona veramente gentile , disponibile,educata. Grazie , sicuramente farò altri tour con voi quando torno a Delhi" },
      { author: "Nelly", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-01-28", text: "Una experiencia maravillosa, desde el inicio hasta el final. Definitivamente la atención de Smith fue excelente, él es demasiado amable, atento y toma las mejores fotos hehehe Les recomiendo mucho este tour ❤️" },
      { author: "Ieva", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 2, date: "2024-01-13", text: "The trip was organized poorly. Neither the driver, nor the guide knew the programme. Probably it’s the company’s fault. The guide though, made a nice tour around Taj Mahal, however, although Agra Fort tour was included in our package, he said it’s not worth it and instead of the city tour, he took us to 2 handicraft shops (they were nice but the workers there were too persistent to sell us something) and that was it of Agra. When we asked about the elephant rescue part, the guide and the driver both were lost and needed to contact the company to confirm our details and they even asked us the adress. The driver finally took us there and the experience was amazing (due to the effort of the person working there). However, although bear rescue center was included in the itinerary, we did not go there. However, kudos to the driver and the guide at the elephant center for their great work. Would never travel again or recommend the same company though." },
    ],
  },
