  'taj-mahal-visits-private-tour-with-licensed-tour': {
    averageRating: 4.53,
    totalReviews: 223,
    guideRating: 4.74,
    valueRating: 4.35,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Mohammad", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-22", text: "Taj Mahal, Agra Fort, then Itimad-ud-Daulah. A journey made 10x more joyful with Zeeshan who’s extremely knowledgable about the history of these marvellous places. Explaining the story behind every square inch while navigating he made me go back in history. Another key benefit is that he knows the best spots to see and take photos, as well as saving you the hassle of dealing with fake guides/sellers or facing trouble in general. Whether going with a group or solo, I can’t stress enough how important it is to have a guide like Zeeshan when visiting.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-visits-private-tour-with-licensed-tour/3902771/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-visits-private-tour-with-licensed-tour/3902772/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-visits-private-tour-with-licensed-tour/3902773/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Mac", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-01", text: "The tour guide was so friendly! Zeeshan was really good! He take as on the spots for good picture👌 Recommended!!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-visits-private-tour-with-licensed-tour/1883797/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-visits-private-tour-with-licensed-tour/1883798/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-visits-private-tour-with-licensed-tour/1883799/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Erica", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-31", text: "Zeeshan was our guide. The tour was really good! Interesting information, friendly guide and good English. We enjoyed it 😀. Also good arranged; we met the guide at our hotel, he already bought our tickets, he helped us with our transport to Agra Fort." },
      { author: "Angus", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-02", text: "The guide was quite unbelievable. Patient, passionate, enthusiastic and exceptionally knowledgeable. Would thoroughly recommend Zeeshan to anyone visiting this magical location." },
      { author: "Alessandra", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-09", text: "Zeeshan was an amazing guide, not only for his amazing ability to explain the history of Taj Mahal but also in being an amazing local guide that can suggest you the best skills and places to see. It’s not easy to go around alone as a woman in the world sometimes. All you wish is to meet honest and lovely people like him." },
      { author: "Wong Ik", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-11", text: "Our guide Zesshan is very knowledgable and experienced, he provided us with a lot of information and guide during the tour, and very helpful in take care for us from the street sellers' approach. He knows all the pictursque spots and help us take lots of really good photos! *trust me I'm a photographer* =) Definitely would recommend this tour package to anyone who like to visit Taj Mahal!" },
      { author: "Gearoid", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-08-05", text: "Our guide, Zeeshan, was extremely friendly and knowledgeable. Would highly recommend!" },
      { author: "Andy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-03-14", text: "Kapil is a great guide. He helped us through all the lines and explained the history of the Taj Mahal very well. His English was very good and we had a great tour." },
      { author: "Emma", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-02-29", text: "Neeraj was very knowledgeable and had a very nice manner, we enjoyed our tour with him. The organisers were communicative beforehand too. The Taj Mahal is a beautiful place and I’d highly recommend having the guide!" },
      { author: "Carlos", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-02-12", text: "It was excellent, the guide was great and knowledgeable. However we paid for “skip the line” and when we arrived there was no skip the line option. “Get Your Guide” should assure this is an option prior us paying for it. Thank you!" },
      { author: "tim", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-01-28", text: "We had a wonderful trip to Taj Mahal. We were well informed and well taken care of from booking, all communications and the tour itself. Our guide was kind, knowledgeable about the history, spoke excellent English, and knew the ins-outs of the site’s logistics. We had a super experience and can happily recommend booking your trip with these good people." },
      { author: "Tudor", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-11-18", text: "Great experience with best vibes! Guide is a very nice person willing to respond to questions and helping! He took us pictures and made us feel great!🙏🏻🌼" },
    ],
  },
